(306762, 22758, 6035, '<td valign="top">i like the choice of colors, and the softness of it is nice, but that fading gradient border.... maybe i''ve just seen it too much, but it doesn''t do it justice. a nice simple border would have done just as fine if not better for me.</td>', 'i like the choice of colors, and the softness of it is nice, but that fading gradient border.... maybe i''ve just seen it too much, but it doesn''t do it justice. a nice simple border would have done just as fine if not better for me.', '2003-05-26 01:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(306763, 22295, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful work... this has some emotional appeal as well... the contrast and general tonal range of this image is perfect... black sand.... that really sets off the dead crab.... hawaii maybe?... great work... = 10</td>', 'beautiful work... this has some emotional appeal as well... the contrast and general tonal range of this image is perfect... black sand.... that really sets off the dead crab.... hawaii maybe?... great work... = 10', '2003-05-26 01:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(306764, 22308, 7653, '<td valign="top">Need to see more of the eyes. Focus appears to be stronger on the hat than on the face.</td>', 'Need to see more of the eyes. Focus appears to be stronger on the hat than on the face.', '2003-05-26 01:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(306765, 22305, 6035, '<td valign="top">the lighting and composition in this photo is great but something seems to be missing to make me say "wow" ..</td>', 'the lighting and composition in this photo is great but something seems to be missing to make me say "wow" ..', '2003-05-26 01:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(306766, 22491, 6035, '<td valign="top">ahh, i love IR photography, which this one looks like it could be.. (or just some post-processing trick :P) either way, i love it.</td>', 'ahh, i love IR photography, which this one looks like it could be.. (or just some post-processing trick :P) either way, i love it.', '2003-05-26 01:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(306767, 22692, 6870, '<td valign="top">Hmm. This could be titled "America''s Pasttime" alluding to football. It could also be "Americans Pass Time" alluding to the boy and his playing. Which did you have in mind? Otherwise, this is a really engaging, interesting photo! The flag really frames the boy well. Sepia gives the whole a nostalgic feeling.</td>', 'Hmm. This could be titled "America''s Pasttime" alluding to football. It could also be "Americans Pass Time" alluding to the boy and his playing. Which did you have in mind? Otherwise, this is a really engaging, interesting photo! The flag really frames the boy well. Sepia gives the whole a nostalgic feeling.', '2003-05-26 01:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(306768, 22283, 6870, '<td valign="top">You may get flogged for this one, but I for one love the grain!</td>', 'You may get flogged for this one, but I for one love the grain!', '2003-05-26 01:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(306769, 22637, 7653, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is nice. I like that dark shadow as a second feather against the gray reflective surface. If onlty it (reflective) could have been maybe lighter? (9.4)</td>', 'Wow, this is nice. I like that dark shadow as a second feather against the gray reflective surface. If onlty it (reflective) could have been maybe lighter? (9.4)', '2003-05-26 01:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(306770, 22490, 6870, '<td valign="top">You make a common object interesting!</td>', 'You make a common object interesting!', '2003-05-26 01:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(306772, 22787, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot... not many people seem to work with waterfalls in black and white, but this one is quite nice... the exposure is just about perfect... I really love the way the logs are arranged at the bottom... beautiful work :) = 10</td>', 'beautiful shot... not many people seem to work with waterfalls in black and white, but this one is quite nice... the exposure is just about perfect... I really love the way the logs are arranged at the bottom... beautiful work :) = 10', '2003-05-26 01:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(306773, 22082, 6870, '<td valign="top">Stunning! perfect lighting, wonderful composition, everything fits together here! 10</td>', 'Stunning! perfect lighting, wonderful composition, everything fits together here! 10', '2003-05-26 01:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(306774, 22510, 6035, '<td valign="top">the composition is nice, but the choice of colors wouldn''t be my first. The snow''s yellow is a bit harsh for me.</td>', 'the composition is nice, but the choice of colors wouldn''t be my first. The snow''s yellow is a bit harsh for me.', '2003-05-26 01:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(306776, 22635, 6035, '<td valign="top">interesting take on the glass/water theme.. but i think because of the straw, it''s making an optical illusion of the table being unlevel.</td>', 'interesting take on the glass/water theme.. but i think because of the straw, it''s making an optical illusion of the table being unlevel.', '2003-05-26 01:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(306778, 22792, 6870, '<td valign="top">You''ll have to give us the scoop on this one! Stunning! Excellent composition and lighting. Wow. 10</td>', 'You''ll have to give us the scoop on this one! Stunning! Excellent composition and lighting. Wow. 10', '2003-05-26 01:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(306782, 22145, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very touching. Excellent composition and lighting. well done!</td>', 'Very touching. Excellent composition and lighting. well done!', '2003-05-26 01:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(306785, 22470, 6035, '<td valign="top">it''s technically nice.. good lighting, nice composition.. it''s just not very interesting to me..</td>', 'it''s technically nice.. good lighting, nice composition.. it''s just not very interesting to me..', '2003-05-26 02:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(306787, 22462, 1717, '<td valign="top">i really like this!  it''s bright, yet has a nice soft feel to it.  a little busy, but it makes me feel like there''s a breeze blowing.  nice work!</td>', 'i really like this!  it''s bright, yet has a nice soft feel to it.  a little busy, but it makes me feel like there''s a breeze blowing.  nice work!', '2003-05-26 02:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(306789, 22750, 6035, '<td valign="top">good shot, you can see alot of things in this photo.. movement, emotion.. the composition is nice, with the subject right in the middle. i''m not quite sure sepia would have been the best choice, but it seems to work good enough.</td>', 'good shot, you can see alot of things in this photo.. movement, emotion.. the composition is nice, with the subject right in the middle. i''m not quite sure sepia would have been the best choice, but it seems to work good enough.', '2003-05-26 02:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(306790, 22703, 4967, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.... looks like an oldtime photo, which is what I''m guessing you were going for.  There are some things that really bother me here though... There is quite a bit of extra space at the top, and the feet are cut off, but only slightly... filling the frame is always good, I would have positioned the camera differently, so that you got the entire subjects in the photo, and didn''t leave as much room at the top.  Watch Your Background!  The window frame looks like it'' half coming out of the girls head on the left, and completely growing out of the man''s head.  Also the business of thee background detracts from the subjeect, using a lower DOF, to clean up the background, would have helped this a lot.</td>', 'Very interesting.... looks like an oldtime photo, which is what I''m guessing you were going for.  There are some things that really bother me here though... There is quite a bit of extra space at the top, and the feet are cut off, but only slightly... filling the frame is always good, I would have positioned the camera differently, so that you got the entire subjects in the photo, and didn''t leave as much room at the top.  Watch Your Background!  The window frame looks like it'' half coming out of the girls head on the left, and completely growing out of the man''s head.  Also the business of thee background detracts from the subjeect, using a lower DOF, to clean up the background, would have helped this a lot.', '2003-05-26 02:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(306791, 22637, 6600, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Love the contrast and sharpness of the whole image.  Has a nice POP value to it.  Great job!</td>', 'Very nice!  Love the contrast and sharpness of the whole image.  Has a nice POP value to it.  Great job!', '2003-05-26 02:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(306792, 22693, 4494, '<td valign="top">Good subject for this challenge with the black and white.  The "sepia" effect may be a little too much but I''m no expert.  Good shot, great subject matter in the pic.</td>', 'Good subject for this challenge with the black and white.  The "sepia" effect may be a little too much but I''m no expert.  Good shot, great subject matter in the pic.', '2003-05-26 02:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(306794, 22628, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very nice texture in the rose.  I was expecting more of a B&amp;W type image but I guess the tone color is up to the photographer.  Good job!</td>', 'Very nice texture in the rose.  I was expecting more of a B&W type image but I guess the tone color is up to the photographer.  Good job!', '2003-05-26 02:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(306795, 22628, 6035, '<td valign="top">great macro.The composition is nice and  the red duotine does well.</td>', 'great macro.The composition is nice and  the red duotine does well.', '2003-05-26 02:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(306798, 22680, 1717, '<td valign="top">whoa!  amazing shot!  it has a 3-D effect to it.  looks like the beetle could crawl right out of the pic!  well done!</td>', 'whoa!  amazing shot!  it has a 3-D effect to it.  looks like the beetle could crawl right out of the pic!  well done!', '2003-05-26 02:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(306799, 22490, 4494, '<td valign="top">Cool angle and focus on the top metal part.  But I think the image needs darker parts.  The shadows (the dark parts) should be almost completely black.</td>', 'Cool angle and focus on the top metal part.  But I think the image needs darker parts.  The shadows (the dark parts) should be almost completely black.', '2003-05-26 02:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(306801, 22633, 4494, '<td valign="top">That is awsome.  I love the deep strong contrast between the front and back of the structure.  And the clouds are spectacular.  Great job!  8.</td>', 'That is awsome.  I love the deep strong contrast between the front and back of the structure.  And the clouds are spectacular.  Great job!  8.', '2003-05-26 02:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(306802, 22726, 4494, '<td valign="top">Seems like there are too many different colors in this to meet the challenge.  Great shot and lighting however!</td>', 'Seems like there are too many different colors in this to meet the challenge.  Great shot and lighting however!', '2003-05-26 02:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(306803, 22458, 5391, '<td valign="top">Brilliant - this stands out to me as the best image when looking at the thumbnails.  Upon closer inspection, I''d like to see the top right corner in a bit sharper focus, but this is so clever, very well done.  Fine art.  9</td>', 'Brilliant - this stands out to me as the best image when looking at the thumbnails.  Upon closer inspection, I''d like to see the top right corner in a bit sharper focus, but this is so clever, very well done.  Fine art.  9', '2003-05-26 02:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(306804, 22697, 4494, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast but I think there''s to much red tone in this, and not enough white (ie. to much "mid-tones" and greys).</td>', 'Nice contrast but I think there''s to much red tone in this, and not enough white (ie. to much "mid-tones" and greys).', '2003-05-26 02:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(306805, 22632, 4494, '<td valign="top">What a great shot!  Love the expression and pose of the baby.  May be a little too much white in it.  Should have tweaked the dark tones a little more more.</td>', 'What a great shot!  Love the expression and pose of the baby.  May be a little too much white in it.  Should have tweaked the dark tones a little more more.', '2003-05-26 02:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(306807, 22698, 4494, '<td valign="top">The white part is a little "blown out".  Should have made that part more grey (like the middle part) and then have the middle part a darker grey.  Still a nice shot however.</td>', 'The white part is a little "blown out".  Should have made that part more grey (like the middle part) and then have the middle part a darker grey.  Still a nice shot however.', '2003-05-26 02:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(306808, 22500, 4494, '<td valign="top">Nice white to black color range.  I''m not sure I like the blur effect you used.  A sharp image for this one might have been better.</td>', 'Nice white to black color range.  I''m not sure I like the blur effect you used.  A sharp image for this one might have been better.', '2003-05-26 02:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(306811, 22510, 4494, '<td valign="top">Hmm.  The bad thing about the tone you''ve choosen is, it sends a mixed msg of what the pic is about...  warm colors but a cold subject. :(  You should have used a slightly blue tone instead.<br/></td>', 'Hmm.  The bad thing about the tone you''ve choosen is, it sends a mixed msg of what the pic is about...  warm colors but a cold subject. :(  You should have used a slightly blue tone instead.', '2003-05-26 02:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(306812, 22248, 6771, '<td valign="top">Interesting color choice.  bit OOF and harsh lighting on the nose.  Was this picture taken in lowlight/darkness?</td>', 'Interesting color choice.  bit OOF and harsh lighting on the nose.  Was this picture taken in lowlight/darkness?', '2003-05-26 02:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(306813, 22752, 1717, '<td valign="top">gutsy shot...unfortunately, not a duotone...at least, not as i understand it.</td>', 'gutsy shot...unfortunately, not a duotone...at least, not as i understand it.', '2003-05-26 02:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(306814, 22057, 4494, '<td valign="top">The tone is a little over-whelming.  Maybe try less saturation next time and slightly less green.</td>', 'The tone is a little over-whelming.  Maybe try less saturation next time and slightly less green.', '2003-05-26 02:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
