(306925, 22401, 6893, '<td valign="top">Yours proves beauty can be found anywhere if a person just takes a moment to look.9</td>', 'Yours proves beauty can be found anywhere if a person just takes a moment to look.9', '2003-05-26 05:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(306926, 22305, 6893, '<td valign="top">The street is a bit on the dark side but the overall mood is one of a time on the edge of bieng forgotten. 7</td>', 'The street is a bit on the dark side but the overall mood is one of a time on the edge of bieng forgotten. 7', '2003-05-26 05:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(306927, 22758, 6893, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems off. Nice thought though.</td>', 'Lighting seems off. Nice thought though.', '2003-05-26 05:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(306935, 22700, 6155, '<td valign="top">i think this is a very striking image, i am not sure why i like it but at the moment iam going to give it a 9, maybe a ten later</td>', 'i think this is a very striking image, i am not sure why i like it but at the moment iam going to give it a 9, maybe a ten later', '2003-05-26 07:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(306936, 22705, 6155, '<td valign="top">if there ever was an image to do in sepia this is it, this is a beautiful picture, also reminds me of U2''s Unforgetabble Fire album cover <br/>9 for now could go to 10</td>', 'if there ever was an image to do in sepia this is it, this is a beautiful picture, also reminds me of U2''s Unforgetabble Fire album cover 9 for now could go to 10', '2003-05-26 07:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(306937, 22729, 6155, '<td valign="top">seems a little unbalanced,  the lwaves on the bottom are so much bigger than the bloom, but still a good pic 7</td>', 'seems a little unbalanced,  the lwaves on the bottom are so much bigger than the bloom, but still a good pic 7', '2003-05-26 07:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(306938, 22685, 4811, '<td valign="top">You''ve got the makings of a great shot but a histogram would tell you the image is underexposed. More a contrast problem though,,,all your shades of grey are closest to black.<br/> <br/>Use a levels adjustment and move the rightmost slider to the beginning of the histogram... you''ll be amazed at what this one correction does to the picture!!</td>', 'You''ve got the makings of a great shot but a histogram would tell you the image is underexposed. More a contrast problem though,,,all your shades of grey are closest to black. Use a levels adjustment and move the rightmost slider to the beginning of the histogram... you''ll be amazed at what this one correction does to the picture!!', '2003-05-26 08:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(306942, 22777, 2195, '<td valign="top">The trees in the left handcorner and the two garage doors in the background detract alot from what could be great photo. The  abanoned building , cliff, sea and mist are great elements, they just need to be isolated if possible.</td>', 'The trees in the left handcorner and the two garage doors in the background detract alot from what could be great photo. The  abanoned building , cliff, sea and mist are great elements, they just need to be isolated if possible.', '2003-05-26 09:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(306944, 22777, 4285, '<td valign="top">You should have cropped out the entire left 1/3 of the shot in my opinion. The ball field/lights in the background takes away from the ancient feel of the shot. Otherwise a great shot. 6</td>', 'You should have cropped out the entire left 1/3 of the shot in my opinion. The ball field/lights in the background takes away from the ancient feel of the shot. Otherwise a great shot. 6', '2003-05-26 09:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(306946, 22618, 2011, '<td valign="top">Good job with the back lighting, and nice clean surface.</td>', 'Good job with the back lighting, and nice clean surface.', '2003-05-26 09:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(306947, 22730, 2217, '<td valign="top">Such a nice photograph, it could use a lighter border.  I like your use of textures, contrasts and sepia.</td>', 'Such a nice photograph, it could use a lighter border.  I like your use of textures, contrasts and sepia.', '2003-05-26 09:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(306948, 22626, 4285, '<td valign="top">I like sepia but I think plain B and W would have been a better choice for this particular shot. The yellow/green cast I don''t like. 6</td>', 'I like sepia but I think plain B and W would have been a better choice for this particular shot. The yellow/green cast I don''t like. 6', '2003-05-26 09:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(306949, 22743, 7543, '<td valign="top">Great shot, great composition! 8</td>', 'Great shot, great composition! 8', '2003-05-26 09:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(306951, 22726, 7543, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t look like a duotone to me. Lovely subject, great shot, nice smile. 7</td>', 'This doesn''t look like a duotone to me. Lovely subject, great shot, nice smile. 7', '2003-05-26 09:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(306952, 22763, 7543, '<td valign="top">A very different pic, I like it</td>', 'A very different pic, I like it', '2003-05-26 09:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(306953, 22463, 7543, '<td valign="top">Great expressions, nicely done. 7</td>', 'Great expressions, nicely done. 7', '2003-05-26 09:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(306954, 22420, 4285, '<td valign="top">As a duotone the pic meets the criteria. As a portrait, your model is obviously very pretty. What is distracting about this shot is the "knowing" look on her face. It looks too posed. If she had been "a thousand miles away" in her mind, the shot would have been killer. 6</td>', 'As a duotone the pic meets the criteria. As a portrait, your model is obviously very pretty. What is distracting about this shot is the "knowing" look on her face. It looks too posed. If she had been "a thousand miles away" in her mind, the shot would have been killer. 6', '2003-05-26 09:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(306955, 22510, 7543, '<td valign="top">The frame looks a bit wierd to me, maybe you put the frame on before you made some adjustments and sharpening. The snow might be a bit whiter.</td>', 'The frame looks a bit wierd to me, maybe you put the frame on before you made some adjustments and sharpening. The snow might be a bit whiter.', '2003-05-26 09:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(306957, 22733, 7758, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.... the detail in the pine cone is quite interesting.... I find the white background a little stark though.... I might have cropped tighter and not had the entire shape in the frame.... just my 2 cents worth... good luck, Todd.</td>', 'Interesting image.... the detail in the pine cone is quite interesting.... I find the white background a little stark though.... I might have cropped tighter and not had the entire shape in the frame.... just my 2 cents worth... good luck, Todd.', '2003-05-26 09:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(306959, 22752, 4285, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Too bad you didn''t "doutone" it.  Sepia wouldn''t have worked as well as B &amp; W in this case. Why did you not convert to B &amp; W is my only question? You entered the wrong pic didn''t you? Too bad. Sorry. 5</td>', 'Great shot. Too bad you didn''t "doutone" it.  Sepia wouldn''t have worked as well as B & W in this case. Why did you not convert to B & W is my only question? You entered the wrong pic didn''t you? Too bad. Sorry. 5', '2003-05-26 09:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(306961, 22744, 7758, '<td valign="top">Good imagery, I like the ''family history'' feel to it..... good luck, Todd.</td>', 'Good imagery, I like the ''family history'' feel to it..... good luck, Todd.', '2003-05-26 09:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(306964, 22763, 4285, '<td valign="top">Great concept and setup. Too bad you couldn''t get your background and hood a little darker. You can see the wrinkled backdrop and the lint on the hood is also distracting. It''s been my experience at DPC that people really pick up on the little things. I guess I gotta follow suit. Cheers. 7 (could have been an 8)</td>', 'Great concept and setup. Too bad you couldn''t get your background and hood a little darker. You can see the wrinkled backdrop and the lint on the hood is also distracting. It''s been my experience at DPC that people really pick up on the little things. I guess I gotta follow suit. Cheers. 7 (could have been an 8)', '2003-05-26 09:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(306965, 22732, 6900, '<td valign="top">This screams to me "10!!!!"  It is also one of those pictures that will not do so well on dpc...good luck, I''m pulling for this image.  It''s stunning focus highlights a wonderful composition.  If I were to change anything, I''d make the face of the guitar more oblique so that you could see "down the length of it."  That''s about it. 10.</td>', 'This screams to me "10!!!!"  It is also one of those pictures that will not do so well on dpc...good luck, I''m pulling for this image.  It''s stunning focus highlights a wonderful composition.  If I were to change anything, I''d make the face of the guitar more oblique so that you could see "down the length of it."  That''s about it. 10.', '2003-05-26 09:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(306966, 22703, 7758, '<td valign="top">I like the concept here.... it really has the look of an old photo.... I think what lets it down is the people in the picture appear to have no interaction with each other, and almost look uncomfortable standing there together.... and I think you either needed the feet in or out of the picture... not half in half out.... overall though it is a good shot.... good luck, Todd.</td>', 'I like the concept here.... it really has the look of an old photo.... I think what lets it down is the people in the picture appear to have no interaction with each other, and almost look uncomfortable standing there together.... and I think you either needed the feet in or out of the picture... not half in half out.... overall though it is a good shot.... good luck, Todd.', '2003-05-26 09:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(306967, 22637, 4285, '<td valign="top">Great shot. A less battered feather would have made a killer shot. Just my opinion. The clarity of the shot is exceptional. 7 (I haven''t seen an 8 yet this challenge)</td>', 'Great shot. A less battered feather would have made a killer shot. Just my opinion. The clarity of the shot is exceptional. 7 (I haven''t seen an 8 yet this challenge)', '2003-05-26 09:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(306969, 22149, 7758, '<td valign="top">nice image.... I might have lifted the contrast a little.... I like the way you have captured the light in the plant and on the hair and his nose.... good luck, Todd.</td>', 'nice image.... I might have lifted the contrast a little.... I like the way you have captured the light in the plant and on the hair and his nose.... good luck, Todd.', '2003-05-26 09:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(306971, 22215, 6900, '<td valign="top">How''d you GET here to take this!!??  Nice shot!</td>', 'How''d you GET here to take this!!??  Nice shot!', '2003-05-26 09:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(306972, 22763, 7758, '<td valign="top">great shot..... I think it would be infinantly better if you darkened it and raised the contrast..... the hand looks a little too light and the backdrop is a little too obvious.... also I find the little dust and threads on the hood a little distracting.... definately worth reshooting.... I love the reflection in the sword.... love the composition, just need to improve the execution in my opinion... good luck, Todd.</td>', 'great shot..... I think it would be infinantly better if you darkened it and raised the contrast..... the hand looks a little too light and the backdrop is a little too obvious.... also I find the little dust and threads on the hood a little distracting.... definately worth reshooting.... I love the reflection in the sword.... love the composition, just need to improve the execution in my opinion... good luck, Todd.', '2003-05-26 10:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(306973, 22635, 6900, '<td valign="top">It wouldn''t be a DPC challenge without at least one remake of a high-scoring Setzler or Jacko pic. ;)  7</td>', 'It wouldn''t be a DPC challenge without at least one remake of a high-scoring Setzler or Jacko pic. ;)  7', '2003-05-26 10:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(306974, 22685, 7800, '<td valign="top">Sweet little girl. I think that the picture is a bit too dark however. Her skin should be lighter. Nice composition though.</td>', 'Sweet little girl. I think that the picture is a bit too dark however. Her skin should be lighter. Nice composition though.', '2003-05-26 10:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(306975, 22755, 7800, '<td valign="top">Focus seems a tad soft. You caught a lovely expression and great composition.</td>', 'Focus seems a tad soft. You caught a lovely expression and great composition.', '2003-05-26 10:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(306976, 22724, 7800, '<td valign="top">The color tone is gorgeous. I wish you''d set the shot up on something other than that table though. I think the grain in the table is competing w/ the rest of the image.</td>', 'The color tone is gorgeous. I wish you''d set the shot up on something other than that table though. I think the grain in the table is competing w/ the rest of the image.', '2003-05-26 10:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(306977, 22463, 7800, '<td valign="top">Neat shot and great color. The silence doesn''t look ''comfortable'' to me though. Looks like the man is sternly looking at the dog and the dog is like ''I''m busted''. Hee.</td>', 'Neat shot and great color. The silence doesn''t look ''comfortable'' to me though. Looks like the man is sternly looking at the dog and the dog is like ''I''m busted''. Hee.', '2003-05-26 10:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(306979, 22683, 7800, '<td valign="top">Too much of the frame is black for my taste.</td>', 'Too much of the frame is black for my taste.', '2003-05-26 10:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(306980, 22753, 7758, '<td valign="top">I think this shot has potential, I think that you loose the bottle into the shadow a bit too much.... maybe if you could see a little more of the light between the bottle and the shadow cast by the alcove.... not sure..... could maybe have made it a little lighter or more contrasty to bring out the whites a little more.... it just doesn''t quite work for me but I am not sure exactly what it is that doesn''t work for me... helpful? probably not! IT''s on the verge of a good shot and composition in my opinion...... good luck, Todd.</td>', 'I think this shot has potential, I think that you loose the bottle into the shadow a bit too much.... maybe if you could see a little more of the light between the bottle and the shadow cast by the alcove.... not sure..... could maybe have made it a little lighter or more contrasty to bring out the whites a little more.... it just doesn''t quite work for me but I am not sure exactly what it is that doesn''t work for me... helpful? probably not! IT''s on the verge of a good shot and composition in my opinion...... good luck, Todd.', '2003-05-26 10:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(306982, 22683, 7758, '<td valign="top">I like the splash, but might have cropped out the two falling droplettes..... good luck, Todd.</td>', 'I like the splash, but might have cropped out the two falling droplettes..... good luck, Todd.', '2003-05-26 10:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(306983, 22500, 7800, '<td valign="top">Image looks quite soft. You did a good job metering all that white though. It looks like only one small area has blown highlights.</td>', 'Image looks quite soft. You did a good job metering all that white though. It looks like only one small area has blown highlights.', '2003-05-26 10:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(306984, 22685, 7758, '<td valign="top">A bit too dark for my liking..... I think the shot has a lot of potential and possible mood.... just think that it''s a bit too dark...... good luck, Todd.</td>', 'A bit too dark for my liking..... I think the shot has a lot of potential and possible mood.... just think that it''s a bit too dark...... good luck, Todd.', '2003-05-26 10:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(306986, 22072, 7543, '<td valign="top">Nice angle, tilting stones look great</td>', 'Nice angle, tilting stones look great', '2003-05-26 10:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
