(306997, 22284, 7758, '<td valign="top">Great shot! I love the composition, love the skin tones and love the interaction she has with the camera....... the only, only thing I don''t like (and I really dislike it alot!) is the white border.... but without it I love the image.... maybe, from my personal viewpoint I might have made oh-so slightly darker..... but it''s gettin'' a 10 from me!<br/>Good luck, Todd.</td>', 'Great shot! I love the composition, love the skin tones and love the interaction she has with the camera....... the only, only thing I don''t like (and I really dislike it alot!) is the white border.... but without it I love the image.... maybe, from my personal viewpoint I might have made oh-so slightly darker..... but it''s gettin'' a 10 from me!Good luck, Todd.', '2003-05-26 10:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(306998, 22274, 7543, '<td valign="top">Great idea, nice execution. 7</td>', 'Great idea, nice execution. 7', '2003-05-26 10:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(306999, 22773, 7758, '<td valign="top">nice shot, I like the tones in this..... I might have cropped the people out..... good luck, Todd.</td>', 'nice shot, I like the tones in this..... I might have cropped the people out..... good luck, Todd.', '2003-05-26 10:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(307000, 22295, 7543, '<td valign="top">Nice, great focus, angle, lighting. Like it -  9</td>', 'Nice, great focus, angle, lighting. Like it -  9', '2003-05-26 10:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(307001, 22295, 7758, '<td valign="top">nice use of DOF..... like the contrast in this shot as well..... the subject matter isn''t something I would probably hang on my wall.... but I like it.... good luck, Todd.</td>', 'nice use of DOF..... like the contrast in this shot as well..... the subject matter isn''t something I would probably hang on my wall.... but I like it.... good luck, Todd.', '2003-05-26 10:43:27.000000', NULL, 1);
