(307035, 22284, 327, '<td valign="top">Just wonderful...love the light, the girl is so cute. I hate the black strap, but the whole shot is just a winner. Great face, expression is fantastic. LOVE this.</td>', 'Just wonderful...love the light, the girl is so cute. I hate the black strap, but the whole shot is just a winner. Great face, expression is fantastic. LOVE this.', '2003-05-26 11:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
