(307048, 22685, 7242, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous child! Overall a little dark for my personal taste, but love the catch light in the eyes and the expression. 8</td>', 'Gorgeous child! Overall a little dark for my personal taste, but love the catch light in the eyes and the expression. 8', '2003-05-26 11:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(307050, 22700, 7242, '<td valign="top">I love this photo. One of my favorites of this challenge. The light is lovely and soft and thoughtful and I love the DOF. Really well done. 10</td>', 'I love this photo. One of my favorites of this challenge. The light is lovely and soft and thoughtful and I love the DOF. Really well done. 10', '2003-05-26 11:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(307051, 22665, 7242, '<td valign="top">Nice job! I love the composition and use of duotone. The light is also wonderful.</td>', 'Nice job! I love the composition and use of duotone. The light is also wonderful.', '2003-05-26 11:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(307052, 22703, 7242, '<td valign="top">What a great capture. Works really well for the challenge! 8</td>', 'What a great capture. Works really well for the challenge! 8', '2003-05-26 11:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(307053, 22658, 4967, '<td valign="top">Plain, simple and beautiful.  Nicely done!  Excellent lighting, great contrast, e erything was just done very well here.  Why did you decide to use the gradient background.. the only thing I find is that near the top the black blends into the background.  Otherwise a very nice photo.  -9-</td>', 'Plain, simple and beautiful.  Nicely done!  Excellent lighting, great contrast, e erything was just done very well here.  Why did you decide to use the gradient background.. the only thing I find is that near the top the black blends into the background.  Otherwise a very nice photo.  -9-', '2003-05-26 11:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(307055, 22463, 7242, '<td valign="top">Fun shot to look at. Made me smile.</td>', 'Fun shot to look at. Made me smile.', '2003-05-26 12:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(307056, 22284, 4967, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done.  I love the lighting, and simplicity, and overall softness of this photo.  Great use of duotone.  Nice use of DOF, and I like the single white line that is on the photo... but watch that, because it doesn''t look quite even on both sides.  Well done.  -9-</td>', 'Beautifully done.  I love the lighting, and simplicity, and overall softness of this photo.  Great use of duotone.  Nice use of DOF, and I like the single white line that is on the photo... but watch that, because it doesn''t look quite even on both sides.  Well done.  -9-', '2003-05-26 12:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(307057, 22752, 4967, '<td valign="top">I think your going to get ripped on because its not exactly duotone.  From the photography perspective, very interesting photo, I hope to see what you did to this girl''s body.  I love the off centering of the subject, with the blank space next to it.  The lighting looks a little harsh in a few places, especially on the black of the arm.  This photo is extremely artsy, and has real potential, if you play around with the lighting a bit, and don''t enter it in duotone.  The lips really give it away.  Very cool photo though.</td>', 'I think your going to get ripped on because its not exactly duotone.  From the photography perspective, very interesting photo, I hope to see what you did to this girl''s body.  I love the off centering of the subject, with the blank space next to it.  The lighting looks a little harsh in a few places, especially on the black of the arm.  This photo is extremely artsy, and has real potential, if you play around with the lighting a bit, and don''t enter it in duotone.  The lips really give it away.  Very cool photo though.', '2003-05-26 12:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(307058, 22685, 4967, '<td valign="top">Is this a baby doll, or a real baby?  The positioning of the head makes it look like a doll.  The dark colors you used (dark greys) are interesting.  The lighting isn''t bad, it''s a very intriguing photo, that I''m actually taking time to look at.  I don''t care for the border you put, not sure why you used the white to go around it.  A very interesting photo... I kind of like it, and I kind of don''t, but it grabs my attention which makes it a good photo.  -8-</td>', 'Is this a baby doll, or a real baby?  The positioning of the head makes it look like a doll.  The dark colors you used (dark greys) are interesting.  The lighting isn''t bad, it''s a very intriguing photo, that I''m actually taking time to look at.  I don''t care for the border you put, not sure why you used the white to go around it.  A very interesting photo... I kind of like it, and I kind of don''t, but it grabs my attention which makes it a good photo.  -8-', '2003-05-26 12:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(307060, 22257, 4967, '<td valign="top">LOL.... the shirt just pulls it all together.  Very interesting... I really like it!  Well done, creative, little extreme shadow, pure, simple, to the point, and it makes a statement.</td>', 'LOL.... the shirt just pulls it all together.  Very interesting... I really like it!  Well done, creative, little extreme shadow, pure, simple, to the point, and it makes a statement.', '2003-05-26 12:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(307061, 22728, 7485, '<td valign="top">Chuch itself is great and the contrast with the cloudy sky works (this must be in Iceland!), but the foreground is distracting. Probably wasn''t much you could do about that...</td>', 'Chuch itself is great and the contrast with the cloudy sky works (this must be in Iceland!), but the foreground is distracting. Probably wasn''t much you could do about that...', '2003-05-26 12:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(307063, 22637, 4967, '<td valign="top">Pure, simple and beautiful.  Nicely lit, excellent challenge take, extremely well done.  Great texture in this photo.  Good job! -10-</td>', 'Pure, simple and beautiful.  Nicely lit, excellent challenge take, extremely well done.  Great texture in this photo.  Good job! -10-', '2003-05-26 12:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(307064, 22692, 714, '<td valign="top">To bad you got the car in the picture, I would have given it a ten.  oh well great shot I love the old time feel to it.</td>', 'To bad you got the car in the picture, I would have given it a ten.  oh well great shot I love the old time feel to it.', '2003-05-26 12:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(307065, 22273, 4967, '<td valign="top">Wow!  In the thumbnail I thought this was going to be a very plain portrait, but now, big, it''s incredible.  This guy''s face is AWESOME!  Really cool textures here, and his eyes are superb!  Nicely lit, and the photo tells a story.  I love the sepia, just a very well done photo, that hits you and keeps your attention.  Solid 10!</td>', 'Wow!  In the thumbnail I thought this was going to be a very plain portrait, but now, big, it''s incredible.  This guy''s face is AWESOME!  Really cool textures here, and his eyes are superb!  Nicely lit, and the photo tells a story.  I love the sepia, just a very well done photo, that hits you and keeps your attention.  Solid 10!', '2003-05-26 12:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(307066, 22683, 7485, '<td valign="top">Probably don''t need the top incomming drop, then you could focus the composition on the splash and lower falling drops. But I really like the shadow behind the ring-splash, makes the splash really stand out</td>', 'Probably don''t need the top incomming drop, then you could focus the composition on the splash and lower falling drops. But I really like the shadow behind the ring-splash, makes the splash really stand out', '2003-05-26 12:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(307067, 22149, 6870, '<td valign="top">The motion blur is fantastic in this shot. I love the long rain streaks!</td>', 'The motion blur is fantastic in this shot. I love the long rain streaks!', '2003-05-26 12:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(307068, 22466, 4967, '<td valign="top">This photo seems fuzzy to me.  I think it actually would have been more effectual in color, with the green grass behind the animal.  Personally I don''t care for it.  Also the cow somehow looks a little tilted.  Sorry but I don''t think that you attained what you were going for.</td>', 'This photo seems fuzzy to me.  I think it actually would have been more effectual in color, with the green grass behind the animal.  Personally I don''t care for it.  Also the cow somehow looks a little tilted.  Sorry but I don''t think that you attained what you were going for.', '2003-05-26 12:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(307069, 22273, 6870, '<td valign="top">Intense expression. Very well composed. Great lighting. This should do well, I hope!</td>', 'Intense expression. Very well composed. Great lighting. This should do well, I hope!', '2003-05-26 12:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(307070, 22657, 1779, '<td valign="top">I really like this one. so simple yet intersting.  I dunno about the black frame, though. it seems to "blacken" the shot a little too much for me.<br/> <br/>LM</td>', 'I really like this one. so simple yet intersting.  I dunno about the black frame, though. it seems to "blacken" the shot a little too much for me. LM', '2003-05-26 12:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
