(307078, 22284, 6870, '<td valign="top">Marvelous portrait! You captured her natural beauty extxremely well through your point of view, composition, fantastic lighting--it all came together for you here! 10</td>', 'Marvelous portrait! You captured her natural beauty extxremely well through your point of view, composition, fantastic lighting--it all came together for you here! 10', '2003-05-26 12:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
