(307081, 22458, 6870, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for goofy shots, but this goes beyond goofy. The set up, idea, and execution are simply marvelous. The tape measure is slightly out of focus, but the lighting, colors used, and composition are just fantastic. This is certainly one of my favorites of the week! 10--11 if I could!</td>', 'I''m a sucker for goofy shots, but this goes beyond goofy. The set up, idea, and execution are simply marvelous. The tape measure is slightly out of focus, but the lighting, colors used, and composition are just fantastic. This is certainly one of my favorites of the week! 10--11 if I could!', '2003-05-26 12:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(307082, 22049, 7485, '<td valign="top">Now there''s a subject worthy of this challenge! Could work even better without the high-key approach?</td>', 'Now there''s a subject worthy of this challenge! Could work even better without the high-key approach?', '2003-05-26 12:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(307083, 22703, 1779, '<td valign="top">good idea. nice tones and definition. but I had to drop a point for the cropping of the feet. sorry : )</td>', 'good idea. nice tones and definition. but I had to drop a point for the cropping of the feet. sorry : )', '2003-05-26 12:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(307084, 22657, 6870, '<td valign="top">I just love abstracts like this. This is certainly an impressionistic view of the water, and you show us just how lovely nature can be in the most simple places. Lots of variation and engaging textures here. I''d love to see this in color, too, but it works so well in B/W! 10</td>', 'I just love abstracts like this. This is certainly an impressionistic view of the water, and you show us just how lovely nature can be in the most simple places. Lots of variation and engaging textures here. I''d love to see this in color, too, but it works so well in B/W! 10', '2003-05-26 12:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
