(307097, 22732, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is kind of cool... I like the DOF you used here, makes for a very interesting photo that could have been quite plain.  Nice job getting down and really trying different angles on the subject.  The sepia gives it an old time look.</td>', 'This is kind of cool... I like the DOF you used here, makes for a very interesting photo that could have been quite plain.  Nice job getting down and really trying different angles on the subject.  The sepia gives it an old time look.', '2003-05-26 12:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
