(307254, 22685, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and sharpness of focus.  A little dark perhaps, but still works well with the portrayed mode.  I get sleepy just looking at this photo (conveys the title very well).  Nicely done!</td>', 'Nice composition and sharpness of focus.  A little dark perhaps, but still works well with the portrayed mode.  I get sleepy just looking at this photo (conveys the title very well).  Nicely done!', '2003-05-26 16:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
