(307257, 22763, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and eye effect in the knife, cleaver idea.  Hand and arm do not carry the same sharpness as the hood and cloak (possibly a tad overexposed in that area?).</td>', 'Nice composition and eye effect in the knife, cleaver idea.  Hand and arm do not carry the same sharpness as the hood and cloak (possibly a tad overexposed in that area?).', '2003-05-26 16:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(307258, 22793, 6771, '<td valign="top">I really like the cropping done here.  Fits well.  I would like to see some diffuse lighting up on the left side also, to help bring out the frame detail and contrast.  Alittle bright in the bottom right corner</td>', 'I really like the cropping done here.  Fits well.  I would like to see some diffuse lighting up on the left side also, to help bring out the frame detail and contrast.  Alittle bright in the bottom right corner', '2003-05-26 16:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(307262, 22479, 6771, '<td valign="top">Great DOF.  For most flowers I like to see the focus around the (stamens) middle of the flower.  Ususally the most interesting part.  Great tone and detailon the petals.  I think maybe using the rule of thirds on the larger flowers middle area instead of the smaller one would command it more attention.  But that is one opinion</td>', 'Great DOF.  For most flowers I like to see the focus around the (stamens) middle of the flower.  Ususally the most interesting part.  Great tone and detailon the petals.  I think maybe using the rule of thirds on the larger flowers middle area instead of the smaller one would command it more attention.  But that is one opinion', '2003-05-26 16:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(307263, 22427, 6771, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting that ended up on the left page, seems to bring out the type a bit better.  Not sure what color the pages are, but a tad brighter may add more pop to the text</td>', 'I like the lighting that ended up on the left page, seems to bring out the type a bit better.  Not sure what color the pages are, but a tad brighter may add more pop to the text', '2003-05-26 16:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(307264, 22471, 6771, '<td valign="top">Great subject.  Of course, the blown out area draws my eye away from looking at the tower, and then have to work may way up.  My monitor registers this with a slight rose colored hue to it.  I would like a more sepia brownish tone (but I like those older photos that look that way)</td>', 'Great subject.  Of course, the blown out area draws my eye away from looking at the tower, and then have to work may way up.  My monitor registers this with a slight rose colored hue to it.  I would like a more sepia brownish tone (but I like those older photos that look that way)', '2003-05-26 16:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(307267, 22734, 6771, '<td valign="top">the lighting may be a touch harsh, but I like it.  I have a similar shot that was B&amp;W, with almost the same lighting (maybe a bit harsher) and it actually did fairly well.  Great DOF and focus.  As with mine I got comments for a touch of light on the dark side just to see the eye a bit, but I like it this way.</td>', 'the lighting may be a touch harsh, but I like it.  I have a similar shot that was B&W, with almost the same lighting (maybe a bit harsher) and it actually did fairly well.  Great DOF and focus.  As with mine I got comments for a touch of light on the dark side just to see the eye a bit, but I like it this way.', '2003-05-26 16:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(307268, 22781, 6771, '<td valign="top">Great compostion.  I would like to see the focus on the stamen area (middle) to bring those to more attention.  the DOF is pretty good that you can see the other closed buds and then the others make a good background.  th hue you selected is great</td>', 'Great compostion.  I would like to see the focus on the stamen area (middle) to bring those to more attention.  the DOF is pretty good that you can see the other closed buds and then the others make a good background.  th hue you selected is great', '2003-05-26 16:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(307270, 22658, 6771, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool.  It looks like it has been dipped in oil and still shiny.  I would like to see the whole thing with sharp focus and DOF on it.  It looks like the top 2 links are a touch more in focus than the rest.  Still very cool</td>', 'This is pretty cool.  It looks like it has been dipped in oil and still shiny.  I would like to see the whole thing with sharp focus and DOF on it.  It looks like the top 2 links are a touch more in focus than the rest.  Still very cool', '2003-05-26 16:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
