(307576, 22313, 6325, '<td valign="top">Dramatic shot. The tones work well.</td>', 'Dramatic shot. The tones work well.', '2003-05-27 01:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(307577, 22317, 6771, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject.  good choice on DOF.  not quite sure of the focus.  appears a bit soft, but I am able to make out details very well.  Maybe a darker hue would look better?</td>', 'Interesting subject.  good choice on DOF.  not quite sure of the focus.  appears a bit soft, but I am able to make out details very well.  Maybe a darker hue would look better?', '2003-05-27 02:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(307578, 22283, 6771, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  The top area of the rose is a bit blown, which would not help with me prefering to see a bit more light on the rest of the shot, to bring out more lines and depth to the shot</td>', 'Interesting.  The top area of the rose is a bit blown, which would not help with me prefering to see a bit more light on the rest of the shot, to bring out more lines and depth to the shot', '2003-05-27 02:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(307581, 22054, 2667, '<td valign="top">I like the grainy, chilling quality presented here. It looks so much like ice. (though I suspect it was done through IR) Either way, it''s well presented and the tone compliments it nicely.</td>', 'I like the grainy, chilling quality presented here. It looks so much like ice. (though I suspect it was done through IR) Either way, it''s well presented and the tone compliments it nicely.', '2003-05-27 02:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(307582, 22308, 6771, '<td valign="top">she is stunning!!  I really like the lighting, very well done.  the hat seems to have great detail, but the face is a touch soft.  confuses the eye a bit, but the soft focus/diffusion works well</td>', 'she is stunning!!  I really like the lighting, very well done.  the hat seems to have great detail, but the face is a touch soft.  confuses the eye a bit, but the soft focus/diffusion works well', '2003-05-27 02:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(307584, 22617, 6771, '<td valign="top">I hate this...no wait...I hate running.  (C:  Very nice catch, stopped the action, spot on.  great tones and light definitely brings out musculature in the legs and the definition.</td>', 'I hate this...no wait...I hate running.  (C:  Very nice catch, stopped the action, spot on.  great tones and light definitely brings out musculature in the legs and the definition.', '2003-05-27 02:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(307585, 22703, 6771, '<td valign="top">nice DOF/focus.  I would like to see that they are standing on something (feet in the shot, otherwise very good</td>', 'nice DOF/focus.  I would like to see that they are standing on something (feet in the shot, otherwise very good', '2003-05-27 02:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(307588, 22745, 2667, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot with lots of neat things going on. The tone seems to be missing a true black, though. And this causes the shot to lose a lot of snap.</td>', 'Interesting shot with lots of neat things going on. The tone seems to be missing a true black, though. And this causes the shot to lose a lot of snap.', '2003-05-27 02:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(307589, 22691, 6771, '<td valign="top">this is very interesting.  different shapes and tones throughout, that make me look at it more.</td>', 'this is very interesting.  different shapes and tones throughout, that make me look at it more.', '2003-05-27 02:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(307590, 22703, 2667, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good composition and it has a very nostalgic feel. The tone seems to be missing a true black, though, and this causes the shot to lose a lot of snap.</td>', 'Nice shot, good composition and it has a very nostalgic feel. The tone seems to be missing a true black, though, and this causes the shot to lose a lot of snap.', '2003-05-27 02:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(307594, 22371, 2667, '<td valign="top">Great texture and composition. Nicely managed tone too. I also like the shallow depth of field. Nice work.</td>', 'Great texture and composition. Nicely managed tone too. I also like the shallow depth of field. Nice work.', '2003-05-27 02:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(307595, 22728, 2667, '<td valign="top">Lovely church, it looks like it should be sitting on a hilltop somewhere! The lighting is very nice, and I like the angle and composition. Well done.</td>', 'Lovely church, it looks like it should be sitting on a hilltop somewhere! The lighting is very nice, and I like the angle and composition. Well done.', '2003-05-27 02:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(307596, 22474, 6771, '<td valign="top">haha.  I did one similar to this for the fauna challenge.  Nice DOF, but the focus looks a touch soft.  I am still able to see good detail.  Maybe it is just the colors, especially how the shady background appears hazy</td>', 'haha.  I did one similar to this for the fauna challenge.  Nice DOF, but the focus looks a touch soft.  I am still able to see good detail.  Maybe it is just the colors, especially how the shady background appears hazy', '2003-05-27 02:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(307597, 22313, 2667, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I wish there had been a touch more DOF. The critical area of focus needs to contain his snout, I think, and on through the eye line. The textures in his skin and the tone you have achieved are just wonderful.</td>', 'Nice shot. I wish there had been a touch more DOF. The critical area of focus needs to contain his snout, I think, and on through the eye line. The textures in his skin and the tone you have achieved are just wonderful.', '2003-05-27 02:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(307599, 22658, 2667, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting piece. Instead of rough and rusted textures, we have greasy and slimy! Definitely different. (a working chain!) And it looks kinda cool on the dark graded background. Its just a little too dark, I think, to be really effective.</td>', 'This is an interesting piece. Instead of rough and rusted textures, we have greasy and slimy! Definitely different. (a working chain!) And it looks kinda cool on the dark graded background. Its just a little too dark, I think, to be really effective.', '2003-05-27 02:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(307600, 22451, 2667, '<td valign="top">I like the lines in this shot. They flow so nicely around.</td>', 'I like the lines in this shot. They flow so nicely around.', '2003-05-27 02:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(307602, 22699, 2667, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image with good composition with lots of interesting textures. However, The tone is very dark and seems to be missing a true black. This causes the shot to lose a lot of snap.</td>', 'This is a nice image with good composition with lots of interesting textures. However, The tone is very dark and seems to be missing a true black. This causes the shot to lose a lot of snap.', '2003-05-27 03:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(307603, 22709, 2667, '<td valign="top">Great lighting (if just a touch hot on his cheek and brow).  Nice work.</td>', 'Great lighting (if just a touch hot on his cheek and brow).  Nice work.', '2003-05-27 03:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(307604, 22680, 2667, '<td valign="top">Nice macro work! I like the strong diagonals and smooth tones. Well managed!</td>', 'Nice macro work! I like the strong diagonals and smooth tones. Well managed!', '2003-05-27 03:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(307605, 22295, 2667, '<td valign="top">Nice documentary style shot. I like the shallow DOF and the high contrast. Well done.</td>', 'Nice documentary style shot. I like the shallow DOF and the high contrast. Well done.', '2003-05-27 03:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(307606, 22635, 4805, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I like it, though I think it could benefit from some contrast enhancement and some unsharp mask. Also, the table appears to be tilted to the left. This might be the result of barrel distortion, though. Still, nicely done.</td>', 'Nice idea. I like it, though I think it could benefit from some contrast enhancement and some unsharp mask. Also, the table appears to be tilted to the left. This might be the result of barrel distortion, though. Still, nicely done.', '2003-05-27 03:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(307607, 22703, 2217, '<td valign="top">Pity the feet have been cut off, otherwise a nice strong composition.</td>', 'Pity the feet have been cut off, otherwise a nice strong composition.', '2003-05-27 03:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(307608, 22734, 4805, '<td valign="top">Nice. A few things I might have wanted to avoid is the blown highlight on the forehead, and the glasses frame through the eye. Very expressive, though.</td>', 'Nice. A few things I might have wanted to avoid is the blown highlight on the forehead, and the glasses frame through the eye. Very expressive, though.', '2003-05-27 03:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(307609, 22194, 4805, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast, good depth of focus. These are extrordinarily hard to photograph...</td>', 'Nice contrast, good depth of focus. These are extrordinarily hard to photograph...', '2003-05-27 03:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(307610, 22305, 2667, '<td valign="top">Nice tone and textures in this alley. Good composition too.</td>', 'Nice tone and textures in this alley. Good composition too.', '2003-05-27 03:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(307611, 22632, 4805, '<td valign="top">Not bad, though this image is a bit flat in my opinion. Might wanna try cranking the contrast and perhaps playing with the colour channels to get a good range of grey tones.</td>', 'Not bad, though this image is a bit flat in my opinion. Might wanna try cranking the contrast and perhaps playing with the colour channels to get a good range of grey tones.', '2003-05-27 03:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(307614, 22500, 4805, '<td valign="top">I think this is a little too soft. Soft focus is great for humans in that it hides wrinkles and imperfectons but the nice thing about cats is the great texture in the fur. I think thi is missing here. Just my opinion..</td>', 'I think this is a little too soft. Soft focus is great for humans in that it hides wrinkles and imperfectons but the nice thing about cats is the great texture in the fur. I think thi is missing here. Just my opinion..', '2003-05-27 03:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(307615, 22470, 2667, '<td valign="top">Nice shades and textures, but the tone seems to be missing a true black.  This causes the shot to lose a lot of snap.</td>', 'Nice shades and textures, but the tone seems to be missing a true black.  This causes the shot to lose a lot of snap.', '2003-05-27 03:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(307617, 22284, 4805, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and skin tone. Beautiful girl. I do have an objection to the border, though. It''s uneven...tighter on the right than on the left. I also find it a bit distracting. The relative clutter in the image on the bottom right takes away from the face.</td>', 'Very nice composition and skin tone. Beautiful girl. I do have an objection to the border, though. It''s uneven...tighter on the right than on the left. I also find it a bit distracting. The relative clutter in the image on the bottom right takes away from the face.', '2003-05-27 03:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(307618, 22781, 4805, '<td valign="top">Nice sharpness and interesting colour. Good DOF.</td>', 'Nice sharpness and interesting colour. Good DOF.', '2003-05-27 03:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(307619, 22698, 4805, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I think this image could maybe have been improved by taking the golf ball off-center, including the shadow, and exposing the golf ball a bit better. The ball is overexposed, and the dimple texture is lost in on the sides and top.</td>', 'Nice idea. I think this image could maybe have been improved by taking the golf ball off-center, including the shadow, and exposing the golf ball a bit better. The ball is overexposed, and the dimple texture is lost in on the sides and top.', '2003-05-27 03:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(307620, 22729, 2667, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit grainy and pixelated, but the flower makes a striking line through the image. Good composition.</td>', 'Looks a bit grainy and pixelated, but the flower makes a striking line through the image. Good composition.', '2003-05-27 03:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(307624, 22685, 2667, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait.</td>', 'Nice portrait.', '2003-05-27 03:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(307629, 22284, 2586, '<td valign="top">Oui, elle est vraiment très belle et il  paraît que je la connais.<br/>Yes, she is indeed very beautiful and i believe i know who she is <br/>:)<br/>It is also a classy style of beauty that i find very appealing, à la Isabella Rossilini, rather than that much sought after ''overtly sexy'' beauty that often is really nothing but an empty shell. Please convey this compliment to your model !<br/>Good portrait. I understand the pose and the position of the photographer. What i do not like about this is that somehow the face seems \''disjointed\'' as it were from the body. From this vantage point, the relationship between the face and the body/shoulder almost seems a little like torture and almost as if the face is somehow pasted on. Vous comprenez?<br/> ;) <br/> 7</td>', 'Oui, elle est vraiment très belle et il  paraît que je la connais.Yes, she is indeed very beautiful and i believe i know who she is :)It is also a classy style of beauty that i find very appealing, à la Isabella Rossilini, rather than that much sought after ''overtly sexy'' beauty that often is really nothing but an empty shell. Please convey this compliment to your model !Good portrait. I understand the pose and the position of the photographer. What i do not like about this is that somehow the face seems \''disjointed\'' as it were from the body. From this vantage point, the relationship between the face and the body/shoulder almost seems a little like torture and almost as if the face is somehow pasted on. Vous comprenez? ;)  7', '2003-05-27 04:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(307640, 22248, 8955, '<td valign="top">Le rendu des couleurs donne une impression de flou ce qui, malgré la laideur du modèle, contribue à l''originalité de cette photo.</td>', 'Le rendu des couleurs donne une impression de flou ce qui, malgré la laideur du modèle, contribue à l''originalité de cette photo.', '2003-05-27 05:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(307641, 22790, 3540, '<td valign="top">The effect of looking like an 80 year old photo has been achieved with this photo.  The subject looks vintage and the background is something that could be seen in any photographable era.  Nice job - 9</td>', 'The effect of looking like an 80 year old photo has been achieved with this photo.  The subject looks vintage and the background is something that could be seen in any photographable era.  Nice job - 9', '2003-05-27 05:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(307642, 22627, 3540, '<td valign="top">This photo is just amazing.  To catch these guys up here, more or less just to be up here is awesome.  I''m not sure how this was done or what means were used to take it, but it is really cool and very well done.  What I really like is the dark silhouettes against the clouds.  That''s really neat. - 9</td>', 'This photo is just amazing.  To catch these guys up here, more or less just to be up here is awesome.  I''m not sure how this was done or what means were used to take it, but it is really cool and very well done.  What I really like is the dark silhouettes against the clouds.  That''s really neat. - 9', '2003-05-27 05:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(307643, 22656, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice shot.  The white background is really a nice capture but then you''ve also put these silhouettes in front of it.  There is some nice contrast going on in this photo.  great capture.  Nice work.</td>', 'This is a really nice shot.  The white background is really a nice capture but then you''ve also put these silhouettes in front of it.  There is some nice contrast going on in this photo.  great capture.  Nice work.', '2003-05-27 05:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(307645, 22420, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice portrait.  Its sort of candid, and pretty flattering.  If the background were more uniform, this is a 10 all the way.  As it is, its a very solid 9.  Very well done.  This is one of my fav''s for the week if not my fav.</td>', 'This is a very nice portrait.  Its sort of candid, and pretty flattering.  If the background were more uniform, this is a 10 all the way.  As it is, its a very solid 9.  Very well done.  This is one of my fav''s for the week if not my fav.', '2003-05-27 05:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(307646, 22680, 3540, '<td valign="top">Very good macro.  The beetle is definitely crisp and very clear.  The duotone of this really makes for great contrast with the background, but the beetle is not jet black where we can''t see any of his detail.  Nice choice of subject and very good camerawork.</td>', 'Very good macro.  The beetle is definitely crisp and very clear.  The duotone of this really makes for great contrast with the background, but the beetle is not jet black where we can''t see any of his detail.  Nice choice of subject and very good camerawork.', '2003-05-27 05:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(307648, 22362, 3540, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure what sort of scene this is depicting, but it is pretty interesting.  It looks like legs from some very large creature smashing this person, but I can''t be sure.  I like that the skeleton is dark and not white.  He has very good contast with the stones underneath.  The tonal quality makes it a little cold and desparate, which is really what a photo like this needs.  very well done!</td>', 'I''m not really sure what sort of scene this is depicting, but it is pretty interesting.  It looks like legs from some very large creature smashing this person, but I can''t be sure.  I like that the skeleton is dark and not white.  He has very good contast with the stones underneath.  The tonal quality makes it a little cold and desparate, which is really what a photo like this needs.  very well done!', '2003-05-27 05:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(307649, 22658, 3540, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo.  I''m very curious to know who did this photo.  The way the chains have water or oil on them was a great idea, or great capture, whichever applies.  It really makes the detail of them stand out in terms of all the great highlights.  The highlights really make for some outstanding contrast between the chain itself and also with the background.  Excellent work.  I was giving this an 8, but I think it deserves a 9</td>', 'Excellent photo.  I''m very curious to know who did this photo.  The way the chains have water or oil on them was a great idea, or great capture, whichever applies.  It really makes the detail of them stand out in terms of all the great highlights.  The highlights really make for some outstanding contrast between the chain itself and also with the background.  Excellent work.  I was giving this an 8, but I think it deserves a 9', '2003-05-27 05:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(307650, 22308, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice portrait of this person.  I like that it''s not just a big posed "say cheese" picture but a very nice, natural poignant pic.  Its just a little soft and I don''t like the way "soft" comes across in this photo.  It almost looks like the brim of the hat is the focal point.  Very nicely done regardless.</td>', 'This is a really nice portrait of this person.  I like that it''s not just a big posed "say cheese" picture but a very nice, natural poignant pic.  Its just a little soft and I don''t like the way "soft" comes across in this photo.  It almost looks like the brim of the hat is the focal point.  Very nicely done regardless.', '2003-05-27 05:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(307660, 22633, 7758, '<td valign="top">wow! this really jumps off the page.... love the high contrast and the effect it has on the building and the sky!<br/>Great image! Good luck, Todd.<br/>Been back to look at this several times and think it is a great image..... gave you a 9 but on review it''s getting a 10..... really meets the challenge and creates a real mood.</td>', 'wow! this really jumps off the page.... love the high contrast and the effect it has on the building and the sky!Great image! Good luck, Todd.Been back to look at this several times and think it is a great image..... gave you a 9 but on review it''s getting a 10..... really meets the challenge and creates a real mood.', '2003-05-27 07:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(307661, 22637, 7758, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot, love the negative effect created by the relection..... there''s just a few little spotty marks, or fingerprints, or something in the light side which let this down just a fraction. It''s a great image though. Good luck, Todd.</td>', 'Really nice shot, love the negative effect created by the relection..... there''s just a few little spotty marks, or fingerprints, or something in the light side which let this down just a fraction. It''s a great image though. Good luck, Todd.', '2003-05-27 07:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(307663, 22755, 6999, '<td valign="top">Not sure that a pure black and white wouldn''t have been more effective - the tone you''ve chosen gives a very odd cast to the skin-tones, especially around the mouth area. Nice study though.</td>', 'Not sure that a pure black and white wouldn''t have been more effective - the tone you''ve chosen gives a very odd cast to the skin-tones, especially around the mouth area. Nice study though.', '2003-05-27 08:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(307664, 22752, 8250, '<td valign="top">duo means 2 colours i can see atleast 4 here white black flesh and red</td>', 'duo means 2 colours i can see atleast 4 here white black flesh and red', '2003-05-27 08:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(307668, 22054, 5982, '<td valign="top">reminds me of the tree in The Ring!</td>', 'reminds me of the tree in The Ring!', '2003-05-27 08:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(307671, 22620, 4493, '<td valign="top">Coposition and details are nice.</td>', 'Coposition and details are nice.', '2003-05-27 08:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(307672, 22685, 4493, '<td valign="top">Very well done low key shot.</td>', 'Very well done low key shot.', '2003-05-27 08:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(307673, 22633, 4493, '<td valign="top">Excellent combination of tones and textures! 10 -danny</td>', 'Excellent combination of tones and textures! 10 -danny', '2003-05-27 08:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(307674, 22054, 7889, '<td valign="top">I like this but the fence in the foreground spoils it a little</td>', 'I like this but the fence in the foreground spoils it a little', '2003-05-27 08:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(307675, 22788, 4493, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the abstract nature of this shot. I like the way the curves work through the frame. 9 -danny</td>', 'I appreciate the abstract nature of this shot. I like the way the curves work through the frame. 9 -danny', '2003-05-27 08:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(307676, 22782, 4493, '<td valign="top">If you could have opened your aperture a little more so as to blur the background shoreline some, we would be able to just focus on the great shapes and textures in these roots. As it is, the houses in the distance keep drawing my eye away from the trees. 8 -danny</td>', 'If you could have opened your aperture a little more so as to blur the background shoreline some, we would be able to just focus on the great shapes and textures in these roots. As it is, the houses in the distance keep drawing my eye away from the trees. 8 -danny', '2003-05-27 08:46:05.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(307677, 22793, 8530, '<td valign="top">Captures the topic, but I''m not sure how I feel about a photo of a photo.</td>', 'Captures the topic, but I''m not sure how I feel about a photo of a photo.', '2003-05-27 08:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(307678, 22420, 8530, '<td valign="top">Nice sepia toning.</td>', 'Nice sepia toning.', '2003-05-27 08:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(307679, 22054, 8530, '<td valign="top">Very eerie, reminiscent of ice even with the clear field. I presume from the title you were going for something desolate-looking, in which case you succeeded.</td>', 'Very eerie, reminiscent of ice even with the clear field. I presume from the title you were going for something desolate-looking, in which case you succeeded.', '2003-05-27 08:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(307680, 22214, 8530, '<td valign="top">Pretty, with a good dark/light balance.</td>', 'Pretty, with a good dark/light balance.', '2003-05-27 08:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(307681, 22305, 8530, '<td valign="top">Very Old-World feel, good use of colour to emphasize that.</td>', 'Very Old-World feel, good use of colour to emphasize that.', '2003-05-27 08:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(307682, 22766, 8530, '<td valign="top">Sort of looks like an old real estate photo with the sepia toning. Might have been interesting to see it in black and white instead.</td>', 'Sort of looks like an old real estate photo with the sepia toning. Might have been interesting to see it in black and white instead.', '2003-05-27 08:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(307683, 22505, 8530, '<td valign="top">Hmm. I''m not sure I like this in sepia as much as I would have in either b&amp;w or a different tone. But it''s a nice shot.</td>', 'Hmm. I''m not sure I like this in sepia as much as I would have in either b&w or a different tone. But it''s a nice shot.', '2003-05-27 08:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(307684, 22750, 8530, '<td valign="top">The spectators in the back are a little distracting. It''s otherwise a good setup, but I''m not sure sepia would have been my firs tchoice for a fairly modern-seeming photo.</td>', 'The spectators in the back are a little distracting. It''s otherwise a good setup, but I''m not sure sepia would have been my firs tchoice for a fairly modern-seeming photo.', '2003-05-27 08:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(307685, 22146, 7889, '<td valign="top">Good shot - i would have liked it better if the sky was not so bright.</td>', 'Good shot - i would have liked it better if the sky was not so bright.', '2003-05-27 08:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(307687, 22451, 8530, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W was a good choice for this but I think either a tighter focus on the post and flowers or otherwise a different angle would have been more interesting.</td>', 'B&W was a good choice for this but I think either a tighter focus on the post and flowers or otherwise a different angle would have been more interesting.', '2003-05-27 08:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(307688, 22708, 7889, '<td valign="top">top half is a bit too bright but nice shot</td>', 'top half is a bit too bright but nice shot', '2003-05-27 08:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(307689, 22657, 8530, '<td valign="top">Very dark overall, despite the water highlights, giving it a sort of bland, homogenous feel. A blue tint might have been better.</td>', 'Very dark overall, despite the water highlights, giving it a sort of bland, homogenous feel. A blue tint might have been better.', '2003-05-27 08:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(307690, 22626, 8530, '<td valign="top">I have to say as someone originally from an area with a lot of tornadoes, the greenish tinge makes me feel less serene than you probably intended. :) Very pretty, but the tone being a little more yellow might have been nicer.</td>', 'I have to say as someone originally from an area with a lot of tornadoes, the greenish tinge makes me feel less serene than you probably intended. :) Very pretty, but the tone being a little more yellow might have been nicer.', '2003-05-27 08:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(307691, 22451, 4493, '<td valign="top">Did you try a angle where you are acually lower to the ground and positioned more to the left of the tie up lookin out to the water more. This would move the interest from straight down the middle of the frame to a more left to right flow. It would also remove the autos from the shot. This has some great possibilities, I wouldn''t mind seeing a reshoot with some different angles. 8 -danny</td>', 'Did you try a angle where you are acually lower to the ground and positioned more to the left of the tie up lookin out to the water more. This would move the interest from straight down the middle of the frame to a more left to right flow. It would also remove the autos from the shot. This has some great possibilities, I wouldn''t mind seeing a reshoot with some different angles. 8 -danny', '2003-05-27 08:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(307692, 22317, 8530, '<td valign="top">Interesting color choice. It''s a good match for a solemn artifact.</td>', 'Interesting color choice. It''s a good match for a solemn artifact.', '2003-05-27 08:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(307693, 22146, 4493, '<td valign="top">WOW! I like this a lot. Good use of the tones to give it a nice warm feel! 9 -danny</td>', 'WOW! I like this a lot. Good use of the tones to give it a nice warm feel! 9 -danny', '2003-05-27 08:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(307694, 22753, 8530, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting. A nice, simple photo, uncluttered.</td>', 'Very nice lighting. A nice, simple photo, uncluttered.', '2003-05-27 08:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(307695, 22782, 7889, '<td valign="top">Great idea but the background distracts me too much</td>', 'Great idea but the background distracts me too much', '2003-05-27 08:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(307696, 22700, 7890, '<td valign="top">This is just a wonderful composition, and subject, the lighting is exellent and the frame works well, great job.</td>', 'This is just a wonderful composition, and subject, the lighting is exellent and the frame works well, great job.', '2003-05-27 08:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(307697, 22145, 7889, '<td valign="top">Great shot - just love this one - good luck..<br/> <br/></td>', 'Great shot - just love this one - good luck.. ', '2003-05-27 08:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(307699, 22627, 7890, '<td valign="top">This is just a amzing photo, abit to dark but a 10 from me, it works well here because it gives the clouds a great stormy effect, and the birds, wow what a capture, very good work and exposer.</td>', 'This is just a amzing photo, abit to dark but a 10 from me, it works well here because it gives the clouds a great stormy effect, and the birds, wow what a capture, very good work and exposer.', '2003-05-27 09:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(307700, 22700, 4493, '<td valign="top">Excellent portraiture. The tonal work you did really brings out the charm in this shot. The details of the face against the soft background really make for a  professional looking shot. Nice work! 10 -danny</td>', 'Excellent portraiture. The tonal work you did really brings out the charm in this shot. The details of the face against the soft background really make for a  professional looking shot. Nice work! 10 -danny', '2003-05-27 09:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(307701, 22295, 8530, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how I feel about your subject matter, but the lighting, angle, and colour are good. The crab stands out against the sand (dirt? hard to tell in B&amp;W), good contrast against it.</td>', 'I''m not sure how I feel about your subject matter, but the lighting, angle, and colour are good. The crab stands out against the sand (dirt? hard to tell in B&W), good contrast against it.', '2003-05-27 09:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(307702, 22632, 8530, '<td valign="top">Aww, cute baby. Nice shot, interesting in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Aww, cute baby. Nice shot, interesting in B&W.', '2003-05-27 09:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(307703, 22194, 7889, '<td valign="top">Love the title! - good shot</td>', 'Love the title! - good shot', '2003-05-27 09:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(307704, 22744, 7890, '<td valign="top">great Idea you have here, going into the past with this challange, very good composition.</td>', 'great Idea you have here, going into the past with this challange, very good composition.', '2003-05-27 09:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(307705, 22759, 6035, '<td valign="top">the white cards came out well, without being overblown, good job, white is always a hard thing to photograph. The shades of grey in the card itself is also interesting.. we dont get to see cards in B&amp;W very often.</td>', 'the white cards came out well, without being overblown, good job, white is always a hard thing to photograph. The shades of grey in the card itself is also interesting.. we dont get to see cards in B&W very often.', '2003-05-27 09:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(307706, 22194, 6035, '<td valign="top">the composition itself is ncie, but i think i would have liked it more without all that extra "fluff" on the end.. looking at it closely, i cant help but think that a macro of the seed roots would have made a great photo...</td>', 'the composition itself is ncie, but i think i would have liked it more without all that extra "fluff" on the end.. looking at it closely, i cant help but think that a macro of the seed roots would have made a great photo...', '2003-05-27 09:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(307707, 22776, 7889, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred to see the whole of the phone</td>', 'I would have preferred to see the whole of the phone', '2003-05-27 09:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(307708, 22149, 8530, '<td valign="top">Hmm. From the highlights in the photo and the water I''d guess this was done with a hose or a sprinkler instead of natural rain -- no water on the right side. A different angle maybe?</td>', 'Hmm. From the highlights in the photo and the water I''d guess this was done with a hose or a sprinkler instead of natural rain -- no water on the right side. A different angle maybe?', '2003-05-27 09:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(307709, 22702, 8530, '<td valign="top">Strange. The photo isn''t crooked, but the building parts are. Must be an old building. Looks good with the tone chosen.</td>', 'Strange. The photo isn''t crooked, but the building parts are. Must be an old building. Looks good with the tone chosen.', '2003-05-27 09:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(307710, 22773, 4493, '<td valign="top">Buildings always provide great lines and details. I like the old world vs. new world feel in this shot. The gradient of light at the top to the dark at the bottom create a nice compliment to each other. And to put the perspective on the shot you have the people at the bottom adding a nice focal point and detail. Nice work. 8 -danny</td>', 'Buildings always provide great lines and details. I like the old world vs. new world feel in this shot. The gradient of light at the top to the dark at the bottom create a nice compliment to each other. And to put the perspective on the shot you have the people at the bottom adding a nice focal point and detail. Nice work. 8 -danny', '2003-05-27 09:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(307711, 22335, 8530, '<td valign="top">Hrm. On the one hand, with a rose tint, I might have thought a less empty picture would have been better. On the other hand, the whole trope of rose-tinted glasses is that even something this lonely would look good -- and it does. Hard to decide how I feel about it.</td>', 'Hrm. On the one hand, with a rose tint, I might have thought a less empty picture would have been better. On the other hand, the whole trope of rose-tinted glasses is that even something this lonely would look good -- and it does. Hard to decide how I feel about it.', '2003-05-27 09:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(307712, 22787, 8530, '<td valign="top">This makes me want to see it in colour. The area is pretty, but it wouldn''t have been my first choice for a B&amp;W shot just for that reason.</td>', 'This makes me want to see it in colour. The area is pretty, but it wouldn''t have been my first choice for a B&W shot just for that reason.', '2003-05-27 09:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(307713, 22686, 8530, '<td valign="top">This is very interesting-looking. Is it a statue? It actually has a cemetery-marker feel to it, particularly with the tone chosen. The shot is nice, good choice of angle, very lonely-seeming, very emotional.</td>', 'This is very interesting-looking. Is it a statue? It actually has a cemetery-marker feel to it, particularly with the tone chosen. The shot is nice, good choice of angle, very lonely-seeming, very emotional.', '2003-05-27 09:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(307714, 22656, 8530, '<td valign="top">Looks completely natural in a duotone shading, very nice choice. I think maybe just a bit too much of the building on the left shows, as it tends to draw the eye away from the center.</td>', 'Looks completely natural in a duotone shading, very nice choice. I think maybe just a bit too much of the building on the left shows, as it tends to draw the eye away from the center.', '2003-05-27 09:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(307715, 22620, 8530, '<td valign="top">Very nice, gives a feel of being old naturally rather than deliberately shaded to look such. The border is slightly intrusive.</td>', 'Very nice, gives a feel of being old naturally rather than deliberately shaded to look such. The border is slightly intrusive.', '2003-05-27 09:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(307716, 22781, 8530, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. A lovely choice of shade, looks natural even though the leaves are the ''wrong'' colour. Nice angle and placement.</td>', 'Beautiful. A lovely choice of shade, looks natural even though the leaves are the ''wrong'' colour. Nice angle and placement.', '2003-05-27 09:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(307717, 22117, 8530, '<td valign="top">A very good shot but subject matter doesn''t grab me. I do like the angle that captures the lighting at the top, though.</td>', 'A very good shot but subject matter doesn''t grab me. I do like the angle that captures the lighting at the top, though.', '2003-05-27 09:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(307718, 22633, 8530, '<td valign="top">The sky tone against the clouds is rather distracting, which detracts somewhat from the shot of the building itself. Looks a bit unnatural, like the building was placed against a different background. The angle on the building vs the lighting is, however, absolutely perfect.</td>', 'The sky tone against the clouds is rather distracting, which detracts somewhat from the shot of the building itself. Looks a bit unnatural, like the building was placed against a different background. The angle on the building vs the lighting is, however, absolutely perfect.', '2003-05-27 09:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(307719, 22776, 8530, '<td valign="top">Wow, this could have come straight from an old movie or be the cover of an old mystery book. Where DID you find that phone? Very good shot, excellent colour choices.</td>', 'Wow, this could have come straight from an old movie or be the cover of an old mystery book. Where DID you find that phone? Very good shot, excellent colour choices.', '2003-05-27 09:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(307720, 22658, 6035, '<td valign="top">oohhh.. i like it.. i''ve always gloved glossy surfaces like this.. and the reflections you have are just right.. i''m not sure of the positioning of the chain itself in the framing, but i couldn''t tell you how to improve on it, so i''ll say that it''s good :)</td>', 'oohhh.. i like it.. i''ve always gloved glossy surfaces like this.. and the reflections you have are just right.. i''m not sure of the positioning of the chain itself in the framing, but i couldn''t tell you how to improve on it, so i''ll say that it''s good :)', '2003-05-27 09:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(307722, 22450, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting architectural scene.  There appears to be a lot of detail in this structure...  It could also work well as a vertical composition where the door would also be visible.  This photo seems to be either under exposed or shot in poor lighting.  The tonal range is rather flat and the contrast is weak... a different lighting situation may possibly improve this quite a bit :) = 5</td>', 'This is a very interesting architectural scene.  There appears to be a lot of detail in this structure...  It could also work well as a vertical composition where the door would also be visible.  This photo seems to be either under exposed or shot in poor lighting.  The tonal range is rather flat and the contrast is weak... a different lighting situation may possibly improve this quite a bit :) = 5', '2003-05-27 09:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(307723, 22752, 8530, '<td valign="top">Although this is an interesting shot, I''m not sure it really constitutes a duotone. Bronzer lips might have increased the feel of a duotone.</td>', 'Although this is an interesting shot, I''m not sure it really constitutes a duotone. Bronzer lips might have increased the feel of a duotone.', '2003-05-27 09:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(307724, 22792, 8530, '<td valign="top">That is a very surreal-looking shot. Interesting choice of colour, gives it a very abstract feel, which presumably is the point. I''m curious how you set this up.</td>', 'That is a very surreal-looking shot. Interesting choice of colour, gives it a very abstract feel, which presumably is the point. I''m curious how you set this up.', '2003-05-27 09:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(307725, 22698, 772, '<td valign="top">good setup here for a product shot... it''s a bit over exposed... = 4</td>', 'good setup here for a product shot... it''s a bit over exposed... = 4', '2003-05-27 09:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(307727, 22683, 8530, '<td valign="top">Although it looks good in B&amp;W, this subject has been done to death, so my interest level is a little low. It is an interesting angle to do this at.</td>', 'Although it looks good in B&W, this subject has been done to death, so my interest level is a little low. It is an interesting angle to do this at.', '2003-05-27 09:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(307728, 22785, 772, '<td valign="top">this is a beautiful shot... the detail and lighting are excellent... compositionally, i don''t care much for the left to right orientation... i think a diagonal would really enhance this quite a bit :) = 8</td>', 'this is a beautiful shot... the detail and lighting are excellent... compositionally, i don''t care much for the left to right orientation... i think a diagonal would really enhance this quite a bit :) = 8', '2003-05-27 09:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(307729, 22780, 8530, '<td valign="top">Neat. Not a topic I would have ever thought of, myself, but it works very well in the tone it''s in, seems perfectly natural to see it in that colour, except for the very distracting Pepsi cans in the background. If it weren''t for the modern design on those it would have come across well as an old photograph, which is how the rest of it feels.</td>', 'Neat. Not a topic I would have ever thought of, myself, but it works very well in the tone it''s in, seems perfectly natural to see it in that colour, except for the very distracting Pepsi cans in the background. If it weren''t for the modern design on those it would have come across well as an old photograph, which is how the rest of it feels.', '2003-05-27 09:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(307730, 22308, 8530, '<td valign="top">A nice portrait photo that is well suited to B&amp;W. Very pretty model. I like the lighting and the way it catches the hair.</td>', 'A nice portrait photo that is well suited to B&W. Very pretty model. I like the lighting and the way it catches the hair.', '2003-05-27 09:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(307734, 22069, 772, '<td valign="top">the curve in this shot is very elegant... the simple geometries of the architecture really seem to create a nice internal ''conflict'' with the pigeon on the ledge, but that pigeon adds a wonderful touch to this photo :)  The image seems just a tad noisy and slightly over exposde though.  = 7</td>', 'the curve in this shot is very elegant... the simple geometries of the architecture really seem to create a nice internal ''conflict'' with the pigeon on the ledge, but that pigeon adds a wonderful touch to this photo :)  The image seems just a tad noisy and slightly over exposde though.  = 7', '2003-05-27 09:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(307737, 22199, 8530, '<td valign="top">I do like the shade chosen for this. The focus on the flower may be a little too close, as the missing edges of petals is a little too obvious.</td>', 'I do like the shade chosen for this. The focus on the flower may be a little too close, as the missing edges of petals is a little too obvious.', '2003-05-27 09:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(307738, 22763, 8530, '<td valign="top">I almost missed that the face was visible in the knife at first. As interesting as that blade is, I wonder if something a little less irregularly shaped would have worked better for this. Maybe a slightly different angle so the eye wasn''t nearly cut off? (No pun intended.)</td>', 'I almost missed that the face was visible in the knife at first. As interesting as that blade is, I wonder if something a little less irregularly shaped would have worked better for this. Maybe a slightly different angle so the eye wasn''t nearly cut off? (No pun intended.)', '2003-05-27 09:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(307740, 22700, 8530, '<td valign="top">Hrm. Maybe a slightly more sepia tone to emphasize the ''old'' part? I''m not sure, there''s just a little tinge of dissatisfaction in me in this. The shot may be a little too crisp, alternately, for the tone.</td>', 'Hrm. Maybe a slightly more sepia tone to emphasize the ''old'' part? I''m not sure, there''s just a little tinge of dissatisfaction in me in this. The shot may be a little too crisp, alternately, for the tone.', '2003-05-27 09:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(307741, 22784, 8488, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t look like an actual duotone to me, rather like a color shot you turned down most of the brightness on the other color channels for. I have to grade it down a bit to leave room for things that more properly fit the topic.</td>', 'This doesn''t look like an actual duotone to me, rather like a color shot you turned down most of the brightness on the other color channels for. I have to grade it down a bit to leave room for things that more properly fit the topic.', '2003-05-27 09:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(307742, 22752, 8488, '<td valign="top">Ok, it''s not a duotone when you use multiple colors that aren''t either black or white (there''s a sepiaish color, and a red one, here). To me. So I''m grading it down to leave room for things that fit the theme better.</td>', 'Ok, it''s not a duotone when you use multiple colors that aren''t either black or white (there''s a sepiaish color, and a red one, here). To me. So I''m grading it down to leave room for things that fit the theme better.', '2003-05-27 09:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(307743, 22792, 8488, '<td valign="top">Ok, I see three colors here - black, white, and blue. I''m grading it down a bit to leave room for more traditional ''duotone'' interpretations.</td>', 'Ok, I see three colors here - black, white, and blue. I''m grading it down a bit to leave room for more traditional ''duotone'' interpretations.', '2003-05-27 09:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(307745, 22215, 8530, '<td valign="top">Hmm. I think in this case, centering the center of the structure might have worked better; I feel a little dizzy looking at this one. The lighting may be a bit too bright for a duotone, it feels a bit washed out.</td>', 'Hmm. I think in this case, centering the center of the structure might have worked better; I feel a little dizzy looking at this one. The lighting may be a bit too bright for a duotone, it feels a bit washed out.', '2003-05-27 09:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(307746, 22628, 8488, '<td valign="top">This looks full-color to me, so I have to grade it down a bit to leave room at the top for more ''traditional'' duotone interpretations.</td>', 'This looks full-color to me, so I have to grade it down a bit to leave room at the top for more ''traditional'' duotone interpretations.', '2003-05-27 09:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(307747, 22284, 8488, '<td valign="top">There''s nothing blatantly wrong with this shot, but unfortunately there''s nothing particularly enthralling about it, either. Her expression is blandly calm, and doesn''t add much. She''s a pretty girl, and it''s a decent photo of a pretty girl, but ... 7.</td>', 'There''s nothing blatantly wrong with this shot, but unfortunately there''s nothing particularly enthralling about it, either. Her expression is blandly calm, and doesn''t add much. She''s a pretty girl, and it''s a decent photo of a pretty girl, but ... 7.', '2003-05-27 09:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(307749, 22632, 5044, '<td valign="top">Beautiful daughter, Congrats!</td>', 'Beautiful daughter, Congrats!', '2003-05-27 09:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(307750, 22633, 5044, '<td valign="top">Great contrast, great mood!</td>', 'Great contrast, great mood!', '2003-05-27 10:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(307751, 22405, 5044, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but find it a little hard to figure out just what I''m looking at. Is it a stair railing and it''s shadow?</td>', 'I like the idea but find it a little hard to figure out just what I''m looking at. Is it a stair railing and it''s shadow?', '2003-05-27 10:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(307753, 22757, 5044, '<td valign="top">I find your cropping a little too agressive. I would have liked to see some context to see what we''re looking at. Perhaps it was not possible.</td>', 'I find your cropping a little too agressive. I would have liked to see some context to see what we''re looking at. Perhaps it was not possible.', '2003-05-27 10:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(307771, 22283, 8530, '<td valign="top">I like the grainy look of this photo, although I''m curious why given that you didn''t choose to go with sepia. It looks good in B&amp;W, mind you; it''s a nice shot, the flower stands out well from the background and it''s a good angle. But I associate grainy with old, and therefore am more inclined to think sepia.</td>', 'I like the grainy look of this photo, although I''m curious why given that you didn''t choose to go with sepia. It looks good in B&W, mind you; it''s a nice shot, the flower stands out well from the background and it''s a good angle. But I associate grainy with old, and therefore am more inclined to think sepia.', '2003-05-27 10:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(307773, 22466, 8530, '<td valign="top">I was trying to think of something clever to say involving bulls, but I''m afraid it''s too early in the morning. Not a topic that grabs me -- being from the Midwest I''ve seen far too many of these -- but I do like the up-close-and-personal shot of it and the black and white colouring suits it well.</td>', 'I was trying to think of something clever to say involving bulls, but I''m afraid it''s too early in the morning. Not a topic that grabs me -- being from the Midwest I''ve seen far too many of these -- but I do like the up-close-and-personal shot of it and the black and white colouring suits it well.', '2003-05-27 10:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(307774, 22658, 8530, '<td valign="top">Interesting glass-like texture on the chain. I like the lighting in this as well, which highlights what would probably otherwise not be a visible texture.</td>', 'Interesting glass-like texture on the chain. I like the lighting in this as well, which highlights what would probably otherwise not be a visible texture.', '2003-05-27 10:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(307775, 22274, 8530, '<td valign="top">I like the angle you did this at, makes the shadow very interesting with that curvature. A good subject for a duotone topic, IMO.</td>', 'I like the angle you did this at, makes the shadow very interesting with that curvature. A good subject for a duotone topic, IMO.', '2003-05-27 10:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(307776, 22703, 8530, '<td valign="top">This looks like a very old photo, as it''s surely meant to, and a very good setting for it as well. The people in it seem uncomfortable to be photographed (which if they were asked to dress up for this old-style photo I suppose I may understand), which has the drawback of making it look less like the ''welcome'' of the title.</td>', 'This looks like a very old photo, as it''s surely meant to, and a very good setting for it as well. The people in it seem uncomfortable to be photographed (which if they were asked to dress up for this old-style photo I suppose I may understand), which has the drawback of making it look less like the ''welcome'' of the title.', '2003-05-27 10:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(307777, 22470, 8530, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of shade for this -- I would have tended to think of a bluer tone for the ''cold'' part but the greenish tinge actually works quite well.</td>', 'Interesting choice of shade for this -- I would have tended to think of a bluer tone for the ''cold'' part but the greenish tinge actually works quite well.', '2003-05-27 10:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(307778, 22757, 8530, '<td valign="top">I actually find the shades of wood in the background more interesting than the signs themselves. I suspect I would have liked the composition better with the focus on the speed limit sign as the two other signs don''t come across as well in B&amp;W, whereas of course a speed limit sign is naturally.</td>', 'I actually find the shades of wood in the background more interesting than the signs themselves. I suspect I would have liked the composition better with the focus on the speed limit sign as the two other signs don''t come across as well in B&W, whereas of course a speed limit sign is naturally.', '2003-05-27 10:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(307779, 22146, 8530, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is gorgeous. The two-tone aspect seems very natural with the sunlight as it is, and I like the way it starts bright at the top with a fade to the deep shadows at the bottom edge. The only real flaw is the horse might have looked better either against the brighter portion or against a deeper one.</td>', 'Wow, this is gorgeous. The two-tone aspect seems very natural with the sunlight as it is, and I like the way it starts bright at the top with a fade to the deep shadows at the bottom edge. The only real flaw is the horse might have looked better either against the brighter portion or against a deeper one.', '2003-05-27 10:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(307781, 22791, 8530, '<td valign="top">I swear I just saw this guy in New Orleans. Nice play on words, the tone versus the subject.</td>', 'I swear I just saw this guy in New Orleans. Nice play on words, the tone versus the subject.', '2003-05-27 10:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(307797, 22692, 1202, '<td valign="top">Too bad the car had to be there.  Nice comp[osition.   5</td>', 'Too bad the car had to be there.  Nice comp[osition.   5', '2003-05-27 11:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(307800, 22510, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting duotone... beautiful landscape as well... The only problem I have with this image is the tone chosen for the duotone... It seems to be in direct conflict with the scene.  The warmer sepia gold/orange/yellow tint doesn''t seem to work well for the cold snowy scene for me... = 5</td>', 'interesting duotone... beautiful landscape as well... The only problem I have with this image is the tone chosen for the duotone... It seems to be in direct conflict with the scene.  The warmer sepia gold/orange/yellow tint doesn''t seem to work well for the cold snowy scene for me... = 5', '2003-05-27 11:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(307803, 22620, 1202, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but a kind of unprecidented angle.   It may have been better if you had waited for a more traditional shot.   The light was good so it would have been super.  6</td>', 'Nice shot but a kind of unprecidented angle.   It may have been better if you had waited for a more traditional shot.   The light was good so it would have been super.  6', '2003-05-27 11:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
