(307854, 22335, 1202, '<td valign="top">All of your subject matter is quite distant,leaving nothing in particular for the viewer to observe.   I think you should try to pick something of particular interest for the foreground and then let that take you into the scene.   Keep shooting.  4</td>', 'All of your subject matter is quite distant,leaving nothing in particular for the viewer to observe.   I think you should try to pick something of particular interest for the foreground and then let that take you into the scene.   Keep shooting.  4', '2003-05-27 12:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
