(307865, 22420, 1202, '<td valign="top">You have a wonderful subject but you didn''t do her justice.  I see two things that need attention.  The hair on her arm is distracting and her pose makes one eye appear larger than the other.  It is open more showig more of the white.  4</td>', 'You have a wonderful subject but you didn''t do her justice.  I see two things that need attention.  The hair on her arm is distracting and her pose makes one eye appear larger than the other.  It is open more showig more of the white.  4', '2003-05-27 12:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
