(307968, 22283, 6008, '<td valign="top">I normally like grain in some images when used for impact, but I think the grain in this image is a little too excessive. I think this may have been better with a more plain background, or a textured one, but some of the leaves are  little distracting - mostly the top right and on the left near the flower. More contrast and less grain on the petals would have really enhanced it more too.</td>', 'I normally like grain in some images when used for impact, but I think the grain in this image is a little too excessive. I think this may have been better with a more plain background, or a textured one, but some of the leaves are  little distracting - mostly the top right and on the left near the flower. More contrast and less grain on the petals would have really enhanced it more too.', '2003-05-27 14:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(307981, 22625, 6008, '<td valign="top">The expression on her face is good and the skintones are complimentary. I''m not a fan of the screen, at least not with the white flecks that show up in it. Because the boy''s face is slightly cropped out it makes it more of a distraction to me, as does her arm. My eyes are drawn naturally to the little girl, and also wondering at what they are looking at. Either having both faces completely in the shot or just the girl''s (and not the screen) would have had a better impact in my opinion.</td>', 'The expression on her face is good and the skintones are complimentary. I''m not a fan of the screen, at least not with the white flecks that show up in it. Because the boy''s face is slightly cropped out it makes it more of a distraction to me, as does her arm. My eyes are drawn naturally to the little girl, and also wondering at what they are looking at. Either having both faces completely in the shot or just the girl''s (and not the screen) would have had a better impact in my opinion.', '2003-05-27 14:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(307989, 22635, 2677, '<td valign="top">rotate 1 or 2 degrees clock-wise</td>', 'rotate 1 or 2 degrees clock-wise', '2003-05-27 14:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(307990, 22284, 7857, '<td valign="top">This is a really great shot. DOF is spot on IMO, nice sharp focus on her face, and those eyes... Great job. Couldn''t find anything to fault and I even thought the unusual border method was effective and an interesting change, so... 10</td>', 'This is a really great shot. DOF is spot on IMO, nice sharp focus on her face, and those eyes... Great job. Couldn''t find anything to fault and I even thought the unusual border method was effective and an interesting change, so... 10', '2003-05-27 14:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(307991, 22688, 6008, '<td valign="top">The texture and shadows are good, but for my personal taste I find there isnt really much here to hold my attention. It may just be that I do not appreciate this style of photography, and whereas I dont see anything ''wrong'' with it, I just dont get a feeling of ''wow'' or ''interesting''</td>', 'The texture and shadows are good, but for my personal taste I find there isnt really much here to hold my attention. It may just be that I do not appreciate this style of photography, and whereas I dont see anything ''wrong'' with it, I just dont get a feeling of ''wow'' or ''interesting''', '2003-05-27 14:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(307992, 22626, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, nice focus on the flower and leaves with the backdrop slightly out of focus. Good Job.</td>', 'Nice subject, nice focus on the flower and leaves with the backdrop slightly out of focus. Good Job.', '2003-05-27 14:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(307993, 22728, 7857, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast made by the spot-light on the walls compared to the sky. Great shot.</td>', 'I like the contrast made by the spot-light on the walls compared to the sky. Great shot.', '2003-05-27 14:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(307996, 22082, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nicely picks out the detail on the mouldings. Nice shot</td>', 'Nicely picks out the detail on the mouldings. Nice shot', '2003-05-27 14:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(308008, 22790, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the subject matter - the wheelbarrow. The image has some grain to it, which I''m not sure if it''s intentional or not. The image also seems a little flat, which causes the top of the wheelbarrow to blend in with the background too much. More depth of field and contrast would probably bring the wheelbarrow out more and give the image more impact.</td>', 'I like the subject matter - the wheelbarrow. The image has some grain to it, which I''m not sure if it''s intentional or not. The image also seems a little flat, which causes the top of the wheelbarrow to blend in with the background too much. More depth of field and contrast would probably bring the wheelbarrow out more and give the image more impact.', '2003-05-27 14:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(308046, 22792, 6008, '<td valign="top">This almost reminds me of a matrix shot. It''s strange and surreal and I like it! I have no idea what it is, but the colors are appealing, the lines are intriguing, and the person in the middle just makes me curious. All good elements to me. The only slight negative I see is the slight purple tinge on the upper/lower left ''wall''</td>', 'This almost reminds me of a matrix shot. It''s strange and surreal and I like it! I have no idea what it is, but the colors are appealing, the lines are intriguing, and the person in the middle just makes me curious. All good elements to me. The only slight negative I see is the slight purple tinge on the upper/lower left ''wall''', '2003-05-27 15:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(308121, 22685, 4810, '<td valign="top">Flott mynd. Lýsingin hæfileg. Meira svona.</td>', 'Flott mynd. Lýsingin hæfileg. Meira svona.', '2003-05-27 16:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(308134, 22023, 3102, '<td valign="top">A good concept... although I think it may have been stronger had the placement of the car behind the mailbox been a little different.  The car seems a little awkwardly-placed as it is here.</td>', 'A good concept... although I think it may have been stronger had the placement of the car behind the mailbox been a little different.  The car seems a little awkwardly-placed as it is here.', '2003-05-27 17:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(308135, 22734, 3102, '<td valign="top">You''re looking a bit devious!  :)  Nice detail and lighting -- very nice.</td>', 'You''re looking a bit devious!  :)  Nice detail and lighting -- very nice.', '2003-05-27 17:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(308136, 22703, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice -- certainly looks straight out of the past!  My only nitpick would be that you probably should have kept their feet within the shot.  Otherwise, it looks straight out of an old family album.  Well done!</td>', 'Nice -- certainly looks straight out of the past!  My only nitpick would be that you probably should have kept their feet within the shot.  Otherwise, it looks straight out of an old family album.  Well done!', '2003-05-27 17:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(308138, 22463, 3102, '<td valign="top">I like it!  It looks to me like it could be slightly sharper, but it''s a great concept.  It looks like something that could be used in an advertisement, although I''ll admit I have no idea for what :)  Could be a great image for a "Caption This Photo" contest!</td>', 'I like it!  It looks to me like it could be slightly sharper, but it''s a great concept.  It looks like something that could be used in an advertisement, although I''ll admit I have no idea for what :)  Could be a great image for a "Caption This Photo" contest!', '2003-05-27 17:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(308139, 22510, 3102, '<td valign="top">Seems just a bit overdone to me.  It certainly looks like a beautiful landscape from an incredible vantage point, but I can''t help but think that it looks like there was some sort of nuclear testing going on nearby :)</td>', 'Seems just a bit overdone to me.  It certainly looks like a beautiful landscape from an incredible vantage point, but I can''t help but think that it looks like there was some sort of nuclear testing going on nearby :)', '2003-05-27 17:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(308141, 22782, 2716, '<td valign="top">I love your main subject, however I''d like to see a cleaner background.  Great range of tones.  Good job.  Jacko.  7</td>', 'I love your main subject, however I''d like to see a cleaner background.  Great range of tones.  Good job.  Jacko.  7', '2003-05-27 18:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(308142, 22257, 2716, '<td valign="top">lol.  Great T-Shirt.  Very creative.  Good luck.  Jacko.  8  thanks for the smiles.</td>', 'lol.  Great T-Shirt.  Very creative.  Good luck.  Jacko.  8  thanks for the smiles.', '2003-05-27 18:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(308143, 22395, 2716, '<td valign="top">wonderful tones.  I like the layered look  in their picture.  Good luck.  Jacko.  7</td>', 'wonderful tones.  I like the layered look  in their picture.  Good luck.  Jacko.  7', '2003-05-27 18:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(308146, 22743, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nixce action shot.  how did you get the black background.  Good luck.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'Nixce action shot.  how did you get the black background.  Good luck.  Jacko.  8', '2003-05-27 18:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(308147, 22620, 2716, '<td valign="top">wow wonderful shot.  I really like the composition ... the lines leading from the corner.  I usually don''t say this, but I find the border distracting.  It think it''s the color.  I still find it a great shot.   Jacko.  9</td>', 'wow wonderful shot.  I really like the composition ... the lines leading from the corner.  I usually don''t say this, but I find the border distracting.  It think it''s the color.  I still find it a great shot.   Jacko.  9', '2003-05-27 18:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(308150, 22617, 3540, '<td valign="top">This photo intrigues me a little as a good action shot for the most part.  I really think the framing is too far right of center.  I think it would work for me better if she were running more left to right and not so much forward.  The other thing that bothers me about this a little as a matter of personal preference, is the leg on the left.  I know she''s running and all, but its altogether unnatural looking.  I can very well appreciate the extreme clarity of this shot for being a stop action.  It really is very stopped.  I think put her a little right of center and this shot gets another point from me, and maybe 2.</td>', 'This photo intrigues me a little as a good action shot for the most part.  I really think the framing is too far right of center.  I think it would work for me better if she were running more left to right and not so much forward.  The other thing that bothers me about this a little as a matter of personal preference, is the leg on the left.  I know she''s running and all, but its altogether unnatural looking.  I can very well appreciate the extreme clarity of this shot for being a stop action.  It really is very stopped.  I think put her a little right of center and this shot gets another point from me, and maybe 2.', '2003-05-27 18:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(308152, 22633, 3540, '<td valign="top">Awesome contrast from the left to the right side.  Love the separation and layering of the church, it looks like it was cut out and stuck to an underexposed layer of batting.  I would''ve like to have seen more of this church, but I''m sure that some of the layering would be lost by moving the focal point of the camera back toward the lens.  Excellent shot.  I originally gave this a 7.  Today I see it as an 8.</td>', 'Awesome contrast from the left to the right side.  Love the separation and layering of the church, it looks like it was cut out and stuck to an underexposed layer of batting.  I would''ve like to have seen more of this church, but I''m sure that some of the layering would be lost by moving the focal point of the camera back toward the lens.  Excellent shot.  I originally gave this a 7.  Today I see it as an 8.', '2003-05-27 18:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(308153, 22049, 7350, '<td valign="top">Nice detail.  Works well in B/W.</td>', 'Nice detail.  Works well in B/W.', '2003-05-27 18:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(308154, 22145, 7350, '<td valign="top">I wish we didn''t have the "stuff" on the left side.  Would have been better with just the hands.</td>', 'I wish we didn''t have the "stuff" on the left side.  Would have been better with just the hands.', '2003-05-27 18:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(308156, 22705, 3540, '<td valign="top">The tonal quality of this photo is just a little too brown for my tastes.  A worthy subject, but not an exceptional one.  I think an alternate perspective might do this castle a bit more justice.  Not bad as is, but I think there is a better way to make us perceive this.</td>', 'The tonal quality of this photo is just a little too brown for my tastes.  A worthy subject, but not an exceptional one.  I think an alternate perspective might do this castle a bit more justice.  Not bad as is, but I think there is a better way to make us perceive this.', '2003-05-27 18:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(308157, 22693, 7350, '<td valign="top">I like this one.  Maybe just a little too dark on the car there.</td>', 'I like this one.  Maybe just a little too dark on the car there.', '2003-05-27 18:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(308158, 22696, 7350, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the top of the image - where your background seems to end, but the photo doesn''t.</td>', 'I don''t like the top of the image - where your background seems to end, but the photo doesn''t.', '2003-05-27 18:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(308159, 22470, 7350, '<td valign="top">Somewhat of an uninteresting subject, but a good setup.</td>', 'Somewhat of an uninteresting subject, but a good setup.', '2003-05-27 18:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(308164, 22500, 3540, '<td valign="top">I like the soft look to this photo.  Diffusion filter?  If so, what one... I must know as I''m in the market for one that does this.  My softness in my photos comes from PS (not challenge photos of course).   The cat is average cute.  It has a peculiar look to it but I can''t tell you why exactly.  The framing is too tight where my mind says "big" to the cat without knowing its size exactly.  generally "big" and "cute" are hard to find in the same sentence.  I''d have preferred to see it much smaller in the frame.  \"small\" and \"cute\" are a little more apt to be uttered in the same breath.  Just feeling long-winded today.....</td>', 'I like the soft look to this photo.  Diffusion filter?  If so, what one... I must know as I''m in the market for one that does this.  My softness in my photos comes from PS (not challenge photos of course).   The cat is average cute.  It has a peculiar look to it but I can''t tell you why exactly.  The framing is too tight where my mind says "big" to the cat without knowing its size exactly.  generally "big" and "cute" are hard to find in the same sentence.  I''d have preferred to see it much smaller in the frame.  \"small\" and \"cute\" are a little more apt to be uttered in the same breath.  Just feeling long-winded today.....', '2003-05-27 18:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(308165, 22214, 7350, '<td valign="top">Seems almost dream-like...</td>', 'Seems almost dream-like...', '2003-05-27 18:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(308166, 22213, 7350, '<td valign="top">Is this in Chicago?  I seem to remember something like this when I was last there...<br/> <br/>Anyway, a little dark/shadowy for my taste.</td>', 'Is this in Chicago?  I seem to remember something like this when I was last there... Anyway, a little dark/shadowy for my taste.', '2003-05-27 18:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(308167, 22732, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a picture that''s been on my mind all day.  It hit me what it is about it that I would have like to see different.  It may be a pre-conception from prior pictures, but hear me out...  I think I would like this photo better if the man''s left hand were on the fretboard and focused rather than on his instrument.   I think that for a couple of reasons.  #1 - I think that the focus should be on the musician, not the instrument.  Just seems like it should be that way to me unless this was a very noteworthy guitar like BB King''s Lucille or EVHs 5150 Guitar.   #2 - It would keep the musician sort of focused and not quite so blurry.  This looks like it could be Ashton Kutcher from That 70''s Show.   Good luck with this one.  It does have some appeal.  I don''t want you to think that I hate it.  I play the guitar myself :)</td>', 'This is a picture that''s been on my mind all day.  It hit me what it is about it that I would have like to see different.  It may be a pre-conception from prior pictures, but hear me out...  I think I would like this photo better if the man''s left hand were on the fretboard and focused rather than on his instrument.   I think that for a couple of reasons.  #1 - I think that the focus should be on the musician, not the instrument.  Just seems like it should be that way to me unless this was a very noteworthy guitar like BB King''s Lucille or EVHs 5150 Guitar.   #2 - It would keep the musician sort of focused and not quite so blurry.  This looks like it could be Ashton Kutcher from That 70''s Show.   Good luck with this one.  It does have some appeal.  I don''t want you to think that I hate it.  I play the guitar myself :)', '2003-05-27 19:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(308173, 22633, 1897, '<td valign="top">quite a sense of depth,  the build and the sky look like seperate levels.  the building is extremely sharp/</td>', 'quite a sense of depth,  the build and the sky look like seperate levels.  the building is extremely sharp/', '2003-05-27 19:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(308175, 22308, 1897, '<td valign="top">nice soft portrait<br/></td>', 'nice soft portrait', '2003-05-27 19:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(308177, 22284, 1897, '<td valign="top">beautiful eyes and face. the crop is quite dramatic, but I am not sure it is optimal<br/> <br/>the catchlights in the eyes obscure some detail, and make them look a little blurred.  I like the natural look, but for this shot I wish the skin were a little more uniform.</td>', 'beautiful eyes and face. the crop is quite dramatic, but I am not sure it is optimal the catchlights in the eyes obscure some detail, and make them look a little blurred.  I like the natural look, but for this shot I wish the skin were a little more uniform.', '2003-05-27 19:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(308195, 22730, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent work... i love the strong geometries in this photo... they create a very busy, but somehow, harmonious image.  = 9</td>', 'excellent work... i love the strong geometries in this photo... they create a very busy, but somehow, harmonious image.  = 9', '2003-05-27 20:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
