(308705, 22695, 6359, '<td valign="top">This is a nice old fashion looking picture. good job.<br/>I just wished you had cropped a little differently, at least for me.<br/>If you click on the restore down button, and leave the width as normal and start shrinking vertically. Then have your picture start right where the right side bottom corner is touching the water/rock junction meet. This would make me focus more on the bridge.</td>', 'This is a nice old fashion looking picture. good job.I just wished you had cropped a little differently, at least for me.If you click on the restore down button, and leave the width as normal and start shrinking vertically. Then have your picture start right where the right side bottom corner is touching the water/rock junction meet. This would make me focus more on the bridge.', '2003-05-28 05:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(308709, 22658, 6359, '<td valign="top">Just a little too dark for me. I would have like a touch of diffused ligt in the background to lighten up the picture.</td>', 'Just a little too dark for me. I would have like a touch of diffused ligt in the background to lighten up the picture.', '2003-05-28 05:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(308711, 22777, 6359, '<td valign="top">A little dark for my taste.</td>', 'A little dark for my taste.', '2003-05-28 05:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(308712, 22665, 6359, '<td valign="top">Nice looking shot. The sepia look works for this picture.</td>', 'Nice looking shot. The sepia look works for this picture.', '2003-05-28 06:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(308714, 22792, 6359, '<td valign="top">Ok, you got me stumped.  Normally I would say there are more than two colors.<br/>But, your picture really makes me want to focus only on two....<br/>So, how should I vote.....<br/>I will give you a 6 and hope other aren''t so harsh like me as far as the color tones.</td>', 'Ok, you got me stumped.  Normally I would say there are more than two colors.But, your picture really makes me want to focus only on two....So, how should I vote.....I will give you a 6 and hope other aren''t so harsh like me as far as the color tones.', '2003-05-28 06:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(308715, 22450, 6359, '<td valign="top">Picture is about 1-3 degrees off. You seem to have been a little to the left of the church.</td>', 'Picture is about 1-3 degrees off. You seem to have been a little to the left of the church.', '2003-05-28 06:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(308716, 22463, 6359, '<td valign="top">Did you take a picture with head turn a little towards the camera, the same turn as the dog? just wondering.</td>', 'Did you take a picture with head turn a little towards the camera, the same turn as the dog? just wondering.', '2003-05-28 06:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(308719, 22429, 6359, '<td valign="top">A little tilted.</td>', 'A little tilted.', '2003-05-28 06:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(308720, 22750, 6359, '<td valign="top">Too bad the left person was moving when you took the picture.</td>', 'Too bad the left person was moving when you took the picture.', '2003-05-28 06:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(308722, 22787, 6359, '<td valign="top">I think I would want more to see the color version in stead of this B&amp;W.<br/>Nice capture of the waterfall.</td>', 'I think I would want more to see the color version in stead of this B&W.Nice capture of the waterfall.', '2003-05-28 06:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(308723, 22700, 6359, '<td valign="top">Great shot.</td>', 'Great shot.', '2003-05-28 06:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(308726, 22680, 6359, '<td valign="top">Have I seen you before?  Were you in a macro shot?</td>', 'Have I seen you before?  Were you in a macro shot?', '2003-05-28 07:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(308728, 22633, 6359, '<td valign="top">Something about clouds and a focus picture in a duotone color works for me.</td>', 'Something about clouds and a focus picture in a duotone color works for me.', '2003-05-28 07:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(308730, 22471, 6359, '<td valign="top">I wish you had cropped out the light at the bottom. maybe starting from the window or door above the light. just leaving a tint of the light shadow.<br/>Thats would be my picture.</td>', 'I wish you had cropped out the light at the bottom. maybe starting from the window or door above the light. just leaving a tint of the light shadow.Thats would be my picture.', '2003-05-28 07:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(308737, 22410, 6359, '<td valign="top">Did you mean to put the boy off center. He don''t appear to follow the 1/3 rules?</td>', 'Did you mean to put the boy off center. He don''t appear to follow the 1/3 rules?', '2003-05-28 07:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(308894, 22620, 4517, '<td valign="top">Nice colour and subject, i also like the frame. 9</td>', 'Nice colour and subject, i also like the frame. 9', '2003-05-28 10:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(308895, 22362, 4517, '<td valign="top">Made me laugh. Very sharp and clean image. 10</td>', 'Made me laugh. Very sharp and clean image. 10', '2003-05-28 10:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(308897, 22295, 4517, '<td valign="top">This is going in my favorites when the voting is over. 10</td>', 'This is going in my favorites when the voting is over. 10', '2003-05-28 10:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(308921, 22785, 8987, '<td valign="top">I really like the picture and the tone ...</td>', 'I really like the picture and the tone ...', '2003-05-28 10:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(309021, 22471, 3706, '<td valign="top">nice shot, not sure if i like the use of the red/brown, seems a little garish on the left side, but overall, good shot :)</td>', 'nice shot, not sure if i like the use of the red/brown, seems a little garish on the left side, but overall, good shot :)', '2003-05-28 12:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(309054, 22705, 4517, '<td valign="top">A little bright and orange for my taste.</td>', 'A little bright and orange for my taste.', '2003-05-28 13:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(309072, 22194, 7350, '<td valign="top">I love the clean black background.  I''ve been working on that--it''s difficult to achieve.</td>', 'I love the clean black background.  I''ve been working on that--it''s difficult to achieve.', '2003-05-28 13:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(309074, 22766, 7350, '<td valign="top">For some reason, I really like this one.  It calls to me - I think it is the good inclusion of both light and dark tones in the sepia shot.</td>', 'For some reason, I really like this one.  It calls to me - I think it is the good inclusion of both light and dark tones in the sepia shot.', '2003-05-28 13:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(309078, 22618, 811, '<td valign="top">Simple, but very interesting.  Good lighting -- effective, but not too harsh.</td>', 'Simple, but very interesting.  Good lighting -- effective, but not too harsh.', '2003-05-28 13:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(309080, 22618, 7350, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting.  How did you achieve this?</td>', 'I really like the lighting.  How did you achieve this?', '2003-05-28 13:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(309084, 22410, 811, '<td valign="top">Great capture of emotion, but I think it may be cropped a little too close on the right, I think</td>', 'Great capture of emotion, but I think it may be cropped a little too close on the right, I think', '2003-05-28 13:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(309085, 22362, 7350, '<td valign="top">Seems like the haunted house ride at Disneyland.</td>', 'Seems like the haunted house ride at Disneyland.', '2003-05-28 13:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(309086, 22057, 7350, '<td valign="top">I love this one.  There is a stark contrast in colors and in subjects.  It is very appealing.</td>', 'I love this one.  There is a stark contrast in colors and in subjects.  It is very appealing.', '2003-05-28 13:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(309090, 22023, 7350, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.</td>', 'Interesting idea.', '2003-05-28 13:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(309095, 22776, 7350, '<td valign="top">I just wish the edge of the lamp in the distance were not complicating this composition.</td>', 'I just wish the edge of the lamp in the distance were not complicating this composition.', '2003-05-28 13:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(309100, 22458, 7350, '<td valign="top">Halloween mask, maybe?  Anyway, the tone/color choice is perfect for this, and the focus is good on the mask, but not as good on the tape measure.  Also, I wish the tape measure were perfectly vertical in this one.</td>', 'Halloween mask, maybe?  Anyway, the tone/color choice is perfect for this, and the focus is good on the mask, but not as good on the tape measure.  Also, I wish the tape measure were perfectly vertical in this one.', '2003-05-28 13:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(309135, 22637, 811, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  I lvoe the contrasts you have shown here.  Very well done.</td>', 'Awesome.  I lvoe the contrasts you have shown here.  Very well done.', '2003-05-28 14:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(309153, 22751, 811, '<td valign="top">This shot is an excellent example of how using duotone can improve a picture.  It really gives it character, I think.  In color, I can imagine it would be busy, or down right obnoxious.</td>', 'This shot is an excellent example of how using duotone can improve a picture.  It really gives it character, I think.  In color, I can imagine it would be busy, or down right obnoxious.', '2003-05-28 14:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(309165, 22403, 811, '<td valign="top">Very nice perspective you have shot from here.  Awesome shot.</td>', 'Very nice perspective you have shot from here.  Awesome shot.', '2003-05-28 14:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(309172, 22753, 811, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic and effective lighting.  I also like the simplicity of it.</td>', 'Very dramatic and effective lighting.  I also like the simplicity of it.', '2003-05-28 14:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(309180, 22275, 811, '<td valign="top">I love the patterns.  Great work.  This is a shot to just sit and stare at a while, I think.</td>', 'I love the patterns.  Great work.  This is a shot to just sit and stare at a while, I think.', '2003-05-28 14:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(309185, 22620, 811, '<td valign="top">Beautiful horse, beautiful tones.  Great work.</td>', 'Beautiful horse, beautiful tones.  Great work.', '2003-05-28 14:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(309227, 22656, 8996, '<td valign="top">i love this. the light grey in the clouds contrast with the bridge perfectly.</td>', 'i love this. the light grey in the clouds contrast with the bridge perfectly.', '2003-05-28 14:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(309284, 22769, 7350, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely fantastic.  I''m giving it a 10.  Great lighting, great toning, great composition.</td>', 'This is absolutely fantastic.  I''m giving it a 10.  Great lighting, great toning, great composition.', '2003-05-28 15:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(309288, 22466, 7350, '<td valign="top">I need just a little more at the bottom to complete the face.</td>', 'I need just a little more at the bottom to complete the face.', '2003-05-28 15:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(309296, 22683, 7350, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the angle.  I think that from a little higher up, the splash would be better suited.</td>', 'I don''t like the angle.  I think that from a little higher up, the splash would be better suited.', '2003-05-28 15:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(309324, 22284, 7517, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  Not only is it composed, and exposed well, the subject is attractive as well.  Good clean work.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  Not only is it composed, and exposed well, the subject is attractive as well.  Good clean work.', '2003-05-28 15:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(309328, 22510, 2923, '<td valign="top">thought the border is supposed to be simple.  Interesting image, however, not quite sure it''d qualify for duotone in the traditional sense, as there is a clear separation of tones (rather than two tones throughout the whole image).</td>', 'thought the border is supposed to be simple.  Interesting image, however, not quite sure it''d qualify for duotone in the traditional sense, as there is a clear separation of tones (rather than two tones throughout the whole image).', '2003-05-28 15:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(309330, 22049, 2923, '<td valign="top">a bit more inrease in contrast would be better. Also, wider angle lens would work well (show the path).6</td>', 'a bit more inrease in contrast would be better. Also, wider angle lens would work well (show the path).6', '2003-05-28 15:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(309331, 22082, 2923, '<td valign="top">nice. 9</td>', 'nice. 9', '2003-05-28 15:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(309333, 22752, 2923, '<td valign="top">not a duotone image.</td>', 'not a duotone image.', '2003-05-28 15:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(309334, 22429, 2923, '<td valign="top">reminds me of donald duck :)</td>', 'reminds me of donald duck :)', '2003-05-28 15:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(309343, 22633, 7517, '<td valign="top">This is a really great shot.  I personally love duotone shots, and medeival looking architecture.  Composition is really nice, as well as the texture of the clouds in the background.  Great looking shot.</td>', 'This is a really great shot.  I personally love duotone shots, and medeival looking architecture.  Composition is really nice, as well as the texture of the clouds in the background.  Great looking shot.', '2003-05-28 15:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(309344, 22698, 7350, '<td valign="top">Just a little too blown out.  Lost the detail on the pips on the edges.</td>', 'Just a little too blown out.  Lost the detail on the pips on the edges.', '2003-05-28 15:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(309346, 22628, 7517, '<td valign="top">Great color.  Great composition.  Flowers have been done alot, but once in awhile if it''s done right it still makes for a great shot.  Nice work.</td>', 'Great color.  Great composition.  Flowers have been done alot, but once in awhile if it''s done right it still makes for a great shot.  Nice work.', '2003-05-28 15:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(309349, 22782, 7517, '<td valign="top">Normally I find landscape shots boring.  That''s just a personal preference.  However this is a great shot.  I think the duotone brings out all the great textures, and shapes.  I really like this shot.</td>', 'Normally I find landscape shots boring.  That''s just a personal preference.  However this is a great shot.  I think the duotone brings out all the great textures, and shapes.  I really like this shot.', '2003-05-28 15:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(309353, 22490, 7517, '<td valign="top">I really like abstract shots.  I like this shot, but It took me a minute to tell what it is.  That not necessarily a bad thing-sometimes that is what the photographer wants, is to be not so obvious.  In this paticular case I think that adding another element or changing the depth of field (a little) would help.</td>', 'I really like abstract shots.  I like this shot, but It took me a minute to tell what it is.  That not necessarily a bad thing-sometimes that is what the photographer wants, is to be not so obvious.  In this paticular case I think that adding another element or changing the depth of field (a little) would help.', '2003-05-28 15:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(309356, 22780, 7350, '<td valign="top">I really like the effect created by the welder.  The toning works great in this shot.</td>', 'I really like the effect created by the welder.  The toning works great in this shot.', '2003-05-28 15:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(309358, 22788, 7350, '<td valign="top">This seems more behind the rim, really, isn''t it?</td>', 'This seems more behind the rim, really, isn''t it?', '2003-05-28 15:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(309374, 22691, 5044, '<td valign="top">I like the textures in your windows, but I don''t like the crop. Obviously, there was too much to detract from the picture. Personally, I would have chosen to have fewer windows (vertically) in order to have a wider picture. But that''s just me.</td>', 'I like the textures in your windows, but I don''t like the crop. Obviously, there was too much to detract from the picture. Personally, I would have chosen to have fewer windows (vertically) in order to have a wider picture. But that''s just me.', '2003-05-28 15:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(309377, 22283, 6597, '<td valign="top">I like the texture on this rose</td>', 'I like the texture on this rose', '2003-05-28 16:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(309380, 22758, 811, '<td valign="top">Very dreamy.  Good use of soft focus.</td>', 'Very dreamy.  Good use of soft focus.', '2003-05-28 16:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(309381, 22768, 7350, '<td valign="top">The composition seems very stagnant.</td>', 'The composition seems very stagnant.', '2003-05-28 16:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(309382, 22692, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the way the flag is framing this, but the shot overall seems a little muted to me.  Perhaps more contrast would help.</td>', 'I like the way the flag is framing this, but the shot overall seems a little muted to me.  Perhaps more contrast would help.', '2003-05-28 16:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(309383, 22273, 7628, '<td valign="top">Gripping detail. The way light glistens off eyebrows, eyelashes and beard bristles give the photo demension.  Dimension really makes a duotone - so Isay perfect for this challenge!  but one tiny little thing - wish that corner of shoulder (?) wasn''t there.  9</td>', 'Gripping detail. The way light glistens off eyebrows, eyelashes and beard bristles give the photo demension.  Dimension really makes a duotone - so Isay perfect for this challenge!  but one tiny little thing - wish that corner of shoulder (?) wasn''t there.  9', '2003-05-28 16:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(309386, 22049, 7628, '<td valign="top">This is a great B&amp;W subject.  The way the shaddows carve out and define the space is wonderful.  All those layers of earth - tiny lines.  Nice job.  I keep bobbing my head up and down to see if my monitor is showing it right - it seems a little bright.  I would wish that the dark spot at the back of the photo - where the wall curves around and disappears, I wish it were black black - and if you could get it larger it would give a destination for the viewer eyes - "what''s around the next corner?"  The whole photo might look a bit better darker.  Play with levels?  Still I love it!  8</td>', 'This is a great B&W subject.  The way the shaddows carve out and define the space is wonderful.  All those layers of earth - tiny lines.  Nice job.  I keep bobbing my head up and down to see if my monitor is showing it right - it seems a little bright.  I would wish that the dark spot at the back of the photo - where the wall curves around and disappears, I wish it were black black - and if you could get it larger it would give a destination for the viewer eyes - "what''s around the next corner?"  The whole photo might look a bit better darker.  Play with levels?  Still I love it!  8', '2003-05-28 16:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(309393, 22627, 7628, '<td valign="top">The duotone works so well here where colors might be distracting.  This shows up the contrast between the clouds and the ducks -  tiny black silouettes against a grand luminous cumulous!  I like the darkness under the cloud - it emphasizes its weight.  and the gentler definition at the top.  Where were you?  You must have been very quik to get the camera up when the ducks flew by.  Wish the shutter speed had been high enough to freeze the wings - they are a little blurred, but I''m just being picky.  8</td>', 'The duotone works so well here where colors might be distracting.  This shows up the contrast between the clouds and the ducks -  tiny black silouettes against a grand luminous cumulous!  I like the darkness under the cloud - it emphasizes its weight.  and the gentler definition at the top.  Where were you?  You must have been very quik to get the camera up when the ducks flew by.  Wish the shutter speed had been high enough to freeze the wings - they are a little blurred, but I''m just being picky.  8', '2003-05-28 16:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(309407, 22617, 8530, '<td valign="top">The expression on her face looks irritated (hey! stop taking pictures of me in my underwear!) rather than the intent I would''ve expected from the title; I suspect I''m the only one who will be amused by that, though. Strange angle makes the left side (really the right side) of her body seem deformed -- might have been better from a different angle?</td>', 'The expression on her face looks irritated (hey! stop taking pictures of me in my underwear!) rather than the intent I would''ve expected from the title; I suspect I''m the only one who will be amused by that, though. Strange angle makes the left side (really the right side) of her body seem deformed -- might have been better from a different angle?', '2003-05-28 16:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(309408, 22767, 8530, '<td valign="top">Seems to be some pixellation artifacts along the edges -- I''m guessing this isn''t just a close crop but a fairly close shot, therefore. Though obviously a close shot framing the items is preferable to just cropping, in this case it might have been better to take the image from slightly further back and crop to avoid that.</td>', 'Seems to be some pixellation artifacts along the edges -- I''m guessing this isn''t just a close crop but a fairly close shot, therefore. Though obviously a close shot framing the items is preferable to just cropping, in this case it might have been better to take the image from slightly further back and crop to avoid that.', '2003-05-28 16:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(309409, 22307, 8530, '<td valign="top">*shudder* Eww. Eww eww eww EWW. But, uh, yes, that''s the pont, isn''t it? Very nice zoom.</td>', '*shudder* Eww. Eww eww eww EWW. But, uh, yes, that''s the pont, isn''t it? Very nice zoom.', '2003-05-28 16:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(309410, 22510, 8530, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot but I slightly question your choice of tones, because I''m afraid the first thing I thought was "Don''t you eat that yellow snow". A less intense tone might have been better.</td>', 'This is a very nice shot but I slightly question your choice of tones, because I''m afraid the first thing I thought was "Don''t you eat that yellow snow". A less intense tone might have been better.', '2003-05-28 16:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(309413, 22284, 8530, '<td valign="top">Very prettily framed, and nice light levels. I''m a little amused, though, by the fact that your title suggests a lack of makeup but it looks as if there is not only lip gloss but eyeliner and eyeshadow as well...</td>', 'Very prettily framed, and nice light levels. I''m a little amused, though, by the fact that your title suggests a lack of makeup but it looks as if there is not only lip gloss but eyeliner and eyeshadow as well...', '2003-05-28 16:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(309420, 22759, 8530, '<td valign="top">Technically adept and meets the challenge, but honestly does nothing for me personally.</td>', 'Technically adept and meets the challenge, but honestly does nothing for me personally.', '2003-05-28 16:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(309422, 22362, 8530, '<td valign="top">I''m kind of afraid to ask where you got this shot, although judging from the rest I''m guessing a local museum. Very nice angle. Not sure how much lighting and other staging was under your control but the light levels are very good and the shot is nice and crisp.</td>', 'I''m kind of afraid to ask where you got this shot, although judging from the rest I''m guessing a local museum. Very nice angle. Not sure how much lighting and other staging was under your control but the light levels are very good and the shot is nice and crisp.', '2003-05-28 16:52:31.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(309425, 22468, 8530, '<td valign="top">Inasmuch as the tone on this is about perfect, the angle really bugs me -- actually makes me a bit dizzy. So it''s pretty, but I can''t look at it. :/</td>', 'Inasmuch as the tone on this is about perfect, the angle really bugs me -- actually makes me a bit dizzy. So it''s pretty, but I can''t look at it. :/', '2003-05-28 16:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(309427, 22479, 8530, '<td valign="top">Hmm. The size and angle make the shot feel unbalanced. I understand needing to highlight the size of the bloom on the right but I can''t help but feel there had to be a way to make the result feel less awkward.</td>', 'Hmm. The size and angle make the shot feel unbalanced. I understand needing to highlight the size of the bloom on the right but I can''t help but feel there had to be a way to make the result feel less awkward.', '2003-05-28 16:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(309440, 22667, 8530, '<td valign="top">Interesting people-shadows, very freaky. I''m actually a lot more interested in the building section visible through the arch and wish you''d shown that more closely. I like the lighting and the image of the arch a lot and the freaky little people shadows actually detract for me because I''m a big architecture geek.</td>', 'Interesting people-shadows, very freaky. I''m actually a lot more interested in the building section visible through the arch and wish you''d shown that more closely. I like the lighting and the image of the arch a lot and the freaky little people shadows actually detract for me because I''m a big architecture geek.', '2003-05-28 17:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(309443, 22371, 8530, '<td valign="top">Oh, excellent! The colouring shows off the flaky parts of the hammer well, the depth of focus is extremely good, and the angle is lovely.</td>', 'Oh, excellent! The colouring shows off the flaky parts of the hammer well, the depth of focus is extremely good, and the angle is lovely.', '2003-05-28 17:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(309510, 22313, 4967, '<td valign="top">GREAT macro... this was through a screen correct?  it looks like it was, but I could be wrong.  Wow... the details are incredible on this little guy... I really like the sepia tone as well.  There''s a tad bit too much light on the tip of his nose, and on the shoulder that is on the right side of the photo, but otherwise this was done really well.  -9-</td>', 'GREAT macro... this was through a screen correct?  it looks like it was, but I could be wrong.  Wow... the details are incredible on this little guy... I really like the sepia tone as well.  There''s a tad bit too much light on the tip of his nose, and on the shoulder that is on the right side of the photo, but otherwise this was done really well.  -9-', '2003-05-28 18:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(309512, 22680, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice detail on the exoskelleton.  Very nice composition with the body of the bug coming down from the corner, his antenae waving in empty space.  small DOF allows the viewer to focus attention on the bug.  The shaddow in the back isn''t terribly distracting, I just keep looking at it wondering how it fits in.  I think this might work in color too.  But its dramatic in doutone. 8</td>', 'Nice detail on the exoskelleton.  Very nice composition with the body of the bug coming down from the corner, his antenae waving in empty space.  small DOF allows the viewer to focus attention on the bug.  The shaddow in the back isn''t terribly distracting, I just keep looking at it wondering how it fits in.  I think this might work in color too.  But its dramatic in doutone. 8', '2003-05-28 18:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(309513, 22510, 554, '<td valign="top">beautiful photo....is this duotone? ah yes it is...I have been educated in our forums</td>', 'beautiful photo....is this duotone? ah yes it is...I have been educated in our forums', '2003-05-28 18:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(309514, 22752, 2361, '<td valign="top">I''m sure the traditionalists will hate this as a "duotone."  I love it. 9 Jak</td>', 'I''m sure the traditionalists will hate this as a "duotone."  I love it. 9 Jak', '2003-05-28 18:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(309516, 22146, 2361, '<td valign="top">I''m sure the traditionalists will scratch their herads about this as a duotone.  But I love it.  The essence of duotone is there, in a beautiful image.  9 Jak</td>', 'I''m sure the traditionalists will scratch their herads about this as a duotone.  But I love it.  The essence of duotone is there, in a beautiful image.  9 Jak', '2003-05-28 18:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(309519, 22510, 2361, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but more than stretches the challenge for me.  4 Jak</td>', 'Nice image, but more than stretches the challenge for me.  4 Jak', '2003-05-28 18:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(309520, 22456, 7628, '<td valign="top">This is a favorite view of mine.  The angle of the clouds points dramatically to Hallgrimskirkja, with a glimmer of the sun''s rays dropping down to the city.  The golden tone is perfect with the title.  I would have included more of the city below the clouds (would the shoreline minic the line of clouds at this angle?) and maybe have put the church into the frame a bit more.  But this way it really emphasizes the sky and clouds.  Wish the clouds had more definition, not quite so soft.  But I think this one would look good on the wall! 7</td>', 'This is a favorite view of mine.  The angle of the clouds points dramatically to Hallgrimskirkja, with a glimmer of the sun''s rays dropping down to the city.  The golden tone is perfect with the title.  I would have included more of the city below the clouds (would the shoreline minic the line of clouds at this angle?) and maybe have put the church into the frame a bit more.  But this way it really emphasizes the sky and clouds.  Wish the clouds had more definition, not quite so soft.  But I think this one would look good on the wall! 7', '2003-05-28 18:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(309521, 22146, 554, '<td valign="top">beautiful photo....10...this makes a wonderful wallpaper..THANKS</td>', 'beautiful photo....10...this makes a wonderful wallpaper..THANKS', '2003-05-28 18:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(309524, 22758, 2361, '<td valign="top">This is processed too softly for me.  The vase also seems to tip to the right, which bothers my eye.  Tyhe composition is classic and good.  5 Jak</td>', 'This is processed too softly for me.  The vase also seems to tip to the right, which bothers my eye.  Tyhe composition is classic and good.  5 Jak', '2003-05-28 18:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(309527, 22471, 2361, '<td valign="top">Is it just me or is there a slight tilt to the left?   I like the idea, but the execution doesn''t "wow" me.   6 Jak</td>', 'Is it just me or is there a slight tilt to the left?   I like the idea, but the execution doesn''t "wow" me.   6 Jak', '2003-05-28 18:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(309529, 22295, 2361, '<td valign="top">I like this a great deal. I could only wish that the DOF was deep enough to keep the front claws in focus.  7 Jak</td>', 'I like this a great deal. I could only wish that the DOF was deep enough to keep the front claws in focus.  7 Jak', '2003-05-28 18:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(309530, 22215, 4967, '<td valign="top">You can see the reflection of the plane window on the right upper side of the photo, I don''t feel there is enough contrast in this photo... it also looks fairly lopsided.  Interesting pattern though.</td>', 'You can see the reflection of the plane window on the right upper side of the photo, I don''t feel there is enough contrast in this photo... it also looks fairly lopsided.  Interesting pattern though.', '2003-05-28 18:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
