(309535, 22755, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is cute... I like it in sepia.  Good use of contrast and DOF.  Even though it is adorable, it lacks WOW IMHO.  Still a nice photo. -8-</td>', 'This is cute... I like it in sepia.  Good use of contrast and DOF.  Even though it is adorable, it lacks WOW IMHO.  Still a nice photo. -8-', '2003-05-28 18:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(309539, 22734, 4967, '<td valign="top">Do you have a nice and an evil side?  Hehehe... I like the light and the dark here... Very nicely done in that respect.  The sepia looks slightly dark, but I think it fits with the photo well.  I keep looking at this photo and it makes me think of Jekyll and Hyde.  I really like the lighting.... The only real problem I see here is with the shadow from the glasses.  It''s slightly bothersome, also personally I think the white border does nothing for the photo.  Very well done, good luck.  -9-</td>', 'Do you have a nice and an evil side?  Hehehe... I like the light and the dark here... Very nicely done in that respect.  The sepia looks slightly dark, but I think it fits with the photo well.  I keep looking at this photo and it makes me think of Jekyll and Hyde.  I really like the lighting.... The only real problem I see here is with the shadow from the glasses.  It''s slightly bothersome, also personally I think the white border does nothing for the photo.  Very well done, good luck.  -9-', '2003-05-28 18:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(309543, 22491, 4967, '<td valign="top">There seems to be barely any contrast here... it all kind of fades into one.  I also think you should have thought more about the rule of thirds when cropping, there seems to me to be a lot of extraneous sky.  I would have cropped down to just slightly above the highest tree on the right side.  I also don''t care for the power lines (?) running through the photo.  Looks like an interesting subject though... I would suggest trying again with different angles and views of "the castle"</td>', 'There seems to be barely any contrast here... it all kind of fades into one.  I also think you should have thought more about the rule of thirds when cropping, there seems to me to be a lot of extraneous sky.  I would have cropped down to just slightly above the highest tree on the right side.  I also don''t care for the power lines (?) running through the photo.  Looks like an interesting subject though... I would suggest trying again with different angles and views of "the castle"', '2003-05-28 18:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(309547, 22500, 4967, '<td valign="top">The white in this photo is quite blown out, Softer lighting, possibly natural lihgt might have been nice.  I also think that the kitten is a little on the blurry side, or maybe you used a softening filter?  Try working on your lighting a bit...</td>', 'The white in this photo is quite blown out, Softer lighting, possibly natural lihgt might have been nice.  I also think that the kitten is a little on the blurry side, or maybe you used a softening filter?  Try working on your lighting a bit...', '2003-05-28 18:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(309548, 22510, 4967, '<td valign="top">Classic, and nice looking.  I like the tone you picked for the Duotone.  Very nicely done.  I would maybe have tried to level it off slightly, it looks like th scenery is just slightly tilting to the right.  Maybe thats just me though.  I like your composition.  Good luck! -8-</td>', 'Classic, and nice looking.  I like the tone you picked for the Duotone.  Very nicely done.  I would maybe have tried to level it off slightly, it looks like th scenery is just slightly tilting to the right.  Maybe thats just me though.  I like your composition.  Good luck! -8-', '2003-05-28 19:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(309553, 22793, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is just a picture of a picture in a frame, and not extremely well done.  The harsh shadow that falls across the background was probably created by a flash.  I just don''t feel this is a photo but more just a copy of someone elses photo albeit it is in a frame.  Sorry.</td>', 'This is just a picture of a picture in a frame, and not extremely well done.  The harsh shadow that falls across the background was probably created by a flash.  I just don''t feel this is a photo but more just a copy of someone elses photo albeit it is in a frame.  Sorry.', '2003-05-28 19:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(309555, 22657, 4967, '<td valign="top">This photo intrigues me, it really makes me wonder what I am looking at.  The contrasts are very nicely done, and the whole thing is very abstract and cool.</td>', 'This photo intrigues me, it really makes me wonder what I am looking at.  The contrasts are very nicely done, and the whole thing is very abstract and cool.', '2003-05-28 19:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(309556, 22273, 2361, '<td valign="top">Very good portrait.  Intense, focused (in both senses).  Very good indeed.  8 Jak</td>', 'Very good portrait.  Intense, focused (in both senses).  Very good indeed.  8 Jak', '2003-05-28 19:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(309561, 22726, 2361, '<td valign="top">This seems to have an awful lot of colours for a duotone.  I''m not too keen on the composition or the lighting, either.  Sorry.  4 Jak</td>', 'This seems to have an awful lot of colours for a duotone.  I''m not too keen on the composition or the lighting, either.  Sorry.  4 Jak', '2003-05-28 19:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(309563, 22510, 7628, '<td valign="top">A very vivid pict.  With these deep tomes, this photo looks almost like a graphic.  I like the range deep rust to pale amber.  The great swaths of white call out to the skier in me.  The fram you chose doesn''t add to the photo - I''d like just a plain, thin black or brown edge.  I like the composition with the dark mountains in the middle, and down from that the diagonal sweep of the small foreground valley.  I might have cropped the bottom of the frame where that diagonal meets the left edge.  Very enjoyable. 7</td>', 'A very vivid pict.  With these deep tomes, this photo looks almost like a graphic.  I like the range deep rust to pale amber.  The great swaths of white call out to the skier in me.  The fram you chose doesn''t add to the photo - I''d like just a plain, thin black or brown edge.  I like the composition with the dark mountains in the middle, and down from that the diagonal sweep of the small foreground valley.  I might have cropped the bottom of the frame where that diagonal meets the left edge.  Very enjoyable. 7', '2003-05-28 19:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(309564, 22458, 2716, '<td valign="top">lol.  Very creative.  I love it.  totally different.  Jacko.  9</td>', 'lol.  Very creative.  I love it.  totally different.  Jacko.  9', '2003-05-28 19:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(309567, 22146, 2716, '<td valign="top">very surreal.  I like it.  great composition.  Jacko.   9</td>', 'very surreal.  I like it.  great composition.  Jacko.   9', '2003-05-28 19:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(309568, 22371, 2716, '<td valign="top">wow.  the sepia really makes the texture jump out.  Great job.  Nice shallow depth of field.  Jacko.  10</td>', 'wow.  the sepia really makes the texture jump out.  Great job.  Nice shallow depth of field.  Jacko.  10', '2003-05-28 19:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(309570, 22787, 2716, '<td valign="top">I love these water fall shots.  Great capture.  8</td>', 'I love these water fall shots.  Great capture.  8', '2003-05-28 19:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(309572, 22768, 2716, '<td valign="top">wow!  the tonal range is awesome, as is the sharpness of the pic.  Really looks like an old picture.  Great shot.  Jacko.  10   Good luck.</td>', 'wow!  the tonal range is awesome, as is the sharpness of the pic.  Really looks like an old picture.  Great shot.  Jacko.  10   Good luck.', '2003-05-28 19:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(309573, 22463, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the eye contact between these two.  I''m not sure I feel it is a comfortable silence - the man looks more like he is imparting a telepathic lesson to the dog and the dog is attening carefully.  The detail in and the sweep of the dogs fur is really lovely - while it is sharp in focus I can imagine how soft it would be to touch.  The form of the dog is more 3d than the man - perhaps another light at aninterscting angle or have the man turn his face a little more to the camera to get more depth.  There is a lot of white space which doesn''t really mean anything - perhaps the space is filled by the comfortable silence?  I would have to see that more in theri expressions.  I''d have the dog and man on a level - there wouldn;t be as much space over the dog that way.6</td>', 'I like the eye contact between these two.  I''m not sure I feel it is a comfortable silence - the man looks more like he is imparting a telepathic lesson to the dog and the dog is attening carefully.  The detail in and the sweep of the dogs fur is really lovely - while it is sharp in focus I can imagine how soft it would be to touch.  The form of the dog is more 3d than the man - perhaps another light at aninterscting angle or have the man turn his face a little more to the camera to get more depth.  There is a lot of white space which doesn''t really mean anything - perhaps the space is filled by the comfortable silence?  I would have to see that more in theri expressions.  I''d have the dog and man on a level - there wouldn;t be as much space over the dog that way.6', '2003-05-28 19:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(309574, 22786, 2716, '<td valign="top">great subject.  how often do you see one of those at DPC.  lol.  Good job.  Jacko</td>', 'great subject.  how often do you see one of those at DPC.  lol.  Good job.  Jacko', '2003-05-28 19:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(309577, 22267, 2716, '<td valign="top">wow.  Nice knockers.  lol.  nice subject for B&amp;W.  Good luck.  Jacko.</td>', 'wow.  Nice knockers.  lol.  nice subject for B&W.  Good luck.  Jacko.', '2003-05-28 19:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(309578, 22284, 2716, '<td valign="top">wow. very pretty and simple model.  Great facial expression.  Good luck.  Jacko.  9</td>', 'wow. very pretty and simple model.  Great facial expression.  Good luck.  Jacko.  9', '2003-05-28 19:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(309580, 22054, 7628, '<td valign="top">The cool frosty blue hue  is perfect for this lonely tree.  The white tips of the branches look like a dusting of snow.  The composition including the small bush emphasizes the loneliness, and the fence give a feeling of being closed off.  The white tips of the tree are balances nicely by the dark blue shadow on the ground - wish the fence post didn;t intersect it.  But I really enjoy this pict. 8</td>', 'The cool frosty blue hue  is perfect for this lonely tree.  The white tips of the branches look like a dusting of snow.  The composition including the small bush emphasizes the loneliness, and the fence give a feeling of being closed off.  The white tips of the tree are balances nicely by the dark blue shadow on the ground - wish the fence post didn;t intersect it.  But I really enjoy this pict. 8', '2003-05-28 19:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(309588, 22696, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like your idea for a subject - all the layers - the glass, the wate, the edges where they intersect all this give interesting opportunities for a duotone picture.  However I find the colors too washed out - I''d like to see this darker.  I find the rim of the bowl(?) in the back distracting - it takes away from the lines created by the glass and the water.  Wish you could have gotten a larger DOF.</td>', 'I like your idea for a subject - all the layers - the glass, the wate, the edges where they intersect all this give interesting opportunities for a duotone picture.  However I find the colors too washed out - I''d like to see this darker.  I find the rim of the bowl(?) in the back distracting - it takes away from the lines created by the glass and the water.  Wish you could have gotten a larger DOF.', '2003-05-28 19:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(309593, 22759, 7628, '<td valign="top">Very black and white.  I like the way you''ve laid out the cards with the face card coming toward us - the joker to the side.  The focus is only sharp in a small band in the middle front.  I wish it were sdharp all over.  Cards of course are flat by nature - they can''t help but create a very flat picture - which is a shame in duotone -this subject doesn''t take advantage of form and shadows the way a duotone might.</td>', 'Very black and white.  I like the way you''ve laid out the cards with the face card coming toward us - the joker to the side.  The focus is only sharp in a small band in the middle front.  I wish it were sdharp all over.  Cards of course are flat by nature - they can''t help but create a very flat picture - which is a shame in duotone -this subject doesn''t take advantage of form and shadows the way a duotone might.', '2003-05-28 19:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(309595, 22633, 7628, '<td valign="top">dramatic angles, vivid lighting, gorgeous sky.  You took advantage of a great subject and environment, and did an excellent job.  I might have cropped after the first arch on the right of center - the other arches and architectural details are a bit much, and distract the eye away from the tower whereas the black silouette on the left leads your eye up to it. 8</td>', 'dramatic angles, vivid lighting, gorgeous sky.  You took advantage of a great subject and environment, and did an excellent job.  I might have cropped after the first arch on the right of center - the other arches and architectural details are a bit much, and distract the eye away from the tower whereas the black silouette on the left leads your eye up to it. 8', '2003-05-28 19:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(309606, 22637, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the black on the top right balanced by the gray on the bottom and how both set off the feather and its shadow.  the texture of the feather is a nice detail - I wish I could see it better.  The area wher the eather and its shadow overlap is a bit busy with all the "feathering" lines - I might have tried to continue the upper shadow to beneather the feather - I do like the feathering against the solid dark and the feathering of the shadow against the grey forground.    I''d edit out that tiny white spot on the right, top... but now I''m just getting picky. Nicely done 7</td>', 'I like the black on the top right balanced by the gray on the bottom and how both set off the feather and its shadow.  the texture of the feather is a nice detail - I wish I could see it better.  The area wher the eather and its shadow overlap is a bit busy with all the "feathering" lines - I might have tried to continue the upper shadow to beneather the feather - I do like the feathering against the solid dark and the feathering of the shadow against the grey forground.    I''d edit out that tiny white spot on the right, top... but now I''m just getting picky. Nicely done 7', '2003-05-28 19:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(309612, 22275, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like how abstract this is - but at the same time you can easily tell what it is,  I like being able to see the texture of the curtains.  I am left a little lost - the composition doesn''t have a focus or direction - maybe a shadow behind the curtain - a human silouette?  I guess it is pure and simple the way it is - I just wish it were more compelling.</td>', 'I like how abstract this is - but at the same time you can easily tell what it is,  I like being able to see the texture of the curtains.  I am left a little lost - the composition doesn''t have a focus or direction - maybe a shadow behind the curtain - a human silouette?  I guess it is pure and simple the way it is - I just wish it were more compelling.', '2003-05-28 19:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(309644, 22752, 6771, '<td valign="top">this is an awesome image, with great lighting, etc.  I am having a hard time justifying the duotoned part though.  still get a 5 though</td>', 'this is an awesome image, with great lighting, etc.  I am having a hard time justifying the duotoned part though.  still get a 5 though', '2003-05-28 20:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(309645, 22667, 6771, '<td valign="top">Cool idea.  Lacks a little pop though.</td>', 'Cool idea.  Lacks a little pop though.', '2003-05-28 20:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(309647, 22705, 6771, '<td valign="top">Great subject.  Not sure if was a bit overexposed on the original or if the yellowish brown tone makes it look that way.</td>', 'Great subject.  Not sure if was a bit overexposed on the original or if the yellowish brown tone makes it look that way.', '2003-05-28 20:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(309650, 22747, 6771, '<td valign="top">I am not really thrilled with the yellow tone here.  It really blows out the shudders/doors on the left.  Overall it is just not that appealing of a color here.  Sorry</td>', 'I am not really thrilled with the yellow tone here.  It really blows out the shudders/doors on the left.  Overall it is just not that appealing of a color here.  Sorry', '2003-05-28 20:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(309651, 22405, 6771, '<td valign="top">Overall too dark for my tastes.  Able to make out the shadow, but would like to see a touch of detail in the crate.</td>', 'Overall too dark for my tastes.  Able to make out the shadow, but would like to see a touch of detail in the crate.', '2003-05-28 20:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(309652, 22470, 6771, '<td valign="top">I think I would like to see DOF a bit larger, mainly the bolt and nut on the right.  Lighting is great</td>', 'I think I would like to see DOF a bit larger, mainly the bolt and nut on the right.  Lighting is great', '2003-05-28 20:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(309671, 22464, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the earthy weave of the basket and the shiny flatness of the metal.  The diagonal composition works ok - I wish the light had been greater above and less below to show off the edge more.  The shallow DOF doesn''t work for me - it detracts from the interesting contrast beteen the materials.</td>', 'I like the contrast between the earthy weave of the basket and the shiny flatness of the metal.  The diagonal composition works ok - I wish the light had been greater above and less below to show off the edge more.  The shallow DOF doesn''t work for me - it detracts from the interesting contrast beteen the materials.', '2003-05-28 21:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(309673, 22728, 7628, '<td valign="top">this is Iceland, yes?  While I am drawn to Icelandic pictures, this one would have drawn me anyway - the ethereal light on the curch and the contrast against the sky - simple forms and angles that don;t clutter a simple, elegant composition.  The only things I find distracting are the handiicap ramp and the parking lot.  The hadicap ramp has to be there after all but you could crop the lot (although I sort of like the connection between the ramp and the handicap sign could you find an angle to make it more obvious?)  I like the low mountains on the horizon. 8</td>', 'this is Iceland, yes?  While I am drawn to Icelandic pictures, this one would have drawn me anyway - the ethereal light on the curch and the contrast against the sky - simple forms and angles that don;t clutter a simple, elegant composition.  The only things I find distracting are the handiicap ramp and the parking lot.  The hadicap ramp has to be there after all but you could crop the lot (although I sort of like the connection between the ramp and the handicap sign could you find an angle to make it more obvious?)  I like the low mountains on the horizon. 8', '2003-05-28 21:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(309676, 22274, 7628, '<td valign="top">The protractor (?) really seems to be dancing with its shadow- the curve of the paper help that illusion.  the white of the paper and black behind provide a nice frame for the subject, and the tilt adds to the illusion that the "dancer"s are whirling.  Everything is very simple and flat but the tool whiuch really pops out at the viewer with its metalic texture shown by the highlight along the edge, and the threads on the screw. Focus is a little soft. Nice, well thought out. 8</td>', 'The protractor (?) really seems to be dancing with its shadow- the curve of the paper help that illusion.  the white of the paper and black behind provide a nice frame for the subject, and the tilt adds to the illusion that the "dancer"s are whirling.  Everything is very simple and flat but the tool whiuch really pops out at the viewer with its metalic texture shown by the highlight along the edge, and the threads on the screw. Focus is a little soft. Nice, well thought out. 8', '2003-05-28 21:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(309677, 22692, 7628, '<td valign="top">Yikes!  It looks like the kid is going to be hit by the car! The idea of framing the action with the flag is an interesting one - but just doesn;t work here.  Black and white stripes wouldn;t say Us flag to me unless I saw the title.  the kid isn''t in focus, and tho he looks like he is pitching a baseball he''s throwing a bigger ball.  If you could get a DOF that brought all into focus, and backed up so more of the flag is visible, and frames the boy more closely it would be better.</td>', 'Yikes!  It looks like the kid is going to be hit by the car! The idea of framing the action with the flag is an interesting one - but just doesn;t work here.  Black and white stripes wouldn;t say Us flag to me unless I saw the title.  the kid isn''t in focus, and tho he looks like he is pitching a baseball he''s throwing a bigger ball.  If you could get a DOF that brought all into focus, and backed up so more of the flag is visible, and frames the boy more closely it would be better.', '2003-05-28 21:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(309680, 22786, 6505, '<td valign="top">The shadows here are excellent!  I''ll have to remember that when i try to do more b&amp;w.</td>', 'The shadows here are excellent!  I''ll have to remember that when i try to do more b&w.', '2003-05-28 21:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(309683, 22770, 6505, '<td valign="top">A tad dark.  I would like to see more detail on the wheelbarrow.  Good shot overall.</td>', 'A tad dark.  I would like to see more detail on the wheelbarrow.  Good shot overall.', '2003-05-28 21:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(309685, 22734, 6505, '<td valign="top">Is your shirt on backwards?  I like the lighting which fits your crazy look - although a harmless craziness.</td>', 'Is your shirt on backwards?  I like the lighting which fits your crazy look - although a harmless craziness.', '2003-05-28 21:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(309688, 22617, 6505, '<td valign="top">Great action shot!  That girls really giving it her all.  Very real, although she looks like she''s in pain or confused as to why your taking a picture of her.</td>', 'Great action shot!  That girls really giving it her all.  Very real, although she looks like she''s in pain or confused as to why your taking a picture of her.', '2003-05-28 21:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(309735, 22700, 1717, '<td valign="top">wow!  what an amazing portrait!  the lighting is perfect and i love the soft feel to it.  wonderful capture of the character in his eyes.  good work!</td>', 'wow!  what an amazing portrait!  the lighting is perfect and i love the soft feel to it.  wonderful capture of the character in his eyes.  good work!', '2003-05-28 22:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(309748, 22769, 6600, '<td valign="top">This is a good action shot.  Nice composition and tone.  I like the different stages of motion that the horses and riders happened to be in.  Nice job bro!  Critique: About a 1 degree clockwise rotation would square the shot up nicely (In Photoshop: Image/Rotate Canvas/Arbitrary/1/CW)</td>', 'This is a good action shot.  Nice composition and tone.  I like the different stages of motion that the horses and riders happened to be in.  Nice job bro!  Critique: About a 1 degree clockwise rotation would square the shot up nicely (In Photoshop: Image/Rotate Canvas/Arbitrary/1/CW)', '2003-05-28 22:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(309752, 22665, 6600, '<td valign="top">Neat shot with nice tone.  Very sharp (some may say over sharpened), but I personally lean toward the sharper ones.  Very well focused!</td>', 'Neat shot with nice tone.  Very sharp (some may say over sharpened), but I personally lean toward the sharper ones.  Very well focused!', '2003-05-28 22:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(309755, 22633, 6600, '<td valign="top">Good composition, nice detail on the buiiding, but although the clouds are unique, I find them distracting in this case (seem a bit out of place to me).... That aside, well done!</td>', 'Good composition, nice detail on the buiiding, but although the clouds are unique, I find them distracting in this case (seem a bit out of place to me).... That aside, well done!', '2003-05-28 22:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(309782, 22710, 6325, '<td valign="top">Well, at least steer parts. Good composition. Black and white was a good choice.</td>', 'Well, at least steer parts. Good composition. Black and white was a good choice.', '2003-05-29 00:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(309783, 22305, 6325, '<td valign="top">Lovely play of light and shadow. I like the canyon feel. Tones are well done. I wish I knew how to ge the grainy look - I have been playing around and have not been this successful. Great shot.</td>', 'Lovely play of light and shadow. I like the canyon feel. Tones are well done. I wish I knew how to ge the grainy look - I have been playing around and have not been this successful. Great shot.', '2003-05-29 00:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(309786, 22657, 6325, '<td valign="top">Wonderful abstract image.</td>', 'Wonderful abstract image.', '2003-05-29 00:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(309788, 22747, 6325, '<td valign="top">I like the composition - the long lines with the figures in the distance adds life. I think other color choices would have added strength (or softness if you prefer) - but this color...</td>', 'I like the composition - the long lines with the figures in the distance adds life. I think other color choices would have added strength (or softness if you prefer) - but this color...', '2003-05-29 00:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(309790, 22730, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good tones to bring out the contrast and highlight the stron lines.</td>', 'Good tones to bring out the contrast and highlight the stron lines.', '2003-05-29 00:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(309803, 22633, 6325, '<td valign="top">Dramatic sky. I think some detail in the shadow side would have been a better shot.</td>', 'Dramatic sky. I think some detail in the shadow side would have been a better shot.', '2003-05-29 00:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(309805, 22466, 6325, '<td valign="top">Cool ears. A good cow shot. The tones were a good choice. The focus is a too soft for me on this shot and the crop a little tight.</td>', 'Cool ears. A good cow shot. The tones were a good choice. The focus is a too soft for me on this shot and the crop a little tight.', '2003-05-29 00:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(309807, 22750, 8130, '<td valign="top">I wish there were some way you could have isolated the child from the busy parts of the rest.  He''s adorable and you caught his expression just right!</td>', 'I wish there were some way you could have isolated the child from the busy parts of the rest.  He''s adorable and you caught his expression just right!', '2003-05-29 00:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(309815, 22766, 8130, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, I wish it told more of a story...</td>', 'Nice photo, I wish it told more of a story...', '2003-05-29 01:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(309817, 22257, 8130, '<td valign="top">Great sense of humor, I like the statement!</td>', 'Great sense of humor, I like the statement!', '2003-05-29 01:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(309818, 22691, 8130, '<td valign="top">Mysterious and sinister.  Glad I don''t live here!</td>', 'Mysterious and sinister.  Glad I don''t live here!', '2003-05-29 01:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(309821, 22792, 8130, '<td valign="top">Tricky stuff!  Caught my interest and kept it!</td>', 'Tricky stuff!  Caught my interest and kept it!', '2003-05-29 01:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(309823, 22791, 8130, '<td valign="top">Love it, wouldn''t change a thing.</td>', 'Love it, wouldn''t change a thing.', '2003-05-29 01:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(309825, 22688, 8130, '<td valign="top">Interesting light, texture and form.</td>', 'Interesting light, texture and form.', '2003-05-29 01:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(309835, 22633, 8130, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Very interesting subject and perspective, but the clouds are really the frosting on that cake for me.</td>', 'Wow!  Very interesting subject and perspective, but the clouds are really the frosting on that cake for me.', '2003-05-29 02:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(309865, 22785, 9009, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2003-05-29 04:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(309867, 22146, 9009, '<td valign="top">this image portrays solidarity</td>', 'this image portrays solidarity', '2003-05-29 04:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(309868, 22627, 9009, '<td valign="top">amazing clouds</td>', 'amazing clouds', '2003-05-29 04:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(309869, 22633, 9009, '<td valign="top">this looks like a painting</td>', 'this looks like a painting', '2003-05-29 04:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(309910, 22781, 6458, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, but it needs to have just a bit more brightness to it to really wow me. 8</td>', 'This is a great shot, but it needs to have just a bit more brightness to it to really wow me. 8', '2003-05-29 08:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(309915, 22703, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good use of duotone.</td>', 'Good use of duotone.', '2003-05-29 09:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(309924, 22734, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent portrait and great work with the lighting... = 9</td>', 'excellent portrait and great work with the lighting... = 9', '2003-05-29 09:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(309925, 22763, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent shot.. well planned theme and the reflection in the blade is a great touch.  I really enjoy a photo where I can see and feel the photographer''s intent.  In a photo like this, I have to be a bit picky :)  The hand looks a little over exposed and the lint on the hood and cape are also a little overly visible.  When taking the time to organize a photo like this, I would always go the extra mile to get perfection :)   = 9</td>', 'excellent shot.. well planned theme and the reflection in the blade is a great touch.  I really enjoy a photo where I can see and feel the photographer''s intent.  In a photo like this, I have to be a bit picky :)  The hand looks a little over exposed and the lint on the hood and cape are also a little overly visible.  When taking the time to organize a photo like this, I would always go the extra mile to get perfection :)   = 9', '2003-05-29 09:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(309929, 22313, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent work with the detail... this subject lends itself well to the duotone because of the nice texture and contrasts... great work :)</td>', 'excellent work with the detail... this subject lends itself well to the duotone because of the nice texture and contrasts... great work :)', '2003-05-29 10:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(309931, 22410, 772, '<td valign="top">maybe framed just a tad tight... This is a fairly ''common'' viewpoint that I see in photographs of children... This one isnt as extreme as most, but it''s ''from above''.  Sometimes, when photographing kids, you can get some better perspectives if you get down on the same level :)</td>', 'maybe framed just a tad tight... This is a fairly ''common'' viewpoint that I see in photographs of children... This one isnt as extreme as most, but it''s ''from above''.  Sometimes, when photographing kids, you can get some better perspectives if you get down on the same level :)', '2003-05-29 10:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(309945, 22618, 772, '<td valign="top">nice silhouette and excellent job with the back lighting... great composition as well :)</td>', 'nice silhouette and excellent job with the back lighting... great composition as well :)', '2003-05-29 10:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(309956, 22726, 8488, '<td valign="top">This is, unfortunately, not a duotone, but a saturation-turned-down color photo. I have to grade it down a little to leave room at the top for people who actually followed the challenge topic ... though with some other, fitting topic, I might well have given it an eight.</td>', 'This is, unfortunately, not a duotone, but a saturation-turned-down color photo. I have to grade it down a little to leave room at the top for people who actually followed the challenge topic ... though with some other, fitting topic, I might well have given it an eight.', '2003-05-29 10:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(309957, 22658, 8488, '<td valign="top">The chain links almost look like they''re made of liquid, of slightly-melting ice. Gorgeous lighting and focus. Bold choice to leave it as dark as it is, but I think it was a good one to make.</td>', 'The chain links almost look like they''re made of liquid, of slightly-melting ice. Gorgeous lighting and focus. Bold choice to leave it as dark as it is, but I think it was a good one to make.', '2003-05-29 10:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(309958, 22763, 8488, '<td valign="top">Somehow the pose looks stiff, almost as if the model''s all tensed up and thinking ''Damn, when can I put this stupid knife down and go home?'' It doesn''t feel natural (not that it WOULD be, but it could feel so), and that detracts a bit from the overall appeal of the shot. Nice reflection, though.</td>', 'Somehow the pose looks stiff, almost as if the model''s all tensed up and thinking ''Damn, when can I put this stupid knife down and go home?'' It doesn''t feel natural (not that it WOULD be, but it could feel so), and that detracts a bit from the overall appeal of the shot. Nice reflection, though.', '2003-05-29 10:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(309961, 22745, 8488, '<td valign="top">The shot is so busy that the eye doesn''t really have anywhere to go. The focus and lighting are nice, but the image itself is a bit of a jumble.</td>', 'The shot is so busy that the eye doesn''t really have anywhere to go. The focus and lighting are nice, but the image itself is a bit of a jumble.', '2003-05-29 10:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(309965, 22680, 8488, '<td valign="top">Marvellous shot. Great crisp macro, with DOF just short enough to fade the legs and plant but leave all the antennae and most of the body in focus. The lighting is wonderfully numinous, too, and the toning subtle and just enough to accentuate, instead of taking over.</td>', 'Marvellous shot. Great crisp macro, with DOF just short enough to fade the legs and plant but leave all the antennae and most of the body in focus. The lighting is wonderfully numinous, too, and the toning subtle and just enough to accentuate, instead of taking over.', '2003-05-29 10:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(309968, 22689, 8488, '<td valign="top">Hrm. Maybe a shallower focus would have given a stronger contrast between the foreground and the background; as it is, in the same focus and almost exactly the same ranges of color (ok, BW), it''s almost hard to figure out where one ends and the other begins.</td>', 'Hrm. Maybe a shallower focus would have given a stronger contrast between the foreground and the background; as it is, in the same focus and almost exactly the same ranges of color (ok, BW), it''s almost hard to figure out where one ends and the other begins.', '2003-05-29 10:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(309971, 22362, 8488, '<td valign="top">Wow. I''ll be looking to find out where this was shot, after the competition. :-&gt; It looks like a museum diorama, sort of; if so, the lighting is amazingly good (usually museums are so harshly lit it''s a bitch to photograph ''em). It''s got personality, its composition is strong and uncluttered. Definitely 10.</td>', 'Wow. I''ll be looking to find out where this was shot, after the competition. :-> It looks like a museum diorama, sort of; if so, the lighting is amazingly good (usually museums are so harshly lit it''s a bitch to photograph ''em). It''s got personality, its composition is strong and uncluttered. Definitely 10.', '2003-05-29 10:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(309973, 22728, 8488, '<td valign="top">I like how the church is clean and flat-seeming, almost like it''s made out of cardboard, against a gently cottony sky. Nice textures, especially played against each other.</td>', 'I like how the church is clean and flat-seeming, almost like it''s made out of cardboard, against a gently cottony sky. Nice textures, especially played against each other.', '2003-05-29 10:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(309974, 22488, 8488, '<td valign="top">Hrm. I know the focus artifacts in this are probably on purpose, but I find them incredibly distracting. It draws the eye to the bush in front and drops it there (and I doubt the bush was your intended center of attention). 6, but coulda been 8.</td>', 'Hrm. I know the focus artifacts in this are probably on purpose, but I find them incredibly distracting. It draws the eye to the bush in front and drops it there (and I doubt the bush was your intended center of attention). 6, but coulda been 8.', '2003-05-29 10:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(309975, 22474, 8488, '<td valign="top">The color is so saturated that it actually distracts from the image - it makes it harder to distinguish the subject from the background, because they all bleed together with no clear boundary. Focus and composition decent, though.</td>', 'The color is so saturated that it actually distracts from the image - it makes it harder to distinguish the subject from the background, because they all bleed together with no clear boundary. Focus and composition decent, though.', '2003-05-29 11:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(309977, 22215, 8488, '<td valign="top">A tiny bit crisper focus here might have gotten a ten from me; as it is, it''s still a fascinating subject, laid out to look almost like a cathedral rose window.</td>', 'A tiny bit crisper focus here might have gotten a ten from me; as it is, it''s still a fascinating subject, laid out to look almost like a cathedral rose window.', '2003-05-29 11:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(309979, 22149, 8488, '<td valign="top">The blurred arm distracts from the shot, especially since nothing in the frame is really *in* focus. The eye tries to fasten on the kid, but then slides off to the plants because of focus and lighting. A good ''almost'' shot. If time and equipment permitted, I''d have shot lots of frames of the same session, and picked the one that worked out of twenty or so.</td>', 'The blurred arm distracts from the shot, especially since nothing in the frame is really *in* focus. The eye tries to fasten on the kid, but then slides off to the plants because of focus and lighting. A good ''almost'' shot. If time and equipment permitted, I''d have shot lots of frames of the same session, and picked the one that worked out of twenty or so.', '2003-05-29 11:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(309980, 22705, 8488, '<td valign="top">A little more contrast/blackpoint might have helped the castle jump from the background a bit more strongly. This might have been a 9 or 10 ... but even as-is, definitely 7.</td>', 'A little more contrast/blackpoint might have helped the castle jump from the background a bit more strongly. This might have been a 9 or 10 ... but even as-is, definitely 7.', '2003-05-29 11:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(309981, 22429, 8488, '<td valign="top">I know it''s what you intended, but the forced perspective and total blur on everything but the upper lip induces a bit of vertigo in me, as if I were leaning back and forth from the screen. Good concept, execution somewhat lacking.</td>', 'I know it''s what you intended, but the forced perspective and total blur on everything but the upper lip induces a bit of vertigo in me, as if I were leaning back and forth from the screen. Good concept, execution somewhat lacking.', '2003-05-29 11:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(309983, 22758, 8488, '<td valign="top">I know you did it on purpose, but the blur makes it look like there''s a dirty window between me and the subject, and is distracting as hell. The lighting is very bright and harsh on the right and very dark on the left, without seeming to highlight where we''re ''supposed to look'' in any way. The only real focus of attention I can find is the fallen petals at the bottom or the shapes on the wall ... which I doubt is what you intended.</td>', 'I know you did it on purpose, but the blur makes it look like there''s a dirty window between me and the subject, and is distracting as hell. The lighting is very bright and harsh on the right and very dark on the left, without seeming to highlight where we''re ''supposed to look'' in any way. The only real focus of attention I can find is the fallen petals at the bottom or the shapes on the wall ... which I doubt is what you intended.', '2003-05-29 11:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(309985, 22479, 8488, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, clean, tidy, good contrast with the background. The flowers pop, as if they were glued to my monitor.</td>', 'Nice focus, clean, tidy, good contrast with the background. The flowers pop, as if they were glued to my monitor.', '2003-05-29 11:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(309986, 22458, 8488, '<td valign="top">Sweet concept, well-executed, and cropped just right.</td>', 'Sweet concept, well-executed, and cropped just right.', '2003-05-29 11:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(309987, 22785, 8488, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous focus, lighting, contrast. The color adds nicely without being distracting (despite its strong saturation). Very, very well done.</td>', 'Gorgeous focus, lighting, contrast. The color adds nicely without being distracting (despite its strong saturation). Very, very well done.', '2003-05-29 11:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(309988, 22213, 8488, '<td valign="top">I know where that is. :-&gt; That Christ is darn hard to photograph, major kudos. Every time I try it looks wrong, or awkward. Good lighting-angle choice, too. However, the ''pose'' is a little awkward (though better than I''ve ever managed), and the crop feels strange for some reason I can''t quite articulate. Good try. 6.</td>', 'I know where that is. :-> That Christ is darn hard to photograph, major kudos. Every time I try it looks wrong, or awkward. Good lighting-angle choice, too. However, the ''pose'' is a little awkward (though better than I''ve ever managed), and the crop feels strange for some reason I can''t quite articulate. Good try. 6.', '2003-05-29 11:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(309990, 22635, 8488, '<td valign="top">Very contrasty, which is sort of good, but the very flatness of the tones makes it look more like an abstract painting (in chunks of solid color) than a duotone or nuanced photograph. Also, the glass, straw, and bottom drape are all just enough out of focus to be kind of annoying ... to me. Personal taste. :-&gt; 6.</td>', 'Very contrasty, which is sort of good, but the very flatness of the tones makes it look more like an abstract painting (in chunks of solid color) than a duotone or nuanced photograph. Also, the glass, straw, and bottom drape are all just enough out of focus to be kind of annoying ... to me. Personal taste. :-> 6.', '2003-05-29 11:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(309991, 22401, 8488, '<td valign="top">What a charming model. :-&gt; And good lighting to bring out her personality and contrast her from the background.</td>', 'What a charming model. :-> And good lighting to bring out her personality and contrast her from the background.', '2003-05-29 11:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(309992, 22709, 8488, '<td valign="top">The lighting on the cheek/neck is very harsh, and distracts the attention from his expression. This is a coulda-been-great that is instead just kinda neat. Good concept. Better focus and lighting might well have gotten a 10 from me; as it is, 7.</td>', 'The lighting on the cheek/neck is very harsh, and distracts the attention from his expression. This is a coulda-been-great that is instead just kinda neat. Good concept. Better focus and lighting might well have gotten a 10 from me; as it is, 7.', '2003-05-29 11:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(309993, 22082, 8488, '<td valign="top">Nice detail/lighting/focus, but the overall subject isn''t particularly compelling. Maybe a different crop could have drawn the attention to particular architectural details, or something; as-is, the eye just kind of wanders without being drawn to anything especially.</td>', 'Nice detail/lighting/focus, but the overall subject isn''t particularly compelling. Maybe a different crop could have drawn the attention to particular architectural details, or something; as-is, the eye just kind of wanders without being drawn to anything especially.', '2003-05-29 11:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(309995, 22735, 8488, '<td valign="top">The focus is ... weird, in this. I wanted to say it was blurry, but it isn''t - maybe it WAS blurry, and then was sharpened enough so that the odd flat bright areas (leaves) were simply given sharp edges? It feels strange, as if some of the pebbles on the road were closerto the camera than the grass that''s even with them in the frame.</td>', 'The focus is ... weird, in this. I wanted to say it was blurry, but it isn''t - maybe it WAS blurry, and then was sharpened enough so that the odd flat bright areas (leaves) were simply given sharp edges? It feels strange, as if some of the pebbles on the road were closerto the camera than the grass that''s even with them in the frame.', '2003-05-29 11:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(310027, 22787, 7607, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and well done. Sure would like to know how you get the waterfall to look so soft. I''m not having any luck with it. Anyway =10++++</td>', 'Beautiful and well done. Sure would like to know how you get the waterfall to look so soft. I''m not having any luck with it. Anyway =10++++', '2003-05-29 12:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(310032, 22784, 7607, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the tone choice here as I think it would be more natural in either b&amp;w or sepia but I do like the image very much.=8</td>', 'I don''t care for the tone choice here as I think it would be more natural in either b&w or sepia but I do like the image very much.=8', '2003-05-29 13:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(310033, 22680, 6870, '<td valign="top">With your composition and lighting and fantastic depth of field, you make this beetle seem like a heavenly creature! Very nice tones and sharpness, too. Just a great photo. 10</td>', 'With your composition and lighting and fantastic depth of field, you make this beetle seem like a heavenly creature! Very nice tones and sharpness, too. Just a great photo. 10', '2003-05-29 13:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(310035, 22625, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very unique choice to have these kids behind a screen. And it works well. You avoid sentimentality, give the photo a gritty, journalistic feel, and generally keep the tones interesting. It adds interest, too. Nice work. 10</td>', 'Very unique choice to have these kids behind a screen. And it works well. You avoid sentimentality, give the photo a gritty, journalistic feel, and generally keep the tones interesting. It adds interest, too. Nice work. 10', '2003-05-29 13:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(310037, 22054, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very emotional piece, this photo. Your duotones really work to bring out the feelings of loneliness, so in a way, this is one of the best photos I''ve seen in which duotone wasn''t just a choice--it was the right choice. 10</td>', 'Very emotional piece, this photo. Your duotones really work to bring out the feelings of loneliness, so in a way, this is one of the best photos I''ve seen in which duotone wasn''t just a choice--it was the right choice. 10', '2003-05-29 13:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(310039, 22620, 7607, '<td valign="top">I love your composition and the subject matter is close to my heart.=10</td>', 'I love your composition and the subject matter is close to my heart.=10', '2003-05-29 13:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(310040, 22371, 6870, '<td valign="top">Your duotones here really bring out the feeling of history from this old hammer. Wonderful composition, too. Depth of Field works perfectly as the hammer gets out of focus, alluding perhaps to its long history and uses. 10</td>', 'Your duotones here really bring out the feeling of history from this old hammer. Wonderful composition, too. Depth of Field works perfectly as the hammer gets out of focus, alluding perhaps to its long history and uses. 10', '2003-05-29 13:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(310041, 22488, 6870, '<td valign="top">Do you mean "Lancing College?" as in university? Anyway, really nice photo. composition is marvelous,and I''d love to know how you got that special "glow" about everything. I wanted that in a recent challenge, and did not succeed. boo hoo.</td>', 'Do you mean "Lancing College?" as in university? Anyway, really nice photo. composition is marvelous,and I''d love to know how you got that special "glow" about everything. I wanted that in a recent challenge, and did not succeed. boo hoo.', '2003-05-29 13:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(310042, 22700, 5391, '<td valign="top">Wonderful soft feel to this - it fits well with the somewhat wistful, focused expression on the gentleman''s face.  Great photograph.  9</td>', 'Wonderful soft feel to this - it fits well with the somewhat wistful, focused expression on the gentleman''s face.  Great photograph.  9', '2003-05-29 13:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(310043, 22614, 6870, '<td valign="top">Boy do these hostas change when put in duotone. It looks like you used a red filter, too, or possibly manipulated the red channel to get those dark tones in the leaves. I love this composition and the focus is magnificent!</td>', 'Boy do these hostas change when put in duotone. It looks like you used a red filter, too, or possibly manipulated the red channel to get those dark tones in the leaves. I love this composition and the focus is magnificent!', '2003-05-29 13:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(310044, 22758, 7607, '<td valign="top">The soft focus and lighting gives this hazy dreamy feeling that I really like. =10</td>', 'The soft focus and lighting gives this hazy dreamy feeling that I really like. =10', '2003-05-29 13:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(310045, 22735, 6870, '<td valign="top">Maybe I''m just a sucker for duotone path shots, but your tones here are marvelous and make me want to walk down that path. Looks soft and inviting with your use of light and focus.</td>', 'Maybe I''m just a sucker for duotone path shots, but your tones here are marvelous and make me want to walk down that path. Looks soft and inviting with your use of light and focus.', '2003-05-29 13:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(310047, 22768, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very nice still life. Arrangement and composition are marvelous. I get a real nostalgic feel from this due to your wonderful lighting. You make duotone really work well here. 10</td>', 'Very nice still life. Arrangement and composition are marvelous. I get a real nostalgic feel from this due to your wonderful lighting. You make duotone really work well here. 10', '2003-05-29 13:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(310049, 22750, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very nice sense of action and moment captured here. The duotones isolate the sculpture of the jubilance and make it more applicable to humans outside of this occasion.</td>', 'Very nice sense of action and moment captured here. The duotones isolate the sculpture of the jubilance and make it more applicable to humans outside of this occasion.', '2003-05-29 13:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(310050, 22665, 6870, '<td valign="top">Marvelous street scene! The duotones really add a sense of universality to this scene. I love the composition. It seems neat and tidy, but with so many things to look at and explore. Wonderful stuff! 10</td>', 'Marvelous street scene! The duotones really add a sense of universality to this scene. I love the composition. It seems neat and tidy, but with so many things to look at and explore. Wonderful stuff! 10', '2003-05-29 13:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(310051, 22510, 7607, '<td valign="top">I really don''t care for the toneing choice here. Would have prefered b&amp;w I think.</td>', 'I really don''t care for the toneing choice here. Would have prefered b&w I think.', '2003-05-29 13:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(310052, 22305, 6870, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot! The object that gets the most focus is the blank wall right in the center. This gives the whole shot a kind of empty, bleak feel that seems appropriate. Still plenty of other interesting things to see, too. Nice photograph!</td>', 'Interesting shot! The object that gets the most focus is the blank wall right in the center. This gives the whole shot a kind of empty, bleak feel that seems appropriate. Still plenty of other interesting things to see, too. Nice photograph!', '2003-05-29 13:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(310053, 22627, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wonderful tones, marvelous ducks and lots of drama. I love it!</td>', 'Wonderful tones, marvelous ducks and lots of drama. I love it!', '2003-05-29 13:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(310054, 22786, 6870, '<td valign="top">The way you''ve used light here is just fantastic. My eye is drawn right to that out house. The fence helps me get there, too. Marvelous tones and emotive feel.</td>', 'The way you''ve used light here is just fantastic. My eye is drawn right to that out house. The fence helps me get there, too. Marvelous tones and emotive feel.', '2003-05-29 13:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(310058, 22755, 6565, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait, great composition, love the title!</td>', 'Beautiful portrait, great composition, love the title!', '2003-05-29 13:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(310059, 22463, 6565, '<td valign="top">The white background is a little distracting, but as I looked at every photo, this is one of the few that really stayed with me until days later.  I like the expressions a lot, and the tones are very rich.  Nice work!</td>', 'The white background is a little distracting, but as I looked at every photo, this is one of the few that really stayed with me until days later.  I like the expressions a lot, and the tones are very rich.  Nice work!', '2003-05-29 13:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(310060, 22054, 6565, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.  Very creative use of technology and the subject is ideal for the manipulation as you''ve done it.  I would hang this on my wall, and if I were a member I''d have given you a 10. :)</td>', 'Gorgeous.  Very creative use of technology and the subject is ideal for the manipulation as you''ve done it.  I would hang this on my wall, and if I were a member I''d have given you a 10. :)', '2003-05-29 13:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(310061, 22194, 6565, '<td valign="top">The title really adds a lot to this photo!  I like the cleanness of the shot.</td>', 'The title really adds a lot to this photo!  I like the cleanness of the shot.', '2003-05-29 13:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(310062, 22420, 6565, '<td valign="top">The upper right is a little too white for my taste, but overall this is a very nice shot!  I really feel the emotion in this shot, more than I do in some of the other portraits here.</td>', 'The upper right is a little too white for my taste, but overall this is a very nice shot!  I really feel the emotion in this shot, more than I do in some of the other portraits here.', '2003-05-29 13:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(310065, 22633, 6565, '<td valign="top">I suppose "yowza!" isn''t very constructive... :)  I love the contrast of textures between the clouds and the architecture.  Generally not a fan of straight-on symmetry in composition, but I think it works okay here because of the subject being both clouds and building.  The lower left going to full black might hurt this photo a little -- would love to see the entire field shifted to the right a bit, with less black, more of the facade, and the turret just inside the 1/3 mark.  Overall, I love this photo!</td>', 'I suppose "yowza!" isn''t very constructive... :)  I love the contrast of textures between the clouds and the architecture.  Generally not a fan of straight-on symmetry in composition, but I think it works okay here because of the subject being both clouds and building.  The lower left going to full black might hurt this photo a little -- would love to see the entire field shifted to the right a bit, with less black, more of the facade, and the turret just inside the 1/3 mark.  Overall, I love this photo!', '2003-05-29 13:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(310071, 22685, 5044, '<td valign="top">Picturre could have stood to be a little brighter. Nice cropping.</td>', 'Picturre could have stood to be a little brighter. Nice cropping.', '2003-05-29 13:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(310073, 22656, 5044, '<td valign="top">The building on the left is very distracting. Might have been better if you had cropped it out completely.</td>', 'The building on the left is very distracting. Might have been better if you had cropped it out completely.', '2003-05-29 13:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(310075, 22700, 5044, '<td valign="top">I like it, but feel that the crop is a little too tight.</td>', 'I like it, but feel that the crop is a little too tight.', '2003-05-29 13:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(310082, 22732, 5044, '<td valign="top">I usually like big DOF shots, but I am not so sure it works on this shot. Also, the bits of string sticking out from the head are quite distracting, especially the one by the guitarist''s face.</td>', 'I usually like big DOF shots, but I am not so sure it works on this shot. Also, the bits of string sticking out from the head are quite distracting, especially the one by the guitarist''s face.', '2003-05-29 13:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(310085, 22743, 4493, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how the black backround was achieved but it really makes this stand out! Perfect! 10 -danny</td>', 'I''m not sure how the black backround was achieved but it really makes this stand out! Perfect! 10 -danny', '2003-05-29 14:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(310086, 22768, 4493, '<td valign="top">The tones and shadows make this a very strong shot. Wouldn''t change a thing. 10 -danny</td>', 'The tones and shadows make this a very strong shot. Wouldn''t change a thing. 10 -danny', '2003-05-29 14:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(310087, 22792, 4493, '<td valign="top">Can''t wait to find out where this was taken. This is spectacular! I love everything about it. 10 -danny</td>', 'Can''t wait to find out where this was taken. This is spectacular! I love everything about it. 10 -danny', '2003-05-29 14:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
