(310276, 22273, 6523, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  I''m not quite sure why you cropped it with just a fraction of the chin out because I find that a little bit distracting -- cropping it a little higher, for me, would have put the focus more on the eyes.  But that''s a very tiny quibble.  9</td>', 'Very nice photo.  I''m not quite sure why you cropped it with just a fraction of the chin out because I find that a little bit distracting -- cropping it a little higher, for me, would have put the focus more on the eyes.  But that''s a very tiny quibble.  9', '2003-05-29 16:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(310279, 22680, 5728, '<td valign="top">Awesome photo, the texture on the bug is so detailed. It kinda looks like it is floating above the plant somehow. And yep, I like it - 10.</td>', 'Awesome photo, the texture on the bug is so detailed. It kinda looks like it is floating above the plant somehow. And yep, I like it - 10.', '2003-05-29 16:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
