(310282, 22194, 5728, '<td valign="top">Fantastic macro shot, the conversion to B&amp;W has been done perfectly - 10.</td>', 'Fantastic macro shot, the conversion to B&W has been done perfectly - 10.', '2003-05-29 16:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(310283, 22462, 6523, '<td valign="top">The light in the photo is a bit bright for me -- I have to squint to look at it.  But I had a similar choice to make in my entry -- I chose to go a little darker and cut down on some of the detail and am getting comments that it could be brighter and show more detail.  What are you going to do, right?  I like your subject and depth of field and the tone really suits it quite well.</td>', 'The light in the photo is a bit bright for me -- I have to squint to look at it.  But I had a similar choice to make in my entry -- I chose to go a little darker and cut down on some of the detail and am getting comments that it could be brighter and show more detail.  What are you going to do, right?  I like your subject and depth of field and the tone really suits it quite well.', '2003-05-29 16:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(310284, 22308, 5728, '<td valign="top">Whitney is a real looker! Very photogenic, you have done wonders here - 9.</td>', 'Whitney is a real looker! Very photogenic, you have done wonders here - 9.', '2003-05-29 16:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
