(310295, 22620, 6523, '<td valign="top">Very nice -- I like the tones and the frame, as well as overall mood of the photo.</td>', 'Very nice -- I like the tones and the frame, as well as overall mood of the photo.', '2003-05-29 16:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(310297, 22295, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a great candidate for a duotone, no matter what the challenge.  I think it really adds a lot to the mood of the image which is cold, morbid, and sad also.  The sand appearing black is really showing some great texture as well.  The shallow DOF is very good as selling this pic and also removing anything unsightly from focused view.  Well done!</td>', 'This is a great candidate for a duotone, no matter what the challenge.  I think it really adds a lot to the mood of the image which is cold, morbid, and sad also.  The sand appearing black is really showing some great texture as well.  The shallow DOF is very good as selling this pic and also removing anything unsightly from focused view.  Well done!', '2003-05-29 16:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(310299, 22313, 6523, '<td valign="top">He looks so mean without the green!  :)  Nice tone and DOF -- I like the details that show a lot.</td>', 'He looks so mean without the green!  :)  Nice tone and DOF -- I like the details that show a lot.', '2003-05-29 16:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(310301, 22743, 3540, '<td valign="top">The basic black background really makes this a unique picture.  These birds are seen 99% of the time on blue sky or in seascape type shots.  This is almost a perfect stop action shot.  What really makes this picture is the framing.  I might have flipped this photo about the horizon to make it seem headed up instead of down.  I think moving from left to right is important from the mind''s natural perspective.  Nice work.</td>', 'The basic black background really makes this a unique picture.  These birds are seen 99% of the time on blue sky or in seascape type shots.  This is almost a perfect stop action shot.  What really makes this picture is the framing.  I might have flipped this photo about the horizon to make it seem headed up instead of down.  I think moving from left to right is important from the mind''s natural perspective.  Nice work.', '2003-05-29 16:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(310302, 22401, 6523, '<td valign="top">Nice dramatic lighting; the tone suits her well.</td>', 'Nice dramatic lighting; the tone suits her well.', '2003-05-29 16:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(310304, 22082, 6523, '<td valign="top">Good detail -- nice shot.</td>', 'Good detail -- nice shot.', '2003-05-29 16:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(310305, 22792, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good one, how the heck did you do this? - 9.</td>', 'Good one, how the heck did you do this? - 9.', '2003-05-29 16:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(310306, 22769, 6523, '<td valign="top">Good stop action -- nice job.</td>', 'Good stop action -- nice job.', '2003-05-29 16:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(310307, 22785, 5728, '<td valign="top">good tones, the lighting is spot on - 9.</td>', 'good tones, the lighting is spot on - 9.', '2003-05-29 16:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(310308, 22633, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is very good, the contrast between light and shadow is awesome - 9.</td>', 'This is very good, the contrast between light and shadow is awesome - 9.', '2003-05-29 16:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(310309, 22409, 6523, '<td valign="top">There''s a bit too much contrast here for me -- I have to squint when I look at the main blossom and its brightness seems to weigh the picture down on that side -- it looks like the photo is about to fall forward.</td>', 'There''s a bit too much contrast here for me -- I have to squint when I look at the main blossom and its brightness seems to weigh the picture down on that side -- it looks like the photo is about to fall forward.', '2003-05-29 16:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
