(311203, 22697, 7711, '<td valign="top">nice tones, but the fence doesn''t add anything to it the composition.</td>', 'nice tones, but the fence doesn''t add anything to it the composition.', '2003-05-30 22:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(311206, 22635, 9004, '<td valign="top">The shot is a bit angled to one side but besides that I like how everything is ''so opposite''</td>', 'The shot is a bit angled to one side but besides that I like how everything is ''so opposite''', '2003-05-30 23:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(311207, 22689, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent black and white... i love the way that chrome pans out in an image like this.. the contrasts are great and the drops of water that are present seem to add a beautiful touch to the theme...</td>', 'excellent black and white... i love the way that chrome pans out in an image like this.. the contrasts are great and the drops of water that are present seem to add a beautiful touch to the theme...', '2003-05-30 23:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(311208, 22049, 772, '<td valign="top">I hope to visit a place like this before i die :)  Great shot... This makes a great black and white as well... beautiful contrasts and great tonal range... excellent exposure as well...</td>', 'I hope to visit a place like this before i die :)  Great shot... This makes a great black and white as well... beautiful contrasts and great tonal range... excellent exposure as well...', '2003-05-30 23:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(311243, 22273, 8530, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t really do much for me. It''s nicely toned, although I think it would have worked better without the arc of (shirt? shoulder?) at the bottom center, which is a bit distracting.</td>', 'This doesn''t really do much for me. It''s nicely toned, although I think it would have worked better without the arc of (shirt? shoulder?) at the bottom center, which is a bit distracting.', '2003-05-31 03:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(311244, 22410, 8530, '<td valign="top">Cute kid. Good lighting, composition. Not really my ''thing'' in terms of photos, but the expression is well caught.</td>', 'Cute kid. Good lighting, composition. Not really my ''thing'' in terms of photos, but the expression is well caught.', '2003-05-31 03:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(311245, 22023, 8530, '<td valign="top">Ahh, the anticipation of that letter or package. I know that one well... but with the mailbox taking up less than half of the photo it seems to take away from the emphasis. Looks good in B&amp;W, though.</td>', 'Ahh, the anticipation of that letter or package. I know that one well... but with the mailbox taking up less than half of the photo it seems to take away from the emphasis. Looks good in B&W, though.', '2003-05-31 03:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(311246, 22069, 8530, '<td valign="top">Hmm, well, I had to search for the pigeon. It''s an interesting walkway, mind you, but if you wanted the photo to be about the pigeon it could''ve either been placed more prominently or taken against a less distractnig scenery.</td>', 'Hmm, well, I had to search for the pigeon. It''s an interesting walkway, mind you, but if you wanted the photo to be about the pigeon it could''ve either been placed more prominently or taken against a less distractnig scenery.', '2003-05-31 03:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(311249, 22745, 8530, '<td valign="top">Ahh, a pun. I must now whack you with this trout.<br/> <br/>Good shot, suits the sepia toning well. I''m curious where you found this stuff. It looks like a general store in the 50s (goes along with that tone).<br/> <br/>The sepia toning seems a little odd to me the more I look at it. A little more cool than I tend to envision sepia being, maybe.</td>', 'Ahh, a pun. I must now whack you with this trout. Good shot, suits the sepia toning well. I''m curious where you found this stuff. It looks like a general store in the 50s (goes along with that tone). The sepia toning seems a little odd to me the more I look at it. A little more cool than I tend to envision sepia being, maybe.', '2003-05-31 03:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(311250, 22403, 8530, '<td valign="top">Very pretty shot. Alas, it makes me want to see it in colour. However, in black and white, the water is emphasized, which is nice. Good angle, no one thing draws the eye, which in a photo like this is good as you want to have the gestalt experience. (Actually, I just wanted to use ''gestalt'' in a comment.)</td>', 'Very pretty shot. Alas, it makes me want to see it in colour. However, in black and white, the water is emphasized, which is nice. Good angle, no one thing draws the eye, which in a photo like this is good as you want to have the gestalt experience. (Actually, I just wanted to use ''gestalt'' in a comment.)', '2003-05-31 03:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(311252, 22427, 8530, '<td valign="top">Interessando. Um livro é naturalmente preto e branco -- por que adicione um tom do ''sepia''?<br/> <br/>And now, for the Portuguese impaired (I can only do it with help): Interesting. A book is naturally black and white -- why add a sepia tone?<br/> <br/>In any event, I do think a book is a natural choice for this, so definitely interesting, and a good shot of it.</td>', 'Interessando. Um livro é naturalmente preto e branco -- por que adicione um tom do ''sepia''? And now, for the Portuguese impaired (I can only do it with help): Interesting. A book is naturally black and white -- why add a sepia tone? In any event, I do think a book is a natural choice for this, so definitely interesting, and a good shot of it.', '2003-05-31 03:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(311253, 22490, 8530, '<td valign="top">I don''t know... it''s less your subject I have a problem with than the depth of focus, it''s very distracting to have that much blur where the colour change is.</td>', 'I don''t know... it''s less your subject I have a problem with than the depth of focus, it''s very distracting to have that much blur where the colour change is.', '2003-05-31 03:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(311254, 22698, 8530, '<td valign="top">Yes, that is indeed a golf ball. It even looks relatively naturaly in grayscale. Nice reflection. Not the world''s most interesting subject matter, but a good shot.</td>', 'Yes, that is indeed a golf ball. It even looks relatively naturaly in grayscale. Nice reflection. Not the world''s most interesting subject matter, but a good shot.', '2003-05-31 03:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(311255, 22275, 8530, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what I''m looking at . Curtains? A very well folded zebra?<br/> <br/>Very abstract, but it does hit the topic of the challenge. (I''m not a big fan of abstract, I''m afraid.)</td>', 'I have no idea what I''m looking at . Curtains? A very well folded zebra? Very abstract, but it does hit the topic of the challenge. (I''m not a big fan of abstract, I''m afraid.)', '2003-05-31 03:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(311257, 22692, 8530, '<td valign="top">Is "pass time" a pun? And besides, isn''t America''s pasttime baseball?<br/> <br/>Okay, enough title critique. I suppose it''s an interesting shot, what with the flag and pole framing it (although is that an American car in the background? Too blurry to see), but I''m afraid I''m a little prejudiced against that sort of thing, too many jingoistic people out there. The tone is somewhat sickly -- a deeper sepia or a flat black and white or even something else might have worked better.</td>', 'Is "pass time" a pun? And besides, isn''t America''s pasttime baseball? Okay, enough title critique. I suppose it''s an interesting shot, what with the flag and pole framing it (although is that an American car in the background? Too blurry to see), but I''m afraid I''m a little prejudiced against that sort of thing, too many jingoistic people out there. The tone is somewhat sickly -- a deeper sepia or a flat black and white or even something else might have worked better.', '2003-05-31 03:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(311258, 22082, 8530, '<td valign="top">Must... fight... vertigo.<br/> <br/>I think that makes it a good shot. And the toning on it is very nice, lovely from the deep right/bottom corner up to the bright highlights.</td>', 'Must... fight... vertigo. I think that makes it a good shot. And the toning on it is very nice, lovely from the deep right/bottom corner up to the bright highlights.', '2003-05-31 03:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(311259, 22755, 8530, '<td valign="top">Lots of cute kids in this challenge. I guess a lot of people like duotone shots of people. I am not really big on portrait-style shots myself, but this one is well framed and the toning on it is good. Focus is nice and clear on the kid and the background fades into obscurity as it ought for something like this, becoming appropriately neutral.</td>', 'Lots of cute kids in this challenge. I guess a lot of people like duotone shots of people. I am not really big on portrait-style shots myself, but this one is well framed and the toning on it is good. Focus is nice and clear on the kid and the background fades into obscurity as it ought for something like this, becoming appropriately neutral.', '2003-05-31 03:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(311260, 22708, 8530, '<td valign="top">Okay, all you people with the gorgeous landscape shots, please, please show me what they look like in colour! That means you, too. The shot itself is, in fact, gorgeous, but I''m not sure how I feel about it being black and white. Framed well, and a great shot of the reflection as well.</td>', 'Okay, all you people with the gorgeous landscape shots, please, please show me what they look like in colour! That means you, too. The shot itself is, in fact, gorgeous, but I''m not sure how I feel about it being black and white. Framed well, and a great shot of the reflection as well.', '2003-05-31 03:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(311261, 22635, 8530, '<td valign="top">Hmm, honestly I think I would have liked this better withOUT the straw. The refraction just looks very odd, probably the more so because of being in B&amp;W -- it actually looks like a separate object completely (including in that it looks like a Twizzler underwater).</td>', 'Hmm, honestly I think I would have liked this better withOUT the straw. The refraction just looks very odd, probably the more so because of being in B&W -- it actually looks like a separate object completely (including in that it looks like a Twizzler underwater).', '2003-05-31 03:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(311311, 22635, 3579, '<td valign="top">An interesting take on the now well-used refraction trick.  The whites aren''t quite white though, unless by the title you just mean the shot has been converted to greyscale. I find the corrugations in the glass detract from the shot, as they make the straw look chewed (the scoop on the straw doesn''t help either, IMO). The light shadow to the left of the glass disturbs the symmetry too. I think the composition is pretty good otherwise, however. Maybe with some level adjustments and a darker piece of black cardboard, it would be more punchy. Now that I look at it, you can see the cardboard coming up a bit at the bottom of the shot.</td>', 'An interesting take on the now well-used refraction trick.  The whites aren''t quite white though, unless by the title you just mean the shot has been converted to greyscale. I find the corrugations in the glass detract from the shot, as they make the straw look chewed (the scoop on the straw doesn''t help either, IMO). The light shadow to the left of the glass disturbs the symmetry too. I think the composition is pretty good otherwise, however. Maybe with some level adjustments and a darker piece of black cardboard, it would be more punchy. Now that I look at it, you can see the cardboard coming up a bit at the bottom of the shot.', '2003-05-31 09:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(311312, 22708, 3579, '<td valign="top">I really like the low clouds/fog off in the distance. All you need now is a moose drinking in the corner of the shot, and you have a masterpiece.</td>', 'I really like the low clouds/fog off in the distance. All you need now is a moose drinking in the corner of the shot, and you have a masterpiece.', '2003-05-31 09:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(311324, 22635, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think you need to boost the contrast to make the black darker and the white lighter. At the moment they both look like muddy grey.</td>', 'I think you need to boost the contrast to make the black darker and the white lighter. At the moment they both look like muddy grey.', '2003-05-31 09:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(311328, 22732, 2780, '<td valign="top">I expect you are getting lots of comments about how the DOF is too shallow, but I like it and think it works very well :)</td>', 'I expect you are getting lots of comments about how the DOF is too shallow, but I like it and think it works very well :)', '2003-05-31 09:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(311330, 22215, 3579, '<td valign="top">Big highway junctions are fascinating works of engineering. You''ve shown the subject from an interesting viewpoint. I''m wondering if it would have looked even better with the four roads disappearing into the corners of the shot. I find the lack of trees in the bottom corner draws my attention out of the shot, towards the bottom right corner, which unfortunately also happens to be quite blurry. Corner of the plane window?</td>', 'Big highway junctions are fascinating works of engineering. You''ve shown the subject from an interesting viewpoint. I''m wondering if it would have looked even better with the four roads disappearing into the corners of the shot. I find the lack of trees in the bottom corner draws my attention out of the shot, towards the bottom right corner, which unfortunately also happens to be quite blurry. Corner of the plane window?', '2003-05-31 09:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(311333, 22462, 3579, '<td valign="top">I like how the ropes and the side of the boat both draw the eye in from the bottom of the picture, towards the ladder, which is wonderfully sharp. The blue toning also looks great here.  I think it''s a little on the busy side, however. A boating enthusiast may disagree with me though :)</td>', 'I like how the ropes and the side of the boat both draw the eye in from the bottom of the picture, towards the ladder, which is wonderfully sharp. The blue toning also looks great here.  I think it''s a little on the busy side, however. A boating enthusiast may disagree with me though :)', '2003-05-31 09:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(311334, 22474, 3579, '<td valign="top">The tones are a little flat, and that wire bugs me. Ths shot looks a tiny bit out of focus too.  Funny shot though!<br/>The folds of its legs almost make the shape of a mouth, with a long pendulous nose. I think it''s smiling at me. 6.</td>', 'The tones are a little flat, and that wire bugs me. Ths shot looks a tiny bit out of focus too.  Funny shot though!The folds of its legs almost make the shape of a mouth, with a long pendulous nose. I think it''s smiling at me. 6.', '2003-05-31 10:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(311337, 22146, 3579, '<td valign="top">Nice mood to this photo. I think that you could have cropped out some of the sky though, and just kept a little around the tops of the trees. The sky is too bright for me.</td>', 'Nice mood to this photo. I think that you could have cropped out some of the sky though, and just kept a little around the tops of the trees. The sky is too bright for me.', '2003-05-31 10:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(311338, 22763, 3579, '<td valign="top">Great composition and lighting! I love the props too :)</td>', 'Great composition and lighting! I love the props too :)', '2003-05-31 10:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(311339, 22657, 3579, '<td valign="top">Nice light - it looks like liquid metal. 7.</td>', 'Nice light - it looks like liquid metal. 7.', '2003-05-31 10:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(311341, 22057, 3579, '<td valign="top">There''s something about this composition - the anonymity of the shot and the relaxed urban feel to it - that really works for me. I could just sit here too, and stare at whatever the two main subjects are staring at. I don''t think this would have worked nearly as well in colour. 8.</td>', 'There''s something about this composition - the anonymity of the shot and the relaxed urban feel to it - that really works for me. I could just sit here too, and stare at whatever the two main subjects are staring at. I don''t think this would have worked nearly as well in colour. 8.', '2003-05-31 10:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(311342, 22637, 3579, '<td valign="top">Nice shadow. I wonder if you could have somehow modified the angle to show the white feather completely on the black background, with the shadow on the light background. Nevertheless, the tonal transition looks good. No spot editing has got to be frustrating too (I''ve got a dead pixel of my own to worry about). 7</td>', 'Nice shadow. I wonder if you could have somehow modified the angle to show the white feather completely on the black background, with the shadow on the light background. Nevertheless, the tonal transition looks good. No spot editing has got to be frustrating too (I''ve got a dead pixel of my own to worry about). 7', '2003-05-31 10:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(311343, 22700, 3579, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. I think the highlights on the nose and in the beard a just a tiny little bit blown out. Great separation from the background though.</td>', 'Nice portrait. I think the highlights on the nose and in the beard a just a tiny little bit blown out. Great separation from the background though.', '2003-05-31 10:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(311344, 22274, 3579, '<td valign="top">Great use of light and shadow. A touch more sharpness would have been great for my tastes. A most curious border also.</td>', 'Great use of light and shadow. A touch more sharpness would have been great for my tastes. A most curious border also.', '2003-05-31 10:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(311345, 22474, 6900, '<td valign="top">What a crappy pic....ok bad pun!  Nice...tone.  Interesting perspective!</td>', 'What a crappy pic....ok bad pun!  Nice...tone.  Interesting perspective!', '2003-05-31 10:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(311346, 22731, 3579, '<td valign="top">Lovely soft lighting/focus here. I''d love to know what kinds of flower buds they are.  I find that my eyes are struggling to find a focal point though - the shot looks interesting enough at first glance, but there''s nothing there to really hold my gaze.</td>', 'Lovely soft lighting/focus here. I''d love to know what kinds of flower buds they are.  I find that my eyes are struggling to find a focal point though - the shot looks interesting enough at first glance, but there''s nothing there to really hold my gaze.', '2003-05-31 10:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(311347, 22625, 6900, '<td valign="top">THe kids are exposed very differently - and the screen just seems to be a distraction to the shot.  The composition seems a bit too tight - you''ve cut the girl''s arm and hair off and half the kid''s face.</td>', 'THe kids are exposed very differently - and the screen just seems to be a distraction to the shot.  The composition seems a bit too tight - you''ve cut the girl''s arm and hair off and half the kid''s face.', '2003-05-31 10:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(311349, 22488, 6900, '<td valign="top">This looks like a pic of the same scene from 100 years ago.  If this appeared at the beginning of a movie, I''d expect it to colorize any second and started the movie.  Nice job overall.  It seems a little low contrast.</td>', 'This looks like a pic of the same scene from 100 years ago.  If this appeared at the beginning of a movie, I''d expect it to colorize any second and started the movie.  Nice job overall.  It seems a little low contrast.', '2003-05-31 10:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(311353, 22691, 6025, '<td valign="top">interesting, but the extreme contrast becomes a little too much for my taste, I am afraid. (6)</td>', 'interesting, but the extreme contrast becomes a little too much for my taste, I am afraid. (6)', '2003-05-31 11:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(311355, 22735, 6900, '<td valign="top">The exposure feels a little off, but what  a great capture.  I almost wish it felt "darker" - the light trees give it a wholly different sense and feel.  8</td>', 'The exposure feels a little off, but what  a great capture.  I almost wish it felt "darker" - the light trees give it a wholly different sense and feel.  8', '2003-05-31 11:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(311356, 22145, 6900, '<td valign="top">What a telling photograph, title or not.  Amazing.</td>', 'What a telling photograph, title or not.  Amazing.', '2003-05-31 11:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(311357, 22780, 6900, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the light and darks...I like this shot a lot.  I bet that''s a heckuva cool shot in color as well.  8</td>', 'Nice capture of the light and darks...I like this shot a lot.  I bet that''s a heckuva cool shot in color as well.  8', '2003-05-31 11:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(311359, 22787, 6900, '<td valign="top">The more I see this, the more I fall in love with it...it''s not such a simple picture, so it deceives us.  I started this shot at a 7 and now I''m going to leave it at a 9 because I keep coming back to it.  Excellent work.</td>', 'The more I see this, the more I fall in love with it...it''s not such a simple picture, so it deceives us.  I started this shot at a 7 and now I''m going to leave it at a 9 because I keep coming back to it.  Excellent work.', '2003-05-31 11:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(311362, 22750, 3579, '<td valign="top">Nice candid moment. It would have been nice to capture him with his hand all the way up in the air.</td>', 'Nice candid moment. It would have been nice to capture him with his hand all the way up in the air.', '2003-05-31 11:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(311365, 22284, 6900, '<td valign="top">Nice border - how''d you do it?   I like the tones in this shot - it''s well composed and exposed.  8</td>', 'Nice border - how''d you do it?   I like the tones in this shot - it''s well composed and exposed.  8', '2003-05-31 11:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(311367, 22791, 6900, '<td valign="top">The whites seem a tad overexposed here - it has a funky feel to it, but it seems to be an intended funky feel.  Super work. 8</td>', 'The whites seem a tad overexposed here - it has a funky feel to it, but it seems to be an intended funky feel.  Super work. 8', '2003-05-31 11:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(311368, 22214, 3579, '<td valign="top">A wonderfully dreamy shot. This is the kind of shot that looks really great with a bit of soft focus.  I''d love to take a stroll down that path. An evocative shot! <br/> <br/>Edit: There are a couple of rectangular items in the shot, off in the distance a bit, that could be mistaken for rubbish. I still give it a 7 though. Great lighting :)</td>', 'A wonderfully dreamy shot. This is the kind of shot that looks really great with a bit of soft focus.  I''d love to take a stroll down that path. An evocative shot!  Edit: There are a couple of rectangular items in the shot, off in the distance a bit, that could be mistaken for rubbish. I still give it a 7 though. Great lighting :)', '2003-05-31 11:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(311369, 22614, 6900, '<td valign="top">I like the toning of this shot - and the details are extremely crisp.  The water seems naturally there, which is a bonus.  The composition is nice to me - with two or three exceptions where it''s just a black spot...</td>', 'I like the toning of this shot - and the details are extremely crisp.  The water seems naturally there, which is a bonus.  The composition is nice to me - with two or three exceptions where it''s just a black spot...', '2003-05-31 11:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(311370, 22665, 6900, '<td valign="top">What a great capture before the world wakes up and places look totally different.  This shot has a great feeling of anticipation and anxiety, like "let''s go already....open."  Perfect tones, great exposure.  8</td>', 'What a great capture before the world wakes up and places look totally different.  This shot has a great feeling of anticipation and anxiety, like "let''s go already....open."  Perfect tones, great exposure.  8', '2003-05-31 11:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(311371, 22284, 3579, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Great angle on the portrait shot. The eyes and the catchlights are fantastic. The only thing that distracts me is the portion of the slip/dress below the strap in the bottom right corner. I think there''s just too much/little for balance, and my eye gets drawn there rather than to the face. Excellent exposure though!</td>', 'Beautiful! Great angle on the portrait shot. The eyes and the catchlights are fantastic. The only thing that distracts me is the portion of the slip/dress below the strap in the bottom right corner. I think there''s just too much/little for balance, and my eye gets drawn there rather than to the face. Excellent exposure though!', '2003-05-31 11:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(311372, 22409, 6900, '<td valign="top">I''m split on this shot.  I wish there was a bit more on the left - the crop/composition is too tight.  I like the DoF but not the exposure - the whites seem almost too bright in the closest flower.  A very hard to judge shot, but one that appeals to me. 8</td>', 'I''m split on this shot.  I wish there was a bit more on the left - the crop/composition is too tight.  I like the DoF but not the exposure - the whites seem almost too bright in the closest flower.  A very hard to judge shot, but one that appeals to me. 8', '2003-05-31 11:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(311373, 22257, 3579, '<td valign="top">How did he die? Great choice of T-shirt for the challenge :)</td>', 'How did he die? Great choice of T-shirt for the challenge :)', '2003-05-31 11:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(311374, 22628, 3579, '<td valign="top">Lovely soft colours and lighting.</td>', 'Lovely soft colours and lighting.', '2003-05-31 11:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(311375, 22703, 3579, '<td valign="top">Nice period costumes.  It really does look like an old photo (except back in those days, didn''t everyone look at the camera because film was expensive? :))<br/></td>', 'Nice period costumes.  It really does look like an old photo (except back in those days, didn''t everyone look at the camera because film was expensive? :))', '2003-05-31 11:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(311376, 22791, 3579, '<td valign="top">The flash is a little too harsh for my liking.</td>', 'The flash is a little too harsh for my liking.', '2003-05-31 11:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(311377, 22295, 3579, '<td valign="top">A nice angle and good use of DOF here. 7</td>', 'A nice angle and good use of DOF here. 7', '2003-05-31 11:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(311378, 22149, 3579, '<td valign="top">It looks more like the hose, as the raindrops are missing in the top right. Nice shutter speed to blur the rain.</td>', 'It looks more like the hose, as the raindrops are missing in the top right. Nice shutter speed to blur the rain.', '2003-05-31 11:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(311380, 22627, 3579, '<td valign="top">Great exposure on the cloud! Lovely tones and contrast with the silhouettes. I would probably have cropped a little differently, and left out the lagging duck.</td>', 'Great exposure on the cloud! Lovely tones and contrast with the silhouettes. I would probably have cropped a little differently, and left out the lagging duck.', '2003-05-31 11:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(311381, 22267, 3579, '<td valign="top">Interesting profile shot and nice lighting. I think the crop is a little severe though.</td>', 'Interesting profile shot and nice lighting. I think the crop is a little severe though.', '2003-05-31 11:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(311382, 22267, 6900, '<td valign="top">I hear the screams of DPC voters!  "Too bright, harsh lighting, blah blah blah."  Let me set the record straight from MY POV - I think the lighting here is amazingly perfect.  I think the shadows on the back are excellent and I love this shot.  9...bordering 10.</td>', 'I hear the screams of DPC voters!  "Too bright, harsh lighting, blah blah blah."  Let me set the record straight from MY POV - I think the lighting here is amazingly perfect.  I think the shadows on the back are excellent and I love this shot.  9...bordering 10.', '2003-05-31 11:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(311389, 22273, 1717, '<td valign="top">wonderful photo!  the tones and clarity are amazing.  nice eyes, too :)</td>', 'wonderful photo!  the tones and clarity are amazing.  nice eyes, too :)', '2003-05-31 12:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(311391, 22656, 1717, '<td valign="top">this is a lovely photo.  it has a very abstract look about it.  the only thing i would have done differently is make a little tighter crop on the bottom, but, i think it''s great just as it is.  good job!</td>', 'this is a lovely photo.  it has a very abstract look about it.  the only thing i would have done differently is make a little tighter crop on the bottom, but, i think it''s great just as it is.  good job!', '2003-05-31 12:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(311393, 22780, 1717, '<td valign="top">very cool photo!  nice tones and detail.  good job!</td>', 'very cool photo!  nice tones and detail.  good job!', '2003-05-31 12:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
