(311396, 22488, 1717, '<td valign="top">beautiful, soft quality to this photo.  wonderful perspective.  my only complaint is the bird (?) at the top.  it''s not really definable as a bird, so it just looks like a dark spot and is a little distracting.</td>', 'beautiful, soft quality to this photo.  wonderful perspective.  my only complaint is the bird (?) at the top.  it''s not really definable as a bird, so it just looks like a dark spot and is a little distracting.', '2003-05-31 12:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(311398, 22752, 3579, '<td valign="top">Looks like sweaty work under the lights :) Interesting composition, and great skin tones on the exposure. It doesn''t look much like a traditional duotone to me, but that''s a wohle other argument.</td>', 'Looks like sweaty work under the lights :) Interesting composition, and great skin tones on the exposure. It doesn''t look much like a traditional duotone to me, but that''s a wohle other argument.', '2003-05-31 12:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(311401, 22782, 1717, '<td valign="top">good detail and textures here.  maybe you could see how it look with a little bit tighter crop on the left side.  the buildings on that side are a bit distracting.  very nice photo!</td>', 'good detail and textures here.  maybe you could see how it look with a little bit tighter crop on the left side.  the buildings on that side are a bit distracting.  very nice photo!', '2003-05-31 12:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
