(311562, 22633, 4400, '<td valign="top">Very good, I like the shadow on the left of the house vell done 10</td>', 'Very good, I like the shadow on the left of the house vell done 10', '2003-05-31 17:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(311563, 22781, 8637, '<td valign="top">very nice...great pastel duotone, and great shot.</td>', 'very nice...great pastel duotone, and great shot.', '2003-05-31 17:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(311564, 22754, 8637, '<td valign="top">grea idea and nice angle...dof is off and would otherwise make this a great shot.  thanks</td>', 'grea idea and nice angle...dof is off and would otherwise make this a great shot.  thanks', '2003-05-31 17:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(311565, 22700, 4400, '<td valign="top">Very nice! 10</td>', 'Very nice! 10', '2003-05-31 17:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(311566, 22626, 8637, '<td valign="top">beautiful image...i like the way it is cropped...and the color chosen for the duotone could not have been better.</td>', 'beautiful image...i like the way it is cropped...and the color chosen for the duotone could not have been better.', '2003-05-31 17:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(311580, 22700, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture.  I love the little dust specks on the "boina".  My favourite this week, by far.  ~10</td>', 'Beautiful picture.  I love the little dust specks on the "boina".  My favourite this week, by far.  ~10', '2003-05-31 18:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(311588, 22308, 6458, '<td valign="top">At first I was disturbed by the focus on the rim of the hat, rather than the eyes.. however on further contemplation I do like the effect. It almost serves to draw attention to her face and hair. Good job! 9<br/></td>', 'At first I was disturbed by the focus on the rim of the hat, rather than the eyes.. however on further contemplation I do like the effect. It almost serves to draw attention to her face and hair. Good job! 9', '2003-05-31 20:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(311590, 22462, 6912, '<td valign="top">Sea and boats, always a great idea to photograph! I like the way all those ropes lead your eye to the ladder and how sharp and soft at the same time your photo is - 10, Nasti</td>', 'Sea and boats, always a great idea to photograph! I like the way all those ropes lead your eye to the ladder and how sharp and soft at the same time your photo is - 10, Nasti', '2003-05-31 20:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(311594, 22627, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture.  The clouds are spectacular, and the three ducks stand out so clear!  The light touch of sepia is just right.  ~10</td>', 'Beautiful picture.  The clouds are spectacular, and the three ducks stand out so clear!  The light touch of sepia is just right.  ~10', '2003-05-31 21:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(311595, 22362, 5112, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of that new movie coming out, "Pirates of the Caribbean".  Nice picture - where''d you find the model?  Good subject for BW.</td>', 'This reminds me of that new movie coming out, "Pirates of the Caribbean".  Nice picture - where''d you find the model?  Good subject for BW.', '2003-05-31 21:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(311596, 22403, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  The water coming down looks like veils.  The rocks are so clear.  Very good choice for BW.</td>', 'Beautiful.  The water coming down looks like veils.  The rocks are so clear.  Very good choice for BW.', '2003-05-31 21:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(311604, 22728, 2553, '<td valign="top">I just love this shot.  Love the B&amp;W, the repeating pattern of the windows, and especially like the "stark" white of the church against the stormy sky.  The white (lighted?) cross is perfect.  One of my favorites.</td>', 'I just love this shot.  Love the B&W, the repeating pattern of the windows, and especially like the "stark" white of the church against the stormy sky.  The white (lighted?) cross is perfect.  One of my favorites.', '2003-05-31 22:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(311605, 22637, 2553, '<td valign="top">Absolutely one of my very favorites, this is a shot I would hang on my wall in a heartbeat!  Love the use of B&amp;W, the composition is terrific, and I love the concept and execution.  Expect to see you on the home page!</td>', 'Absolutely one of my very favorites, this is a shot I would hang on my wall in a heartbeat!  Love the use of B&W, the composition is terrific, and I love the concept and execution.  Expect to see you on the home page!', '2003-05-31 22:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(311606, 22632, 2553, '<td valign="top">What a lovely shot!  Love the B&amp;W and the softness.  Lighting and composition work perfectly.  She is beautiful.</td>', 'What a lovely shot!  Love the B&W and the softness.  Lighting and composition work perfectly.  She is beautiful.', '2003-05-31 22:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(311607, 22620, 2553, '<td valign="top">Love the shot, not crazy about the border.  The shot is beautiful in it''s simplicity, the depth of field is perfect, and I really like the composition.  I would have wished  for a bit more light on the horse, but nevertheless, well done.</td>', 'Love the shot, not crazy about the border.  The shot is beautiful in it''s simplicity, the depth of field is perfect, and I really like the composition.  I would have wished  for a bit more light on the horse, but nevertheless, well done.', '2003-05-31 22:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(311609, 22743, 2553, '<td valign="top">Not crazy about the border, and I''m not sure whether or not I like the totally black background, however the shot is interesting.  I like the range of tones on the bird, but don''t care for the way the black areas "bleed" into the background.   I like the composition very much, and the light on the bird is pretty good.  Gave you a pretty high score anyway (9) because I do feel the shot has pretty good visual appeal.</td>', 'Not crazy about the border, and I''m not sure whether or not I like the totally black background, however the shot is interesting.  I like the range of tones on the bird, but don''t care for the way the black areas "bleed" into the background.   I like the composition very much, and the light on the bird is pretty good.  Gave you a pretty high score anyway (9) because I do feel the shot has pretty good visual appeal.', '2003-05-31 22:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(311611, 22625, 2553, '<td valign="top">I really like this!  The moment I saw it, it made me laugh.  Makes me think of me and brothers when we were small.  Love the duotoning that you chose, and LOVE that you shot through the screen - it gives the shot a very "painterly" and "old" feeling that I like very much.  No doubt you will get some negative comments for this, but I hope that you are proud of this shot!</td>', 'I really like this!  The moment I saw it, it made me laugh.  Makes me think of me and brothers when we were small.  Love the duotoning that you chose, and LOVE that you shot through the screen - it gives the shot a very "painterly" and "old" feeling that I like very much.  No doubt you will get some negative comments for this, but I hope that you are proud of this shot!', '2003-05-31 22:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(311613, 22082, 2553, '<td valign="top">Every time I look at this shot, it just takes my breath away.  The white looks silver to me, and the dark areas look like silver that is oxidized.  I like the composition, but have to wonder what it would have looked like shot straight on center.  The lighting is wonderful, giving the shot a marvelous antiqued feeling.  Just my way of looking at it, of course, but  this is great!</td>', 'Every time I look at this shot, it just takes my breath away.  The white looks silver to me, and the dark areas look like silver that is oxidized.  I like the composition, but have to wonder what it would have looked like shot straight on center.  The lighting is wonderful, giving the shot a marvelous antiqued feeling.  Just my way of looking at it, of course, but  this is great!', '2003-05-31 22:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(311615, 22199, 2553, '<td valign="top">I am not normally a big fan of flowers done in b&amp;w, but this is lovely.  I like your choice of duotoning, and also the composition.  The dark area at the center of the flower seems to balance it well.  I love the very feathery aspect of the flower, which lends itself well to this treatment.  The lighting is probably the thing that really makes this shot for me, since it has produced a fairly good range of tone.  Very nice.</td>', 'I am not normally a big fan of flowers done in b&w, but this is lovely.  I like your choice of duotoning, and also the composition.  The dark area at the center of the flower seems to balance it well.  I love the very feathery aspect of the flower, which lends itself well to this treatment.  The lighting is probably the thing that really makes this shot for me, since it has produced a fairly good range of tone.  Very nice.', '2003-05-31 22:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(311618, 22145, 2553, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot, marred (for me) only by the small "spots" along  the left hand side - they keep distracting my eyes.  I think I would like to have seen just a touch more light on the upper hand.  The composition works beautifully, as does the black background.  I also love the concept.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot, marred (for me) only by the small "spots" along  the left hand side - they keep distracting my eyes.  I think I would like to have seen just a touch more light on the upper hand.  The composition works beautifully, as does the black background.  I also love the concept.', '2003-05-31 22:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(311619, 22755, 2553, '<td valign="top">I love the duotoning, and the softness of this, but most of all, the expression!  Such a serious little face.  This is a shot to be proud of, for sure.  Composition and lighting are great.</td>', 'I love the duotoning, and the softness of this, but most of all, the expression!  Such a serious little face.  This is a shot to be proud of, for sure.  Composition and lighting are great.', '2003-05-31 22:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(311620, 22626, 5351, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this shot!  More specifically - I think the composition is excellent and the DOF is right on for the feel of the photo -which I also think was aptly named.  Very nice job - high score:)</td>', 'I like everything about this shot!  More specifically - I think the composition is excellent and the DOF is right on for the feel of the photo -which I also think was aptly named.  Very nice job - high score:)', '2003-05-31 22:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(311621, 22729, 2553, '<td valign="top">This looks like a zinnia to me.  I am not crazy about b&amp;w flower shots normally, but this one, I do like.  The depth of field works well to emphasize the flower, but still retains a good range of tones that are a perfect background for "framing" the flower.  I am not crazy about the border, though I honestly can''t say what I would have done differently.</td>', 'This looks like a zinnia to me.  I am not crazy about b&w flower shots normally, but this one, I do like.  The depth of field works well to emphasize the flower, but still retains a good range of tones that are a perfect background for "framing" the flower.  I am not crazy about the border, though I honestly can''t say what I would have done differently.', '2003-05-31 22:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(311622, 22702, 5351, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and concept of this shot.  I think however it would be better without the reflection in the upper left window as I find it very distracting.  Maybe if taken at a different time of day? -just my thought:)</td>', 'I really like the composition and concept of this shot.  I think however it would be better without the reflection in the upper left window as I find it very distracting.  Maybe if taken at a different time of day? -just my thought:)', '2003-05-31 22:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(311623, 22792, 2553, '<td valign="top">Very Matrix-y!  The colors are striking and the composition interesting, though I feel that there is too much blue on the left side, making it feel a little unbalanced to me.  There is also a very pink area running alongside the left side of the black that I find very distracting. Interesting concept.</td>', 'Very Matrix-y!  The colors are striking and the composition interesting, though I feel that there is too much blue on the left side, making it feel a little unbalanced to me.  There is also a very pink area running alongside the left side of the black that I find very distracting. Interesting concept.', '2003-05-31 22:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(311624, 22656, 5351, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot.  I keep looking at it and I love the ocmposition but think it would be even more striking with something ... maybe more contrast?  Lots to look at and very uniique - good job.</td>', 'Very interesting shot.  I keep looking at it and I love the ocmposition but think it would be even more striking with something ... maybe more contrast?  Lots to look at and very uniique - good job.', '2003-05-31 22:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(311626, 22754, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like this very much.  There is a good range of tone/contrast that makes it very appealing.  DOF creates a nice soft background that plays well against the nice shapes of the shrooms.</td>', 'I like this very much.  There is a good range of tone/contrast that makes it very appealing.  DOF creates a nice soft background that plays well against the nice shapes of the shrooms.', '2003-05-31 22:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(311627, 22450, 5351, '<td valign="top">This is very striking in its composition.  I believe if it had more constrast it would be even more striking.</td>', 'This is very striking in its composition.  I believe if it had more constrast it would be even more striking.', '2003-05-31 22:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(311628, 22769, 2553, '<td valign="top">Love this shot and your choice of duotoning.  My only "gripe" is - I really want that second horse to come into full view!  Nice shot though!</td>', 'Love this shot and your choice of duotoning.  My only "gripe" is - I really want that second horse to come into full view!  Nice shot though!', '2003-05-31 22:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(311629, 22752, 2553, '<td valign="top">I find this shot oddly interesting.  I wasn''t sure, at first, if I liked it, and have had to come back several times to give it another look.  The composition is quite visually appealing, and your concept is quite unique (at least to me).  The one little thing that really makes this shot for me is the spikes of hair hanging across her face.  Don''t know why, I guess it is just something a little unexpected and it adds some "kick" to the shot.</td>', 'I find this shot oddly interesting.  I wasn''t sure, at first, if I liked it, and have had to come back several times to give it another look.  The composition is quite visually appealing, and your concept is quite unique (at least to me).  The one little thing that really makes this shot for me is the spikes of hair hanging across her face.  Don''t know why, I guess it is just something a little unexpected and it adds some "kick" to the shot.', '2003-05-31 22:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(311630, 22313, 5351, '<td valign="top">This is really cute!  My only suggestion would be to get a more eye level shot.  Definately makes me smile:)</td>', 'This is really cute!  My only suggestion would be to get a more eye level shot.  Definately makes me smile:)', '2003-05-31 22:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(311631, 22700, 2553, '<td valign="top">Had to chuckle at this shot when I first saw it- it reminds me so much of my boss!  What a marvelous portrait though.  The lighting and composition are just wonderful, as is the DOF.  Definitely one of my favorite shots, and after looking at it several times, I am "upgrading" my vote to 10. Lovely work.</td>', 'Had to chuckle at this shot when I first saw it- it reminds me so much of my boss!  What a marvelous portrait though.  The lighting and composition are just wonderful, as is the DOF.  Definitely one of my favorite shots, and after looking at it several times, I am "upgrading" my vote to 10. Lovely work.', '2003-05-31 22:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(311632, 22618, 5351, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea but I think a bit too dark and maybe a bit out of focus?  Good composition and border.</td>', 'Very nice idea but I think a bit too dark and maybe a bit out of focus?  Good composition and border.', '2003-05-31 22:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(311633, 22781, 5351, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - love the color tint and subject.</td>', 'Nice shot - love the color tint and subject.', '2003-05-31 22:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(311635, 22657, 2553, '<td valign="top">Wonderful interplay of lights and darks.  I find myself wondering what this would have looked like using different color "tones".  I am not entirely crazy about the wide black border - I feel that it unbalances the shot somewhat.</td>', 'Wonderful interplay of lights and darks.  I find myself wondering what this would have looked like using different color "tones".  I am not entirely crazy about the wide black border - I feel that it unbalances the shot somewhat.', '2003-05-31 22:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(311636, 22420, 2553, '<td valign="top">The duotoning is very nice, and I really like the "lightness" of the shot.  I would really liked to have seen her making eye contact with the camera/you.  Nevertheless, a nice informal portrait.</td>', 'The duotoning is very nice, and I really like the "lightness" of the shot.  I would really liked to have seen her making eye contact with the camera/you.  Nevertheless, a nice informal portrait.', '2003-05-31 22:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(311637, 22479, 5351, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love this!  The detail on the petals is amazing and the background/dof is great as well.  one of my favorites so far.    Very high score:)</td>', 'Absolutely love this!  The detail on the petals is amazing and the background/dof is great as well.  one of my favorites so far.    Very high score:)', '2003-05-31 22:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(311638, 22313, 2553, '<td valign="top">Whoa!  I feel like I could reach right out and feel the texture of this guy''s ...well, whatever it is - skin, hide, horns, whatever!  The lighting and composition on this are great.  You''ve really managed to capture the "feel" of this creature so well.  Very cool.</td>', 'Whoa!  I feel like I could reach right out and feel the texture of this guy''s ...well, whatever it is - skin, hide, horns, whatever!  The lighting and composition on this are great.  You''ve really managed to capture the "feel" of this creature so well.  Very cool.', '2003-05-31 22:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(311639, 22274, 5351, '<td valign="top">Great concept!  My only suggestion would be a simple border:)</td>', 'Great concept!  My only suggestion would be a simple border:)', '2003-05-31 22:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(311640, 22215, 5351, '<td valign="top">This is great - definately has a "wow" factor!  Good job.</td>', 'This is great - definately has a "wow" factor!  Good job.', '2003-05-31 22:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(311641, 22685, 2553, '<td valign="top">Oh my goodness - I want just the tiniest bit more light on the subject.  This shot really grabbed me right away!  There just seems to be so much emotion in that beautiful little face.  But I want just a tiny bit more light!!  Have to admit that the soft, moody feel of it works so well, and it is quite a lovely shot anyway.</td>', 'Oh my goodness - I want just the tiniest bit more light on the subject.  This shot really grabbed me right away!  There just seems to be so much emotion in that beautiful little face.  But I want just a tiny bit more light!!  Have to admit that the soft, moody feel of it works so well, and it is quite a lovely shot anyway.', '2003-05-31 23:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(311642, 22632, 5351, '<td valign="top">Lovely - very moving photograph - nicely done:)</td>', 'Lovely - very moving photograph - nicely done:)', '2003-05-31 23:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(311644, 22069, 5351, '<td valign="top">Really cool composition.  I do feel that the lighting is a bit harsh.  Would love to see this at a different time of day - I really love the curves in this!</td>', 'Really cool composition.  I do feel that the lighting is a bit harsh.  Would love to see this at a different time of day - I really love the curves in this!', '2003-05-31 23:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(311645, 22491, 2553, '<td valign="top">I love the duotoning and the infrared, as well as the overall feel of the shot.  I would like to have seen much more of the castle; and must admit that I find the power lines to be very distracting.<br/>Addendum:  What a shame that such potentially wonderful architecture is hidden like that!  They should make it more accessible for photographers!  LOL!</td>', 'I love the duotoning and the infrared, as well as the overall feel of the shot.  I would like to have seen much more of the castle; and must admit that I find the power lines to be very distracting.Addendum:  What a shame that such potentially wonderful architecture is hidden like that!  They should make it more accessible for photographers!  LOL!', '2003-05-31 23:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(311659, 22701, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice composition...leaves on the left look a bit oversharpened to me.</td>', 'Nice composition...leaves on the left look a bit oversharpened to me.', '2003-05-31 23:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(311661, 22709, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice job making a portrait usinf a "cold" color...I think it''s harder to make look good.</td>', 'Nice job making a portrait usinf a "cold" color...I think it''s harder to make look good.', '2003-05-31 23:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(311663, 22308, 1031, '<td valign="top">Brightest highlights slightly blown-out, but that''s beautiful lighting overall. I''d like to see a version using a "print-type" duotone using black and a light peachy color</td>', 'Brightest highlights slightly blown-out, but that''s beautiful lighting overall. I''d like to see a version using a "print-type" duotone using black and a light peachy color', '2003-05-31 23:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
