(311739, 22680, 3579, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. 10. I wouldn''t keep the double black border though.</td>', 'Lovely shot. 10. I wouldn''t keep the double black border though.', '2003-06-01 08:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(311740, 22751, 3579, '<td valign="top">Interesting building study.</td>', 'Interesting building study.', '2003-06-01 08:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(311741, 22082, 3579, '<td valign="top">Great shot. A tiny bit blown out in the middle there, but a wonderful interplay of light and dark shades. I really like the dark clouds closing over too.</td>', 'Great shot. A tiny bit blown out in the middle there, but a wonderful interplay of light and dark shades. I really like the dark clouds closing over too.', '2003-06-01 08:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(311744, 22488, 3540, '<td valign="top">Very nice architecture.  THe sky is a little ominous, it would be cooler if it was darker.  Nice job keeping everything in this picture focued.  It wouldn''t look right if something was out of focus here.  A shallow DOF would''ve left the foreground blurry as heck and that''s never good.  I don''t really like the houses in front too much.  I think it would''ve been more effective to just get the big building.  If the big building were up a little higher and looked more menacing, then I think it would be good to have the couple houses there so show relative size.  - Bob</td>', 'Very nice architecture.  THe sky is a little ominous, it would be cooler if it was darker.  Nice job keeping everything in this picture focued.  It wouldn''t look right if something was out of focus here.  A shallow DOF would''ve left the foreground blurry as heck and that''s never good.  I don''t really like the houses in front too much.  I think it would''ve been more effective to just get the big building.  If the big building were up a little higher and looked more menacing, then I think it would be good to have the couple houses there so show relative size.  - Bob', '2003-06-01 08:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(311745, 22054, 3579, '<td valign="top">Lovely looking tree. Pity about the fence. This shot with the shadow but no fence would be fantastic. 9.</td>', 'Lovely looking tree. Pity about the fence. This shot with the shadow but no fence would be fantastic. 9.', '2003-06-01 08:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(311746, 22728, 3579, '<td valign="top">Nicely done exposure. I wonder if you could have gone lower to the ground to try and get the parking spaces out of the shot.</td>', 'Nicely done exposure. I wonder if you could have gone lower to the ground to try and get the parking spaces out of the shot.', '2003-06-01 08:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(311747, 22284, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait!  Love the crop and the tone.  Great job!</td>', 'Nice portrait!  Love the crop and the tone.  Great job!', '2003-06-01 09:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(311748, 22776, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, layout, and attention to detail.  Looks like a scene from the past.  I like the crop but might have shown a tad more of table covering (has nice texture - good for duotones).  Good job!</td>', 'Nice composition, layout, and attention to detail.  Looks like a scene from the past.  I like the crop but might have shown a tad more of table covering (has nice texture - good for duotones).  Good job!', '2003-06-01 09:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(311750, 22082, 6600, '<td valign="top">Very nice texture, color, and composition.  Well focused to boot (that can be a challenge for some).  Good exposure considering the existing lighting present.  Nice job!</td>', 'Very nice texture, color, and composition.  Well focused to boot (that can be a challenge for some).  Good exposure considering the existing lighting present.  Nice job!', '2003-06-01 09:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(311751, 22620, 6600, '<td valign="top">Listen here BUCKO! (just wanted to say that).  Nicely composed, love the area of the horses head in the grass, nice!  (maybe a bit more cropping at the top would have appealed to me more, not sure).  Beautiful animal, great job!</td>', 'Listen here BUCKO! (just wanted to say that).  Nicely composed, love the area of the horses head in the grass, nice!  (maybe a bit more cropping at the top would have appealed to me more, not sure).  Beautiful animal, great job!', '2003-06-01 09:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(311752, 22700, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait! Very interesting looking character.  Good tone, DOF, composition.  Great job!</td>', 'Nice portrait! Very interesting looking character.  Good tone, DOF, composition.  Great job!', '2003-06-01 09:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(311754, 22313, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and subject.  This critter seems to impart an attitude with its pose.  I would have liked a little wider dof so as to have the complete head in focus (body not necessary, but tip of nose to neck would have been super!).  Enough for the picky details.....  Great job!</td>', 'Nice composition and subject.  This critter seems to impart an attitude with its pose.  I would have liked a little wider dof so as to have the complete head in focus (body not necessary, but tip of nose to neck would have been super!).  Enough for the picky details.....  Great job!', '2003-06-01 09:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(311756, 22283, 2363, '<td valign="top">What a lovely Impressionist effect</td>', 'What a lovely Impressionist effect', '2003-06-01 09:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(311757, 22790, 2363, '<td valign="top">I like the way the use of noise makes this photo look old</td>', 'I like the way the use of noise makes this photo look old', '2003-06-01 09:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(311758, 22307, 2363, '<td valign="top">Well done - this image makes me shudder :-)</td>', 'Well done - this image makes me shudder :-)', '2003-06-01 10:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(311759, 22703, 2363, '<td valign="top">How authentic-looking!</td>', 'How authentic-looking!', '2003-06-01 10:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(311764, 22750, 8533, '<td valign="top">The picture of the kid and the guy to the right is great, but the person in the background with their back to us is distracting as is the movement blur on the person to the left. Some wonderful elements but it doesn''t work overall for me. I also think it''s a great pity that you didn''t frame it a little lower to get the feet fully in shot.</td>', 'The picture of the kid and the guy to the right is great, but the person in the background with their back to us is distracting as is the movement blur on the person to the left. Some wonderful elements but it doesn''t work overall for me. I also think it''s a great pity that you didn''t frame it a little lower to get the feet fully in shot.', '2003-06-01 11:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(311775, 22273, 7711, '<td valign="top">very nice lighting, beautiful tones. I think i would have preferred a slightly different crop to get a little more or less of the face..i don''t know what it is but the crop you have makes me feel its incomplete or missing something somehow, but very nicely done nonetheless.</td>', 'very nice lighting, beautiful tones. I think i would have preferred a slightly different crop to get a little more or less of the face..i don''t know what it is but the crop you have makes me feel its incomplete or missing something somehow, but very nicely done nonetheless.', '2003-06-01 12:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
