(311836, 22700, 3710, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait shot,  u got the darkest of dark, lightest of light and tones in between, thats how it should be... i  also like that u didn''t make the image too sharp, not too much contrast, not too saturated , in other words it''s got all the ingredients for an excellent portrait shot  and definetely met the challenge<br/> <br/>...this can be made into a painting or charcoal drawing.....  good luck</td>', 'Nice portrait shot,  u got the darkest of dark, lightest of light and tones in between, thats how it should be... i  also like that u didn''t make the image too sharp, not too much contrast, not too saturated , in other words it''s got all the ingredients for an excellent portrait shot  and definetely met the challenge ...this can be made into a painting or charcoal drawing.....  good luck', '2003-06-01 14:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
