(311865, 22429, 2586, '<td valign="top">This is a great portrait; reminds me of trying to do flowers with a new twist to get away from the cliché. Even though the features are distorted to the point that one cannot ''recognize'' the child, it''s a telling representation of a child. Find this very insightful. Sad really that you felt obliged to give it such a blatantly obvious title to appease the literal minded voters at dpc. 9</td>', 'This is a great portrait; reminds me of trying to do flowers with a new twist to get away from the cliché. Even though the features are distorted to the point that one cannot ''recognize'' the child, it''s a telling representation of a child. Find this very insightful. Sad really that you felt obliged to give it such a blatantly obvious title to appease the literal minded voters at dpc. 9', '2003-06-01 15:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(311866, 22049, 2586, '<td valign="top">Nice rhythm of lines and of darks and lights. 9</td>', 'Nice rhythm of lines and of darks and lights. 9', '2003-06-01 15:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(311867, 22700, 2586, '<td valign="top">Good portrait of a great character, nice B&amp;W. Alors, ce mec, est-il français?</td>', 'Good portrait of a great character, nice B&W. Alors, ce mec, est-il français?', '2003-06-01 15:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(311868, 22069, 2586, '<td valign="top">Nice composition with the curves; the pigeon is a wonderful finishing touch; like the abstraction of the trees behind the curve or the reflection thereof in the water. Too bad some of the lights have been blown out (foreground rail and the water); perhaps you took it on the wrong time of the day? 8</td>', 'Nice composition with the curves; the pigeon is a wonderful finishing touch; like the abstraction of the trees behind the curve or the reflection thereof in the water. Too bad some of the lights have been blown out (foreground rail and the water); perhaps you took it on the wrong time of the day? 8', '2003-06-01 15:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(311870, 22627, 2586, '<td valign="top">Beautiful clouds, great opportunity shot with the ducks. Personally, would have cropped off most of the dark at the bottom. 8</td>', 'Beautiful clouds, great opportunity shot with the ducks. Personally, would have cropped off most of the dark at the bottom. 8', '2003-06-01 16:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(311871, 22632, 6630, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful baby!!</td>', 'This is a beautiful baby!!', '2003-06-01 16:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
