(311889, 22782, 811, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the detail.  Very desolate looking to me.  It almost looks like it is them against the world.</td>', 'Great capture of the detail.  Very desolate looking to me.  It almost looks like it is them against the world.', '2003-06-01 16:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(311890, 22284, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this.  It is simple and straightforward, and doesn''t have a lot of distracting elements.  It is easy to focus on her face.</td>', 'I like the composition of this.  It is simple and straightforward, and doesn''t have a lot of distracting elements.  It is easy to focus on her face.', '2003-06-01 16:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(311892, 22743, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like how you have chosen to frame this.  Gives an even more determined look to the bird I think, because now it has somewhere to go.</td>', 'I really like how you have chosen to frame this.  Gives an even more determined look to the bird I think, because now it has somewhere to go.', '2003-06-01 16:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(311895, 22215, 811, '<td valign="top">As someone who is afraid of heights, this is dizzy-ing.  It seems a little muted to me, maybe a bit more contrast?</td>', 'As someone who is afraid of heights, this is dizzy-ing.  It seems a little muted to me, maybe a bit more contrast?', '2003-06-01 16:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(311899, 22637, 6458, '<td valign="top">I love this photo. It''s simple yet complex at the same time. The diagonals running through out and the tones you''ve captured are wonderful. I really love the juxtaposition of black, gray, and white. Great job!</td>', 'I love this photo. It''s simple yet complex at the same time. The diagonals running through out and the tones you''ve captured are wonderful. I really love the juxtaposition of black, gray, and white. Great job!', '2003-06-01 16:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(311909, 22726, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the coloring you have used here.  Also, I like the "naturalness" of it.</td>', 'I really like the coloring you have used here.  Also, I like the "naturalness" of it.', '2003-06-01 17:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(311910, 22023, 811, '<td valign="top">I think the mailbox should fill more of the frame, even though you have followed the "rules."  I find myself focusing on the cars because that is where the road leads.</td>', 'I think the mailbox should fill more of the frame, even though you have followed the "rules."  I find myself focusing on the cars because that is where the road leads.', '2003-06-01 17:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(311911, 22427, 811, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and focus.  Sometimes it helps the interest level if the subject (in this case a Bible) in a more contextual setting.  This seems especially true of books.  I think it may have helped here to give teh viewer a sense of looking at more than just a book.</td>', 'Great lighting and focus.  Sometimes it helps the interest level if the subject (in this case a Bible) in a more contextual setting.  This seems especially true of books.  I think it may have helped here to give teh viewer a sense of looking at more than just a book.', '2003-06-01 17:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(311912, 22510, 811, '<td valign="top">That''s a cool shot, but to me all the snow looks yellowish/orange.  Was that deliberate?  It has a warm feeling to it, and the "glow" in interesting.  Not sure what effect you were after, though.</td>', 'That''s a cool shot, but to me all the snow looks yellowish/orange.  Was that deliberate?  It has a warm feeling to it, and the "glow" in interesting.  Not sure what effect you were after, though.', '2003-06-01 17:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(311914, 22450, 9062, '<td valign="top">Buena foto de la Iglesia del Tibidabo. Me gusta!  En blanco y negro queda realmente bien, una pena que no la podamos ver entera.<br/></td>', 'Buena foto de la Iglesia del Tibidabo. Me gusta!  En blanco y negro queda realmente bien, una pena que no la podamos ver entera.', '2003-06-01 17:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(311933, 22688, 8530, '<td valign="top">More shadows, or deeper ones, might have been cooler, but I think it''s interesting as is, since I think the whole ''light and shadow'' thing is a great way to highlight the concept of duotones.</td>', 'More shadows, or deeper ones, might have been cooler, but I think it''s interesting as is, since I think the whole ''light and shadow'' thing is a great way to highlight the concept of duotones.', '2003-06-01 18:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(311934, 22751, 8530, '<td valign="top">If it weren''t for the prices, this would look entirely like an old picture of an old general store, which is neat -- and presumably the idea. Good job on making it look very old-photograph.</td>', 'If it weren''t for the prices, this would look entirely like an old picture of an old general store, which is neat -- and presumably the idea. Good job on making it look very old-photograph.', '2003-06-01 18:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(311936, 22735, 8530, '<td valign="top">The first thing I thought was "It''s the road to South Park!" -- which will only make sense if you both watch South Park and have seen the "It''s Butters!" episode. Nice... I like the way the path fades down at the end, and how it''s framed by the trees.</td>', 'The first thing I thought was "It''s the road to South Park!" -- which will only make sense if you both watch South Park and have seen the "It''s Butters!" episode. Nice... I like the way the path fades down at the end, and how it''s framed by the trees.', '2003-06-01 18:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(311937, 22299, 8530, '<td valign="top">Probably a bit too much light-on-light here to really emphasize the topic, although it''s an interesting concept.</td>', 'Probably a bit too much light-on-light here to really emphasize the topic, although it''s an interesting concept.', '2003-06-01 18:49:58.000000', NULL, 1);
