(312010, 22767, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is a cool idea, and very well done, I love the different shades of grey... from deepwhite to dark black.  looks like either your cropped a whole bunch or you sharpened a lot, because of the sides on the pen.  but it''s pretty nice looking... I also like the lighting... -8-</td>', 'This is a cool idea, and very well done, I love the different shades of grey... from deepwhite to dark black.  looks like either your cropped a whole bunch or you sharpened a lot, because of the sides on the pen.  but it''s pretty nice looking... I also like the lighting... -8-', '2003-06-01 22:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(312012, 22284, 5351, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait.  Very beautiful subject.  well composed and lighting and dof is outstanding.  good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Excellent portrait.  Very beautiful subject.  well composed and lighting and dof is outstanding.  good luck in the challenge!', '2003-06-01 22:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(312016, 22698, 5351, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus and tones on this.  I like the reflection.  I do think however that the lighting on the top half of the ball is a bit harsh and would experiment with different lighting.  Good effort!</td>', 'Excellent focus and tones on this.  I like the reflection.  I do think however that the lighting on the top half of the ball is a bit harsh and would experiment with different lighting.  Good effort!', '2003-06-01 22:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(312024, 22463, 5351, '<td valign="top">Awesome Photo!  Really made me smile:)  Great composition.  Am very impressed with the lighting - I think it is amazing how you were able to light both subjects so well simultaneously.  Good tones, meets challenge very well.  Good background and border choices as well.  Very, very high score!</td>', 'Awesome Photo!  Really made me smile:)  Great composition.  Am very impressed with the lighting - I think it is amazing how you were able to light both subjects so well simultaneously.  Good tones, meets challenge very well.  Good background and border choices as well.  Very, very high score!', '2003-06-01 22:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(312027, 22683, 5351, '<td valign="top">This is definately one of my favorites this challenge!  Great job.  I think you may get comments that there is too much negative space, but I think it really works here.  great focus and contrast.  Good luck in the challenge:)</td>', 'This is definately one of my favorites this challenge!  Great job.  I think you may get comments that there is too much negative space, but I think it really works here.  great focus and contrast.  Good luck in the challenge:)', '2003-06-01 22:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(312030, 22680, 5351, '<td valign="top">Extremely good focus and composition.  definately meets challenge.  (Not my favorite subject personally, but am not considering that in my voting because this is an incredibly well done photograph, lol!).  Excellent border selection and background.  Good job - good luck in the challenge:)</td>', 'Extremely good focus and composition.  definately meets challenge.  (Not my favorite subject personally, but am not considering that in my voting because this is an incredibly well done photograph, lol!).  Excellent border selection and background.  Good job - good luck in the challenge:)', '2003-06-01 22:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(312034, 22627, 5351, '<td valign="top">Amazing photo.</td>', 'Amazing photo.', '2003-06-01 22:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(312035, 22145, 5351, '<td valign="top">Very touching photograph nicely done.</td>', 'Very touching photograph nicely done.', '2003-06-01 22:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(312050, 22500, 5351, '<td valign="top">Really nice.  Great job on the tones and focus.</td>', 'Really nice.  Great job on the tones and focus.', '2003-06-01 22:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(312055, 22744, 5351, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photograph.  Very touching.  Excellent composition, focus and tones.  definately meets challenge. High score:)</td>', 'Wonderful photograph.  Very touching.  Excellent composition, focus and tones.  definately meets challenge. High score:)', '2003-06-01 22:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(312060, 22750, 5351, '<td valign="top">What a great shot!  Excellent work:)</td>', 'What a great shot!  Excellent work:)', '2003-06-01 22:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(312068, 22082, 5351, '<td valign="top">Beautiful place excellently photographed!  Very good eye.  Nicely cropped and great focus and contrast for a duotone photograph.  Gerat job:)</td>', 'Beautiful place excellently photographed!  Very good eye.  Nicely cropped and great focus and contrast for a duotone photograph.  Gerat job:)', '2003-06-01 22:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(312126, 22695, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice bridges always seem to photograph well...maybe I''ll start a Rant thread about all the "bridge photos" in every challenge...well maybe not -- it would discourage nice stuff like this.</td>', 'Nice bridges always seem to photograph well...maybe I''ll start a Rant thread about all the "bridge photos" in every challenge...well maybe not -- it would discourage nice stuff like this.', '2003-06-01 23:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(312132, 22732, 1031, '<td valign="top">Or the Guitartst''s Head?</td>', 'Or the Guitartst''s Head?', '2003-06-01 23:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(312134, 22777, 1031, '<td valign="top">Too bad the fog isn''t a bit thicker over by the top of the far bluff, hiding the more ordinary buildings. I like the composition and lighting; I''d probably have played with contrast and color combos, but have nothing definite in mind which would improve it.</td>', 'Too bad the fog isn''t a bit thicker over by the top of the far bluff, hiding the more ordinary buildings. I like the composition and lighting; I''d probably have played with contrast and color combos, but have nothing definite in mind which would improve it.', '2003-06-01 23:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(312136, 22458, 1031, '<td valign="top">Remember, John Ashcroft is watching YOU.</td>', 'Remember, John Ashcroft is watching YOU.', '2003-06-01 23:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(312139, 22657, 4805, '<td valign="top">Beautiful abstract! I really like this one. The patterns of grey extending from the left are very nice, and add depth and texture to the image. Nice.</td>', 'Beautiful abstract! I really like this one. The patterns of grey extending from the left are very nice, and add depth and texture to the image. Nice.', '2003-06-01 23:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(312140, 22777, 6900, '<td valign="top">What a great place!  The fog/mist rising up is great and the dark vs light works well here.   It seems a little low contrast - like there are no real blacks in here...maybe?</td>', 'What a great place!  The fog/mist rising up is great and the dark vs light works well here.   It seems a little low contrast - like there are no real blacks in here...maybe?', '2003-06-01 23:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(312141, 22305, 4805, '<td valign="top">Very nice range of tones, well metered.</td>', 'Very nice range of tones, well metered.', '2003-06-01 23:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(312142, 22782, 7711, '<td valign="top">great contrast and lines! I like this shot, but without the sky, I would have cropped that out for a more abstract sort of composition that really drew the eyes to the roots and their lovely twisted curves. :)</td>', 'great contrast and lines! I like this shot, but without the sky, I would have cropped that out for a more abstract sort of composition that really drew the eyes to the roots and their lovely twisted curves. :)', '2003-06-01 23:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(312143, 22705, 8530, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous shot, but I would have picked a slightly different shade -- this one is somewhat sickly -- for the sepia. Perhaps a less intense one.</td>', 'This is a gorgeous shot, but I would have picked a slightly different shade -- this one is somewhat sickly -- for the sepia. Perhaps a less intense one.', '2003-06-01 23:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(312144, 22658, 6900, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition - they feel off centered JUST to be off-center, and not violate any rule of thirds and "don''t center the subject" rules - what about a diagonal composition for this?  That way there''s no question about it?  7</td>', 'Interesting composition - they feel off centered JUST to be off-center, and not violate any rule of thirds and "don''t center the subject" rules - what about a diagonal composition for this?  That way there''s no question about it?  7', '2003-06-01 23:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(312145, 22637, 8530, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice. Light and shadow, white and black, and the grey for neutrality. It looks like you have a couple little pixel artifacts up in the right corner but aside from that this is perfect.</td>', 'Very, very nice. Light and shadow, white and black, and the grey for neutrality. It looks like you have a couple little pixel artifacts up in the right corner but aside from that this is perfect.', '2003-06-01 23:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(312146, 22708, 7711, '<td valign="top">nice compositon and good reflection. I can''t say this would be my first choice for a bw as often these sorts of landscape shots have breathtaking colour. That said, you have a good range of tones and its a good shot. :)</td>', 'nice compositon and good reflection. I can''t say this would be my first choice for a bw as often these sorts of landscape shots have breathtaking colour. That said, you have a good range of tones and its a good shot. :)', '2003-06-01 23:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(312147, 22752, 1031, '<td valign="top">This is most excellently done if only two colors (would like a copy of your Duotone setup if you use Photoshop), but doesn''t really have the "feel" of a "traditional" duotone.<br/>Hope that was a non-toxic pen!</td>', 'This is most excellently done if only two colors (would like a copy of your Duotone setup if you use Photoshop), but doesn''t really have the "feel" of a "traditional" duotone.Hope that was a non-toxic pen!', '2003-06-01 23:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(312148, 22450, 8530, '<td valign="top">I admit to being prejudiced in favor of churches, which helps. This looks interesting in grayscale, but I think a higher light level (or a brightness adjustment) would have been nicer.</td>', 'I admit to being prejudiced in favor of churches, which helps. This looks interesting in grayscale, but I think a higher light level (or a brightness adjustment) would have been nicer.', '2003-06-01 23:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(312150, 22620, 7711, '<td valign="top">I''d lose the heavy border because it is distracting from an otherwise wonderful shot. I love the portrait-style presentation and the crop which focusses our attention on the mouth and nose of this horse. The textures of the field are also wonderfully lit.</td>', 'I''d lose the heavy border because it is distracting from an otherwise wonderful shot. I love the portrait-style presentation and the crop which focusses our attention on the mouth and nose of this horse. The textures of the field are also wonderfully lit.', '2003-06-01 23:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(312151, 22732, 8530, '<td valign="top">Inasmuch as the tone on this is good, the choice of focus does nothing for me. Either more on the guitarist, or a different angle showing more of the guitar, would have been preferable to me.</td>', 'Inasmuch as the tone on this is good, the choice of focus does nothing for me. Either more on the guitarist, or a different angle showing more of the guitar, would have been preferable to me.', '2003-06-01 23:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(312152, 22462, 8530, '<td valign="top">This looks very good in duotone, is nice and crisp and sharp, and is even interesting. Good job.</td>', 'This looks very good in duotone, is nice and crisp and sharp, and is even interesting. Good job.', '2003-06-01 23:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(312154, 22784, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like playing with unusual duotone colors, but I don''t think this quite works unless you''re planning to look at it under a "black-light" at a rock concert...</td>', 'I like playing with unusual duotone colors, but I don''t think this quite works unless you''re planning to look at it under a "black-light" at a rock concert...', '2003-06-01 23:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(312155, 22194, 6900, '<td valign="top">Just a wonderful shot - too similar to the triptych from not long ago to be spectacular, though.  Great shot!</td>', 'Just a wonderful shot - too similar to the triptych from not long ago to be spectacular, though.  Great shot!', '2003-06-01 23:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(312156, 22248, 811, '<td valign="top">I attribute this to artistic license, but it doesn''t do anything for me, sorry.  I think maybe if it was a little less red, and showed some contrast it might be a little better.   Also, a touch more focus is needed, especially on the nose area.</td>', 'I attribute this to artistic license, but it doesn''t do anything for me, sorry.  I think maybe if it was a little less red, and showed some contrast it might be a little better.   Also, a touch more focus is needed, especially on the nose area.', '2003-06-01 23:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(312157, 22401, 8530, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful shot, and a subject not many people would have thought of. The sepia-toning is done well (maybe a little too intense to give an ''old photo'' look but it suits the shot anyhow), the lighting is excellent.</td>', 'This is a wonderful shot, and a subject not many people would have thought of. The sepia-toning is done well (maybe a little too intense to give an ''old photo'' look but it suits the shot anyhow), the lighting is excellent.', '2003-06-01 23:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(312159, 22667, 811, '<td valign="top">That''s cool how just the shoes are visible.  I think I like this more after looking at it again.</td>', 'That''s cool how just the shoes are visible.  I think I like this more after looking at it again.', '2003-06-01 23:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(312160, 22726, 8530, '<td valign="top">This looks to be a full-color shot. Although the choice of subject matter did give it a basically duotone look, I don''t think it quite meets the point of the challenge.</td>', 'This looks to be a full-color shot. Although the choice of subject matter did give it a basically duotone look, I don''t think it quite meets the point of the challenge.', '2003-06-01 23:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(312162, 22463, 1031, '<td valign="top">I don''t know...the one with the big ears looks pretty guilty to me...</td>', 'I don''t know...the one with the big ears looks pretty guilty to me...', '2003-06-01 23:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(312164, 22747, 811, '<td valign="top">I like how this has an "old" look to it.  I think more of an amber would be better though.  The yellow seems to be causing some details to blow out, especially on the left side windows.</td>', 'I like how this has an "old" look to it.  I think more of an amber would be better though.  The yellow seems to be causing some details to blow out, especially on the left side windows.', '2003-06-01 23:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(312166, 22257, 8530, '<td valign="top">Heh, interesting shirt, given the topic; I''ll assume that was deliberately. Definitely different, my only real objection being so far as I know crime photos are taken in color for various reasons, although I suppose B&amp;W establishing shots might be realistic.</td>', 'Heh, interesting shirt, given the topic; I''ll assume that was deliberately. Definitely different, my only real objection being so far as I know crime photos are taken in color for various reasons, although I suppose B&W establishing shots might be realistic.', '2003-06-01 23:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(312167, 22757, 811, '<td valign="top">I think a different angle/perspective would have added some interest to this shot.  It seems a bit static as it is.</td>', 'I think a different angle/perspective would have added some interest to this shot.  It seems a bit static as it is.', '2003-06-01 23:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(312168, 22786, 8530, '<td valign="top">Wow. An outhouse! I haven''t seen one of those in ages, and it seems entirely apropos for a sepia-toned picture. This would make a bizarre but interesting postcard.</td>', 'Wow. An outhouse! I haven''t seen one of those in ages, and it seems entirely apropos for a sepia-toned picture. This would make a bizarre but interesting postcard.', '2003-06-01 23:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(312169, 22335, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the alternating "rose" white "rose" white effect.  Maybe if it had something in the foreground to break up the scenery it would been more interesting for me.</td>', 'I like the alternating "rose" white "rose" white effect.  Maybe if it had something in the foreground to break up the scenery it would been more interesting for me.', '2003-06-01 23:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(312170, 22057, 8530, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s the shade of yellow or maybe it''s the overall lighting, but this seems too bright despite the number of dark objects in it.</td>', 'Maybe it''s the shade of yellow or maybe it''s the overall lighting, but this seems too bright despite the number of dark objects in it.', '2003-06-01 23:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(312172, 22689, 8530, '<td valign="top">Nice setup, and well-suited for B&amp;W. Good lighting.</td>', 'Nice setup, and well-suited for B&W. Good lighting.', '2003-06-01 23:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(312173, 22317, 811, '<td valign="top">I think this shot could be made even more interesting and dynamic by using a different perspective or angle.  Maybe a lower one.  It is so centered it feels static to me.</td>', 'I think this shot could be made even more interesting and dynamic by using a different perspective or angle.  Maybe a lower one.  It is so centered it feels static to me.', '2003-06-01 23:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(312174, 22395, 1031, '<td valign="top">Not often you get a foreground plainer than the sky...good choice of setup and exposure.</td>', 'Not often you get a foreground plainer than the sky...good choice of setup and exposure.', '2003-06-01 23:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(312175, 22696, 8530, '<td valign="top">Neat; I like the blue tone. Something about the staging of the glass seems odd but unfortunately I can''t quite put my finger on it.</td>', 'Neat; I like the blue tone. Something about the staging of the glass seems odd but unfortunately I can''t quite put my finger on it.', '2003-06-01 23:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(312177, 22790, 8530, '<td valign="top">I like the graininess effect. It''s interesting in B&amp;W; I''m curious how it''d look in sepia -- did you consider that instead?</td>', 'I like the graininess effect. It''s interesting in B&W; I''m curious how it''d look in sepia -- did you consider that instead?', '2003-06-01 23:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(312178, 22458, 8530, '<td valign="top">Strange subject choice for a sepia tone, or maybe strange tone choice for the subject matter. Pure B&amp;W or something with an ominous green or red might have grabbed my interest more. Nice Grey, though.</td>', 'Strange subject choice for a sepia tone, or maybe strange tone choice for the subject matter. Pure B&W or something with an ominous green or red might have grabbed my interest more. Nice Grey, though.', '2003-06-01 23:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(312179, 22768, 7711, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of this shot, but I feel there are simply too many elements in the shot to focus our attention. Good tones, lighting and focus however. :)</td>', 'I like the feel of this shot, but I feel there are simply too many elements in the shot to focus our attention. Good tones, lighting and focus however. :)', '2003-06-01 23:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(312182, 22787, 7711, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. I would have cropped out the bottom logs though, they are not adding to the composition in my opinion, as well, there seems to be a decided lack of "noise" in the shot..I would have liked more texture in the nature surrounding the falls.</td>', 'Nice capture. I would have cropped out the bottom logs though, they are not adding to the composition in my opinion, as well, there seems to be a decided lack of "noise" in the shot..I would have liked more texture in the nature surrounding the falls.', '2003-06-01 23:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(312183, 22618, 8530, '<td valign="top">Bueno! I think this is the only silhoutte picture I have seen; a marvelous choice of setup. Utensils don''t terribly interest me, but in this case subject matter seems secondary to meeting the challenge and the good use of lighting.</td>', 'Bueno! I think this is the only silhoutte picture I have seen; a marvelous choice of setup. Utensils don''t terribly interest me, but in this case subject matter seems secondary to meeting the challenge and the good use of lighting.', '2003-06-01 23:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(312184, 22451, 7711, '<td valign="top">great leading lines! I like this composition where the one side is dark and other fades into the fog. nicely done.</td>', 'great leading lines! I like this composition where the one side is dark and other fades into the fog. nicely done.', '2003-06-01 23:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(312185, 22665, 326, '<td valign="top">Great shot.... I love everything about it!</td>', 'Great shot.... I love everything about it!', '2003-06-01 23:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(312186, 22625, 8530, '<td valign="top">I hate to not leave a comment when I vote, but this really doesn''t grab me and I can''t much explain why.</td>', 'I hate to not leave a comment when I vote, but this really doesn''t grab me and I can''t much explain why.', '2003-06-01 23:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(312187, 22728, 7711, '<td valign="top">crop a bit off the right and I think the composition would be a little more striking. Good lighting on it though. :)</td>', 'crop a bit off the right and I think the composition would be a little more striking. Good lighting on it though. :)', '2003-06-01 23:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(312188, 22697, 8530, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle, but the topic matter doesn''t grab me much. It meets the challenge, but that''s about all.<br/> <br/>Oh, small grammar nit: "its", not "it''s". (No effect on score, certainly, but it''s one of my pet peeves.)</td>', 'Interesting angle, but the topic matter doesn''t grab me much. It meets the challenge, but that''s about all. Oh, small grammar nit: "its", not "it''s". (No effect on score, certainly, but it''s one of my pet peeves.)', '2003-06-01 23:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(312189, 22691, 8530, '<td valign="top">I like this as an abstract piece, which itself is odd as I don''t care for abstracts as a rule. It works well in B&amp;W.</td>', 'I like this as an abstract piece, which itself is odd as I don''t care for abstracts as a rule. It works well in B&W.', '2003-06-01 23:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(312190, 22614, 326, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! I like all of the lines in this image. Great color also!</td>', 'Nice shot! I like all of the lines in this image. Great color also!', '2003-06-01 23:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(312191, 22049, 8530, '<td valign="top">Interesting rock striation, but I think a dark/light pattern would have suited better. I do like the lighting overall, how it fades into shadows off-center, though.</td>', 'Interesting rock striation, but I think a dark/light pattern would have suited better. I do like the lighting overall, how it fades into shadows off-center, though.', '2003-06-01 23:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(312192, 22770, 8530, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good use of lighting.</td>', 'Nice shot, good use of lighting.', '2003-06-01 23:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(312193, 22614, 8530, '<td valign="top">It''s very nice to see something besides the majority B&amp;W and sepia tones, and this looks very interesting in purple. It''s also a good flora shot.</td>', 'It''s very nice to see something besides the majority B&W and sepia tones, and this looks very interesting in purple. It''s also a good flora shot.', '2003-06-02 00:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(312194, 22618, 326, '<td valign="top">Nice clean even shot! Great lighting.</td>', 'Nice clean even shot! Great lighting.', '2003-06-02 00:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(312195, 22736, 8530, '<td valign="top">Mmm. Vodka. As everyone knows, vodka is best experienced when frozen, making your colour choice absolutely perfect as it is reminiscent of ice. I am not sure if it would have worked better against a dark background or not -- the bottle does stand out, if not as much as I would have thought. I think a little less blue-tone shadow/refaction on the left center edge would have made it stand out better as well.</td>', 'Mmm. Vodka. As everyone knows, vodka is best experienced when frozen, making your colour choice absolutely perfect as it is reminiscent of ice. I am not sure if it would have worked better against a dark background or not -- the bottle does stand out, if not as much as I would have thought. I think a little less blue-tone shadow/refaction on the left center edge would have made it stand out better as well.', '2003-06-02 00:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(312196, 22751, 7711, '<td valign="top">this is fabulous. I love the excess of signs and the perspective on this store. It looks as if the thing is tilting over too. :)</td>', 'this is fabulous. I love the excess of signs and the perspective on this store. It looks as if the thing is tilting over too. :)', '2003-06-02 00:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
