(313034, 22793, 8367, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments.  Well...we will call this one a learning experience. To be honest, It didn''t sink in that this was a picture of a picture. I spent hours on the restoration of this photo of my aunt and thought, "What a nice memorial to her", seeing as it was Memorial Day. Just thought I''d explain a little. Again, the comments are appreciated. I, obviously, have lots to work on.</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments.  Well...we will call this one a learning experience. To be honest, It didn''t sink in that this was a picture of a picture. I spent hours on the restoration of this photo of my aunt and thought, "What a nice memorial to her", seeing as it was Memorial Day. Just thought I''d explain a little. Again, the comments are appreciated. I, obviously, have lots to work on.', '2003-06-02 16:55:37.000000', NULL, 0),
